s/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/task-scheduler/TaskScheduler.ts) - 智能任务编排和执行\\n> - 🚧 GitOps工作流: 基础CI/CD已建立，高级GitOps功能待完善\\n> - ❌ 配置即代码: Terraform、Pulumi等IaC工具尚未集成\\n> - ❌ 自动化运维: 自愈和自管理功能尚未完全实现\\n\",\"originTextLength\":422,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767645976907},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1016,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1117,\"character\":83}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1016,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1117,\"character\":83}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"---\\\\n\\\\n## 📊 实现状态总览\\\\n\\\\n### ✅ 已实现的核心功能\\\\n\\\\n| 模块 | 功能 | 文件路径 | 状态 |\\\\n|------|------|----------|------|\\\\n| **AI系统** | AI代理管理 | [AgentManager.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/ai/AgentManager.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **AI系统** | 基础代理 | [BaseAgent.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/ai/BaseAgent.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **AI系统** | 自主AI引擎 | [AutonomousAIEngine.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/autonomous-ai-widget/AutonomousAIEngine.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **AI分析** | AI分析引擎 | [AIAnalyticsEngine.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/AIAnalyticsEngine.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **AI分析** | 异常检测 | [AnomalyDetection.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/AnomalyDetection.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **AI分析** | 预测分析 | [PredictiveAnalytics.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/PredictiveAnalytics.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **AI分析** | 实时仪表板 | [RealTimeAIDashboard.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/RealTimeAIDashboard.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **性能优化** | 优化引擎 | [OptimizationEngine.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/performance/OptimizationEngine.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **性能优化** | 缓存层 | [CacheLayer.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/cache/CacheLayer.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **安全** | 综合安全中心 | [ComprehensiveSecurityCenter.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/security/ComprehensiveSecurityCenter.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **安全** | 错误处理 | [ErrorHandler.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/error-handler/ErrorHandler.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **安全** | 错误边界 | [ErrorBoundary.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/error-handler/ErrorBoundary.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **架构** | 消息总线 | [MessageBus.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/message-bus/MessageBus.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **架构** | 事件分发器 | [EventDispatcher.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/event-dispatcher/EventDispatcher.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **架构** | 插件化系统 | [index.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/pluggable/index.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **部署** | 分阶段实施 | [PhasedImplementation.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/deployment/PhasedImplementation.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **部署** | 任务调度器 | [TaskScheduler.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/task-scheduler/TaskScheduler.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **监控** | 闭环指标 | [ClosedLoopMetrics.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/closed-loop/metrics/ClosedLoopMetrics.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n| **监控** | 行业指标 | [IndustryMetrics.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/closed-loop/metrics/IndustryMetrics.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\\\n\\\\n### 🚧 部分实现的功能\\\\n\\\\n| 模块 | 功能 | 文件路径 | 待完善内容 |\\\\n|------|------|----------|-----------|\\\\n| **架构** | 微服务架构 | - | 服务发现、配置管理、负载均衡 |\\\\n| **架构** | CQRS模式 | - | 命令查询分离、事件溯源 |\\\\n| **性能** | 数据库优化 | - | 高级索引、分片策略、查询优化 |\\\\n| **AI** | 自然语言处理 | - | 高级NLP功能、语义理解、对话系统 |\\\\n| **安全** | 零信任架构 | - | 微隔离、威胁检测、响应自动化 |\\\\n| **监控** | 分布式追踪 | - | 高级追踪功能、上下文传播 |\\\\n| **监控** | 指标监控 | - | 高级告警、预测分析、自动化响应 |\\\\n| **部署** | GitOps工作流 | - | 配置即代码、自动化运维 |\\\\n\\\\n### ❌ 未实现的功能\\\\n\\\\n| 模块 | 功能 | 优先级 | 建议实现时间 |\\\\n|------|------|--------|--------------|\\\\n| **算法** | 高性能算法引擎 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\\\n| **算法** | 智能数据结构 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\\\n| **性能** | 网络优化 | 低 | Q3 2025 |\\\\n| **性能** | 内容分发优化 | 低 | Q3 2025 |\\\\n| **AI** | 语音处理引擎 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\\\n| **安全** | 威胁检测与响应 | 高 | Q1 2025 |\\\\n| **监控** | 日志聚合 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\\\n| **部署** | 配置即代码 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\\\n| **部署** | 自动化运维 | 高 | Q1 2025 |\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🎯 优先级建议\\\\n\\\\n### 🔴 高优先级（Q1 2025）\\\\n\\\\n1. **威胁检测与响应系统**\\\\n   - 实现异常检测算法\\\\n   - 集成威胁情报源\\\\n   - 建立自动化响应机制\\\\n\\\\n2. **自动化运维系统**\\\\n   - 实现自愈机制\\\\n   - 建立自动化监控和告警\\\\n   - 实现故障自动恢复\\\\n\\\\n### 🟡 中优先级（Q2 2025）\\\\n\\\\n3. **自然语言处理增强**\\\\n   - 实现高级NLP功能\\\\n   - 建立语义理解系统\\\\n   - 完善对话系统\\\\n\\\\n4. **配置即代码**\\\\n   - 集成Terraform/Pulumi\\\\n   - 实现基础设施自动化\\\\n   - 建立配置管理流程\\\\n\\\\n5. **日志聚合系统**\\\\n   - 集成ELK/Loki等日志系统\\\\n   - 实现日志分析和搜索\\\\n   - 建立日志告警机制\\\\n\\\\n6. **高性能算法引擎**\\\\n   - 实现分布式排序算法\\\\n   - 建立实时搜索系统\\\\n   - 集成机器学习算法\\\\n\\\\n### 🟢 低优先级（Q3 2025）\\\\n\\\\n7. **网络优化**\\\\n   - 实现HTTP/2优化\\\\n   - 集成QUIC协议\\\\n   - 优化TCP参数\\\\n\\\\n8. **内容分发优化**\\\\n   - 集成CDN服务\\\\n   - 实现边缘计算\\\\n   - 优化内容压缩\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 📝 实施建议\\\\n\\\\n### 1. 分阶段实施策略\\\\n\\\\n- **第一阶段（Q1 2025）**: 完善核心安全和运维功能\\\\n- **第二阶段（Q2 2025）**: 增强AI能力和基础设施自动化\\\\n- **第三阶段（Q3 2025）**: 优化性能和用户体验\\\\n\\\\n### 2. 技术选型建议\\\\n\\\\n- **威胁检测**: 集成Elastic Security、Splunk SIEM\\\\n- **自动化运维**: 使用Ansible、Terraform、Kubernetes Operator\\\\n- **NLP增强**: 集成OpenAI GPT、Hugging Face Transformers\\\\n- **日志聚合**: 使用ELK Stack、Loki、Grafana\\\\n- **CDN**: 集成Cloudflare、AWS CloudFront\\\\n\\\\n### 3. 团队协作建议\\\\n\\\\n- 建立跨功能团队负责不同模块\\\\n- 实施代码审查和自动化测试\\\\n- 建立持续集成和持续部署流程\\\\n- 定期进行技术评审和架构评审\\\\n\\\\n这个核心技术指导体系为YYC³智能外呼平台提供了坚实的技术基础，确保系统在性能、安全、可扩展性等方面达到业界领先水平。通过持续完善和优化，将逐步实现技术闭环生态系统。\",\"originAcceptText\":\"---\\n\\n## 📊 实现状态总览\\n\\n### ✅ 已实现的核心功能\\n\\n| 模块 | 功能 | 文件路径 | 状态 |\\n|------|------|----------|------|\\n| **AI系统** | AI代理管理 | [AgentManager.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/ai/AgentManager.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **AI系统** | 基础代理 | [BaseAgent.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/ai/BaseAgent.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **AI系统** | 自主AI引擎 | [AutonomousAIEngine.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/autonomous-ai-widget/AutonomousAIEngine.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **AI分析** | AI分析引擎 | [AIAnalyticsEngine.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/AIAnalyticsEngine.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **AI分析** | 异常检测 | [AnomalyDetection.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/AnomalyDetection.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **AI分析** | 预测分析 | [PredictiveAnalytics.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/PredictiveAnalytics.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **AI分析** | 实时仪表板 | [RealTimeAIDashboard.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/analytics/RealTimeAIDashboard.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **性能优化** | 优化引擎 | [OptimizationEngine.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/performance/OptimizationEngine.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **性能优化** | 缓存层 | [CacheLayer.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/cache/CacheLayer.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **安全** | 综合安全中心 | [ComprehensiveSecurityCenter.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/security/ComprehensiveSecurityCenter.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **安全** | 错误处理 | [ErrorHandler.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/error-handler/ErrorHandler.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **安全** | 错误边界 | [ErrorBoundary.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/error-handler/ErrorBoundary.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **架构** | 消息总线 | [MessageBus.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/message-bus/MessageBus.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **架构** | 事件分发器 | [EventDispatcher.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/event-dispatcher/EventDispatcher.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **架构** | 插件化系统 | [index.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/pluggable/index.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **部署** | 分阶段实施 | [PhasedImplementation.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/deployment/PhasedImplementation.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **部署** | 任务调度器 | [TaskScheduler.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/task-scheduler/TaskScheduler.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **监控** | 闭环指标 | [ClosedLoopMetrics.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/closed-loop/metrics/ClosedLoopMetrics.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n| **监控** | 行业指标 | [IndustryMetrics.ts](file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/closed-loop/metrics/IndustryMetrics.ts) | ✅ 完整 |\\n\\n### 🚧 部分实现的功能\\n\\n| 模块 | 功能 | 文件路径 | 待完善内容 |\\n|------|------|----------|-----------|\\n| **架构** | 微服务架构 | - | 服务发现、配置管理、负载均衡 |\\n| **架构** | CQRS模式 | - | 命令查询分离、事件溯源 |\\n| **性能** | 数据库优化 | - | 高级索引、分片策略、查询优化 |\\n| **AI** | 自然语言处理 | - | 高级NLP功能、语义理解、对话系统 |\\n| **安全** | 零信任架构 | - | 微隔离、威胁检测、响应自动化 |\\n| **监控** | 分布式追踪 | - | 高级追踪功能、上下文传播 |\\n| **监控** | 指标监控 | - | 高级告警、预测分析、自动化响应 |\\n| **部署** | GitOps工作流 | - | 配置即代码、自动化运维 |\\n\\n### ❌ 未实现的功能\\n\\n| 模块 | 功能 | 优先级 | 建议实现时间 |\\n|------|------|--------|--------------|\\n| **算法** | 高性能算法引擎 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\n| **算法** | 智能数据结构 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\n| **性能** | 网络优化 | 低 | Q3 2025 |\\n| **性能** | 内容分发优化 | 低 | Q3 2025 |\\n| **AI** | 语音处理引擎 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\n| **安全** | 威胁检测与响应 | 高 | Q1 2025 |\\n| **监控** | 日志聚合 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\n| **部署** | 配置即代码 | 中 | Q2 2025 |\\n| **部署** | 自动化运维 | 高 | Q1 2025 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 优先级建议\\n\\n### 🔴 高优先级（Q1 2025）\\n\\n1. **威胁检测与响应系统**\\n   - 实现异常检测算法\\n   - 集成威胁情报源\\n   - 建立自动化响应机制\\n\\n2. **自动化运维系统**\\n   - 实现自愈机制\\n   - 建立自动化监控和告警\\n   - 实现故障自动恢复\\n\\n### 🟡 中优先级（Q2 2025）\\n\\n3. **自然语言处理增强**\\n   - 实现高级NLP功能\\n   - 建立语义理解系统\\n   - 完善对话系统\\n\\n4. **配置即代码**\\n   - 集成Terraform/Pulumi\\n   - 实现基础设施自动化\\n   - 建立配置管理流程\\n\\n5. **日志聚合系统**\\n   - 集成ELK/Loki等日志系统\\n   - 实现日志分析和搜索\\n   - 建立日志告警机制\\n\\n6. **高性能算法引擎**\\n   - 实现分布式排序算法\\n   - 建立实时搜索系统\\n   - 集成机器学习算法\\n\\n### 🟢 低优先级（Q3 2025）\\n\\n7. **网络优化**\\n   - 实现HTTP/2优化\\n   - 集成QUIC协议\\n   - 优化TCP参数\\n\\n8. **内容分发优化**\\n   - 集成CDN服务\\n   - 实现边缘计算\\n   - 优化内容压缩\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📝 实施建议\\n\\n### 1. 分阶段实施策略\\n\\n- **第一阶段（Q1 2025）**: 完善核心安全和运维功能\\n- **第二阶段（Q2 2025）**: 增强AI能力和基础设施自动化\\n- **第三阶段（Q3 2025）**: 优化性能和用户体验\\n\\n### 2. 技术选型建议\\n\\n- **威胁检测**: 集成Elastic Security、Splunk SIEM\\n- **自动化运维**: 使用Ansible、Terraform、Kubernetes Operator\\n- **NLP增强**: 集成OpenAI GPT、Hugging Face Transformers\\n- **日志聚合**: 使用ELK Stack、Loki、Grafana\\n- **CDN**: 集成Cloudflare、AWS CloudFront\\n\\n### 3. 团队协作建议\\n\\n- 建立跨功能团队负责不同模块\\n- 实施代码审查和自动化测试\\n- 建立持续集成和持续部署流程\\n- 定期进行技术评审和架构评审\\n\\n这个核心技术指导体系为YYC³智能外呼平台提供了坚实的技术基础，确保系统在性能、安全、可扩展性等方面达到业界领先水平。通过持续完善和优化，将逐步实现技术闭环生态系统。\",\"originTextLength\":4590,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767646002150}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/docs/YYC3-MovAISys-%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/08-YYC3-MovAISys-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E8%AE%A1%E5%88%92.md": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":534,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":534,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"# YYC³ 核心技术实现计划\\\\n\\\\n> **创建日期**: 2026-01-06\\\\n> **文档版本**: 1.0.0\\\\n> **负责人**: YYC³ 开发团队\\\\n\\\\n## 📋 概述\\\\n\\\\n本文档基于[核心技术深度指导](./07-YYC3-MovAISys-代码文档-核心技术深度指导.md)中识别的功能模块，制定了详细的实现计划。计划按照优先级分为三个阶段，确保系统逐步完善和优化。\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🎯 实施策略\\\\n\\\\n### 分阶段实施原则\\\\n\\\\n1. **高优先级优先**: 先实现核心安全和运维功能，确保系统稳定性和安全性\\\\n2. **渐进式交付**: 每个阶段完成后进行测试和验证，确保质量\\\\n3. **技术选型优先**: 在实施前完成技术调研和选型，避免返工\\\\n4. **团队协作**: 建立跨功能团队，确保各模块之间的协调和集成\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🔴 第一阶段（Q1 2025）：核心安全和运维功能\\\\n\\\\n### 1.1 威胁检测与响应系统\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 建立全面的威胁检测和自动化响应机制\\\\n\\\\n#### 1.1.1 异常检测算法\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 机器学习框架: TensorFlow / PyTorch\\\\n- 异常检测算法: Isolation Forest, One-Class SVM, Autoencoder\\\\n- 实时处理: Apache Flink / Apache Kafka Streams\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计异常检测架构\\\\n2. 实现数据收集和预处理模块\\\\n3. 训练和部署异常检测模型\\\\n4. 建立实时检测管道\\\\n5. 实现告警和通知机制\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 异常检测服务模块\\\\n- 模型训练和部署脚本\\\\n- 实时监控仪表板\\\\n- 告警配置文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 1.1.2 威胁情报集成\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 威胁情报源: AlienVault OTX, VirusTotal, MISP\\\\n- 数据存储: Elasticsearch / MongoDB\\\\n- API网关: Kong / API Gateway\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 集成威胁情报源API\\\\n2. 建立威胁情报数据库\\\\n3. 实现威胁情报更新机制\\\\n4. 开发威胁情报分析工具\\\\n5. 建立威胁情报共享机制\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 威胁情报集成模块\\\\n- 威胁情报数据库架构\\\\n- 威胁情报分析工具\\\\n- 集成文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n#### 1.1.3 自动化响应机制\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 编排工具: Ansible / SaltStack\\\\n- 工作流引擎: Apache Airflow / Argo Workflows\\\\n- 通知系统: PagerDuty / Opsgenie\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计响应流程和策略\\\\n2. 实现自动化响应脚本\\\\n3. 建立响应工作流\\\\n4. 集成通知系统\\\\n5. 测试和优化响应机制\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 自动化响应脚本库\\\\n- 响应工作流配置\\\\n- 通知集成模块\\\\n- 响应策略文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 10周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 1.2 自动化运维系统\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 实现智能自愈和自动化运维能力\\\\n\\\\n#### 1.2.1 自愈机制\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 监控系统: Prometheus + Grafana\\\\n- 告警管理: Alertmanager\\\\n- 自动化工具: Kubernetes Operator / Ansible\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计自愈策略和规则\\\\n2. 实现健康检查和故障检测\\\\n3. 开发自愈执行引擎\\\\n4. 建立自愈日志和审计\\\\n5. 测试和优化自愈机制\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 自愈引擎模块\\\\n- 自愈策略配置\\\\n- 健康检查脚本\\\\n- 自愈日志系统\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 1.2.2 自动化监控和告警\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 监控平台: Prometheus / Datadog\\\\n- 日志聚合: ELK Stack / Loki\\\\n- 告警路由: Alertmanager / PagerDuty\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计监控指标体系\\\\n2. 实现数据采集和存储\\\\n3. 建立告警规则和路由\\\\n4. 开发监控仪表板\\\\n5. 优化告警准确性和响应时间\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 监控指标定义\\\\n- 数据采集模块\\\\n- 告警规则配置\\\\n- 监控仪表板\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n#### 1.2.3 故障自动恢复\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 容器编排: Kubernetes\\\\n- 服务网格: Istio / Linkerd\\\\n- 备份恢复: Velero / Restic\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计故障恢复策略\\\\n2. 实现自动备份机制\\\\n3. 开发故障检测和恢复脚本\\\\n4. 建立恢复验证流程\\\\n5. 测试和优化恢复机制\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 自动备份系统\\\\n- 故障恢复脚本\\\\n- 恢复验证工具\\\\n- 恢复策略文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 10周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🟡 第二阶段（Q2 2025）：AI能力和基础设施自动化\\\\n\\\\n### 2.1 自然语言处理增强\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 建立高级NLP能力，提升AI交互体验\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.1 高级NLP功能\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- NLP框架: Hugging Face Transformers / spaCy\\\\n- 预训练模型: BERT, GPT, T5\\\\n- 向量数据库: Milvus / Pinecone\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计NLP功能架构\\\\n2. 集成预训练模型\\\\n3. 实现文本分析和处理\\\\n4. 开发NLP API接口\\\\n5. 优化性能和准确性\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- NLP服务模块\\\\n- 模型部署脚本\\\\n- API接口文档\\\\n- 性能测试报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.2 语义理解系统\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 知识图谱: Neo4j / Amazon Neptune\\\\n- 语义分析: OpenAI GPT / Anthropic Claude\\\\n- 向量搜索: FAISS / Milvus\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计语义理解架构\\\\n2. 构建领域知识图谱\\\\n3. 实现语义分析算法\\\\n4. 开发语义搜索功能\\\\n5. 优化理解准确性\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 语义理解引擎\\\\n- 知识图谱数据\\\\n- 语义搜索模块\\\\n- 理解准确度报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.3 对话系统\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 对话框架: Rasa / Microsoft Bot Framework\\\\n- 上下文管理: Redis / PostgreSQL\\\\n- 多轮对话: LangChain / AutoGPT\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计对话流程\\\\n2. 实现对话管理器\\\\n3. 开发意图识别和槽位填充\\\\n4. 建立上下文管理\\\\n5. 优化对话体验\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 对话管理引擎\\\\n- 意图识别模型\\\\n- 上下文管理模块\\\\n- 对话测试报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 12周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 2.2 配置即代码\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 实现基础设施自动化管理\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.2.1 Terraform/Pulumi集成\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- IaC工具: Terraform / Pulumi\\\\n- 云平台: AWS / Azure / GCP\\\\n- 状态管理: Terraform Cloud / Pulumi Cloud\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计基础设施架构\\\\n2. 编写Terraform/Pulumi配置\\\\n3. 建立模块化配置库\\\\n4. 实现自动化部署流程\\\\n5. 建立配置版本管理\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- Terraform/Pulumi配置文件\\\\n- 基础设施模块库\\\\n- 部署自动化脚本\\\\n- 配置管理文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.2.2 基础设施自动化\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 容器编排: Kubernetes\\\\n- CI/CD: GitLab CI / GitHub Actions\\\\n- 配置管理: Ansible / Chef\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计自动化流程\\\\n2. 实现CI/CD管道\\\\n3. 建立自动化测试\\\\n4. 开发配置管理工具\\\\n5. 优化自动化流程\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- CI/CD管道配置\\\\n- 自动化测试套件\\\\n- 配置管理工具\\\\n- 自动化流程文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.2.3 配置管理流程\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 配置存储: Git / Vault\\\\n- 配置验证: Conftest / OPA\\\\n- 配置同步: Consul / etcd\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计配置管理架构\\\\n2. 实现配置存储和同步\\\\n3. 建立配置验证机制\\\\n4. 开发配置变更管理\\\\n5. 优化配置管理流程\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 配置管理模块\\\\n- 配置验证工具\\\\n- 变更管理系统\\\\n- 配置管理文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 11周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 2.3 日志聚合系统\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 建立集中式日志管理和分析\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.3.1 ELK/Loki集成\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 日志平台: ELK Stack / Grafana Loki\\\\n- 日志采集: Filebeat / Fluentd\\\\n- 日志存储: Elasticsearch / Loki\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计日志架构\\\\n2. 部署日志平台\\\\n3. 配置日志采集\\\\n4. 建立日志索引和存储\\\\n5. 优化日志性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 日志平台部署配置\\\\n- 日志采集配置\\\\n- 日志索引策略\\\\n- 性能优化报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.3.2 日志分析和搜索\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 搜索引擎: Elasticsearch / OpenSearch\\\\n- 分析工具: Kibana / Grafana\\\\n- 查询语言: KQL / Lucene\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计日志分析功能\\\\n2. 实现日志搜索接口\\\\n3. 开发日志分析工具\\\\n4. 建立日志仪表板\\\\n5. 优化搜索性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 日志搜索模块\\\\n- 日志分析工具\\\\n- 日志仪表板\\\\n- 搜索性能报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.3.3 日志告警机制\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 告警引擎: ElastAlert / Loki Alertmanager\\\\n- 通知系统: PagerDuty / Slack\\\\n- 告警路由: Alertmanager\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计告警规则\\\\n2. 实现告警检测\\\\n3. 建立告警路由\\\\n4. 集成通知系统\\\\n5. 优化告警准确性\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 告警规则配置\\\\n- 告警检测模块\\\\n- 告警路由配置\\\\n- 告警准确性报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 2周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 8周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 2.4 高性能算法引擎\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 实现分布式算法和实时搜索\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.4.1 分布式排序算法\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 分布式计算: Apache Spark / Flink\\\\n- 排序算法: Timsort, QuickSort, MergeSort\\\\n- 数据分片: Hash Partitioning, Range Partitioning\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计分布式排序架构\\\\n2. 实现排序算法\\\\n3. 建立数据分片策略\\\\n4. 开发并行处理逻辑\\\\n5. 优化排序性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 分布式排序模块\\\\n- 排序算法实现\\\\n- 数据分片策略\\\\n- 性能测试报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.4.2 实时搜索系统\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 搜索引擎: Elasticsearch / OpenSearch\\\\n- 实时处理: Apache Kafka / Flink\\\\n- 向量搜索: Milvus / Pinecone\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计搜索架构\\\\n2. 实现实时索引\\\\n3. 开发搜索接口\\\\n4. 建立搜索优化\\\\n5. 测试搜索性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 实时搜索模块\\\\n- 索引配置\\\\n- 搜索API接口\\\\n- 性能测试报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.4.3 机器学习算法\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- ML框架: TensorFlow / PyTorch / Scikit-learn\\\\n- 模型训练: Kubeflow / MLflow\\\\n- 模型部署: TensorFlow Serving / TorchServe\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计ML算法架构\\\\n2. 实现算法模型\\\\n3. 建立训练流程\\\\n4. 开发模型部署\\\\n5. 优化模型性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- ML算法模块\\\\n- 模型训练脚本\\\\n- 模型部署配置\\\\n- 模型性能报告\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 12周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🟢 第三阶段（Q3 2025）：性能和用户体验优化\\\\n\\\\n### 3.1 网络优化\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 优化网络协议和传输性能\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.1 HTTP/2优化\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- Web服务器: Nginx / Caddy\\\\n- 反向代理: HAProxy / Envoy\\\\n- 性能监控: Lighthouse / WebPageTest\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计HTTP/2优化策略\\\\n2. 配置服务器支持HTTP/2\\\\n3. 实现连接复用\\\\n4. 优化资源加载\\\\n5. 测试性能提升\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- HTTP/2配置\\\\n- 性能优化报告\\\\n- 监控仪表板\\\\n- 最佳实践文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 2周\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.2 QUIC协议集成\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- QUIC实现: quiche / msquic\\\\n- 服务器: Nginx with QUIC / Caddy\\\\n- 客户端: Chrome / Firefox\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计QUIC集成方案\\\\n2. 配置服务器支持QUIC\\\\n3. 实现协议升级\\\\n4. 测试兼容性\\\\n5. 优化性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- QUIC配置\\\\n- 兼容性测试报告\\\\n- 性能对比报告\\\\n- 部署文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.3 TCP参数优化\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 内核调优: sysctl / tuned\\\\n- 网络监控: tcpdump / wireshark\\\\n- 性能分析: iperf / netperf\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 分析当前网络性能\\\\n2. 设计TCP参数优化方案\\\\n3. 实施参数调优\\\\n4. 监控性能变化\\\\n5. 优化和调整\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- TCP优化配置\\\\n- 性能分析报告\\\\n- 监控配置\\\\n- 优化文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 2周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 7周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n### 3.2 内容分发优化\\\\n\\\\n**目标**: 建立CDN和边缘计算能力\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.2.1 CDN集成\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- CDN服务: Cloudflare / AWS CloudFront / Fastly\\\\n- 缓存策略: Varnish / Nginx Cache\\\\n- 缓存失效: Fastly Purge / Cloudflare API\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 选择CDN服务商\\\\n2. 设计CDN架构\\\\n3. 配置CDN缓存策略\\\\n4. 实现缓存失效机制\\\\n5. 测试CDN性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- CDN配置\\\\n- 缓存策略文档\\\\n- 性能测试报告\\\\n- 运维手册\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.2.2 边缘计算\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 边缘平台: Cloudflare Workers / AWS Lambda@Edge\\\\n- 边缘存储: Cloudflare KV / AWS CloudFront Functions\\\\n- 边缘数据库: FaunaDB / PlanetScale\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 设计边缘计算架构\\\\n2. 开发边缘函数\\\\n3. 实现边缘数据处理\\\\n4. 建立边缘存储\\\\n5. 测试边缘性能\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 边缘函数代码\\\\n- 边缘存储配置\\\\n- 性能测试报告\\\\n- 部署文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.2.3 内容压缩优化\\\\n\\\\n**技术选型**:\\\\n- 压缩算法: Brotli / Gzip / Zstd\\\\n- 图片优化: ImageMagick / Sharp\\\\n- 视频优化: FFmpeg / AWS MediaConvert\\\\n\\\\n**实施步骤**:\\\\n1. 分析内容类型\\\\n2. 设计压缩策略\\\\n3. 实现压缩优化\\\\n4. 优化图片和视频\\\\n5. 测试压缩效果\\\\n\\\\n**交付物**:\\\\n- 压缩配置\\\\n- 优化脚本\\\\n- 性能对比报告\\\\n- 最佳实践文档\\\\n\\\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\\\n\\\\n**总时间估算**: 10周\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 📊 资源规划\\\\n\\\\n### 人员配置\\\\n\\\\n| 阶段 | 角色 | 人数 | 主要职责 |\\\\n|------|------|------|----------|\\\\n| Q1 2025 | 安全工程师 | 2 | 威胁检测、安全响应 |\\\\n| Q1 2025 | 运维工程师 | 2 | 自动化运维、自愈机制 |\\\\n| Q2 2025 | AI工程师 | 3 | NLP增强、对话系统 |\\\\n| Q2 2025 | DevOps工程师 | 2 | IaC、CI/CD |\\\\n| Q2 2025 | 数据工程师 | 2 | 日志聚合、数据分析 |\\\\n| Q2 2025 | 算法工程师 | 2 | 分布式算法、ML算法 |\\\\n| Q3 2025 | 网络工程师 | 1 | 网络优化、CDN |\\\\n| Q3 2025 | 性能工程师 | 1 | 性能优化、压缩 |\\\\n\\\\n### 技术栈总览\\\\n\\\\n| 类别 | 技术选型 |\\\\n|------|----------|\\\\n| **安全** | TensorFlow, Elastic Security, Ansible |\\\\n| **运维** | Kubernetes, Prometheus, Grafana |\\\\n| **AI** | Hugging Face, OpenAI GPT, Rasa |\\\\n| **DevOps** | Terraform, Pulumi, GitLab CI |\\\\n| **日志** | ELK Stack, Loki, Grafana |\\\\n| **算法** | Apache Spark, Elasticsearch, TensorFlow |\\\\n| **网络** | Nginx, Caddy, QUIC |\\\\n| **CDN** | Cloudflare, AWS CloudFront |\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🎯 成功指标\\\\n\\\\n### 第一阶段（Q1 2025）\\\\n\\\\n- 威胁检测准确率: > 95%\\\\n- 威胁响应时间: < 5分钟\\\\n- 系统自愈率: > 90%\\\\n- 监控覆盖率: 100%\\\\n\\\\n### 第二阶段（Q2 2025）\\\\n\\\\n- NLP理解准确率: > 90%\\\\n- 对话完成率: > 85%\\\\n- 基础设施自动化率: > 80%\\\\n- 日志检索时间: < 1秒\\\\n- 算法性能提升: > 50%\\\\n\\\\n### 第三阶段（Q3 2025）\\\\n\\\\n- 网络延迟降低: > 30%\\\\n- CDN命中率: > 95%\\\\n- 内容压缩率: > 70%\\\\n- 页面加载时间: < 2秒\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 📝 风险管理\\\\n\\\\n### 技术风险\\\\n\\\\n| 风险 | 影响 | 概率 | 缓解措施 |\\\\n|------|------|------|----------|\\\\n| 技术选型不当 | 高 | 中 | 充分调研，POC验证 |\\\\n| 性能不达标 | 高 | 中 | 早期性能测试，持续优化 |\\\\n| 集成复杂度高 | 中 | 高 | 模块化设计，逐步集成 |\\\\n\\\\n### 项目风险\\\\n\\\\n| 风险 | 影响 | 概率 | 缓解措施 |\\\\n|------|------|------|----------|\\\\n| 进度延期 | 中 | 中 | 合理规划，预留缓冲时间 |\\\\n| 资源不足 | 高 | 低 | 提前规划，灵活调配 |\\\\n| 需求变更 | 中 | 中 | 敏捷开发，快速响应 |\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🔄 持续改进\\\\n\\\\n### 反馈机制\\\\n\\\\n1. **定期评审**: 每周进行进度评审\\\\n2. **用户反馈**: 收集用户使用反馈\\\\n3. **性能监控**: 持续监控系统性能\\\\n4. **技术调研**: 跟踪最新技术趋势\\\\n\\\\n### 优化策略\\\\n\\\\n1. **性能优化**: 持续优化系统性能\\\\n2. **功能增强**: 根据需求增强功能\\\\n3. **技术升级**: 定期升级技术栈\\\\n4. **架构演进**: 根据业务发展演进架构\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 📞 联系方式\\\\n\\\\n如有疑问或建议，请联系：\\\\n\\\\n- **项目负责人**: YYC³ 开发团队\\\\n- **技术支持**: support@yyc3.com\\\\n- **文档更新**: docs@yyc3.com\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n**文档版本**: 1.0.0\\\\n**最后更新**: 2026-01-06\\\\n**下次评审**: 2026-02-06\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"# YYC³ 核心技术实现计划\\n\\n> **创建日期**: 2026-01-06\\n> **文档版本**: 1.0.0\\n> **负责人**: YYC³ 开发团队\\n\\n## 📋 概述\\n\\n本文档基于[核心技术深度指导](./07-YYC3-MovAISys-代码文档-核心技术深度指导.md)中识别的功能模块，制定了详细的实现计划。计划按照优先级分为三个阶段，确保系统逐步完善和优化。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 实施策略\\n\\n### 分阶段实施原则\\n\\n1. **高优先级优先**: 先实现核心安全和运维功能，确保系统稳定性和安全性\\n2. **渐进式交付**: 每个阶段完成后进行测试和验证，确保质量\\n3. **技术选型优先**: 在实施前完成技术调研和选型，避免返工\\n4. **团队协作**: 建立跨功能团队，确保各模块之间的协调和集成\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔴 第一阶段（Q1 2025）：核心安全和运维功能\\n\\n### 1.1 威胁检测与响应系统\\n\\n**目标**: 建立全面的威胁检测和自动化响应机制\\n\\n#### 1.1.1 异常检测算法\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 机器学习框架: TensorFlow / PyTorch\\n- 异常检测算法: Isolation Forest, One-Class SVM, Autoencoder\\n- 实时处理: Apache Flink / Apache Kafka Streams\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计异常检测架构\\n2. 实现数据收集和预处理模块\\n3. 训练和部署异常检测模型\\n4. 建立实时检测管道\\n5. 实现告警和通知机制\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 异常检测服务模块\\n- 模型训练和部署脚本\\n- 实时监控仪表板\\n- 告警配置文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 1.1.2 威胁情报集成\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 威胁情报源: AlienVault OTX, VirusTotal, MISP\\n- 数据存储: Elasticsearch / MongoDB\\n- API网关: Kong / API Gateway\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 集成威胁情报源API\\n2. 建立威胁情报数据库\\n3. 实现威胁情报更新机制\\n4. 开发威胁情报分析工具\\n5. 建立威胁情报共享机制\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 威胁情报集成模块\\n- 威胁情报数据库架构\\n- 威胁情报分析工具\\n- 集成文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n#### 1.1.3 自动化响应机制\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 编排工具: Ansible / SaltStack\\n- 工作流引擎: Apache Airflow / Argo Workflows\\n- 通知系统: PagerDuty / Opsgenie\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计响应流程和策略\\n2. 实现自动化响应脚本\\n3. 建立响应工作流\\n4. 集成通知系统\\n5. 测试和优化响应机制\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 自动化响应脚本库\\n- 响应工作流配置\\n- 通知集成模块\\n- 响应策略文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 10周\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1.2 自动化运维系统\\n\\n**目标**: 实现智能自愈和自动化运维能力\\n\\n#### 1.2.1 自愈机制\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 监控系统: Prometheus + Grafana\\n- 告警管理: Alertmanager\\n- 自动化工具: Kubernetes Operator / Ansible\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计自愈策略和规则\\n2. 实现健康检查和故障检测\\n3. 开发自愈执行引擎\\n4. 建立自愈日志和审计\\n5. 测试和优化自愈机制\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 自愈引擎模块\\n- 自愈策略配置\\n- 健康检查脚本\\n- 自愈日志系统\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 1.2.2 自动化监控和告警\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 监控平台: Prometheus / Datadog\\n- 日志聚合: ELK Stack / Loki\\n- 告警路由: Alertmanager / PagerDuty\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计监控指标体系\\n2. 实现数据采集和存储\\n3. 建立告警规则和路由\\n4. 开发监控仪表板\\n5. 优化告警准确性和响应时间\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 监控指标定义\\n- 数据采集模块\\n- 告警规则配置\\n- 监控仪表板\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n#### 1.2.3 故障自动恢复\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 容器编排: Kubernetes\\n- 服务网格: Istio / Linkerd\\n- 备份恢复: Velero / Restic\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计故障恢复策略\\n2. 实现自动备份机制\\n3. 开发故障检测和恢复脚本\\n4. 建立恢复验证流程\\n5. 测试和优化恢复机制\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 自动备份系统\\n- 故障恢复脚本\\n- 恢复验证工具\\n- 恢复策略文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 10周\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🟡 第二阶段（Q2 2025）：AI能力和基础设施自动化\\n\\n### 2.1 自然语言处理增强\\n\\n**目标**: 建立高级NLP能力，提升AI交互体验\\n\\n#### 2.1.1 高级NLP功能\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- NLP框架: Hugging Face Transformers / spaCy\\n- 预训练模型: BERT, GPT, T5\\n- 向量数据库: Milvus / Pinecone\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计NLP功能架构\\n2. 集成预训练模型\\n3. 实现文本分析和处理\\n4. 开发NLP API接口\\n5. 优化性能和准确性\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- NLP服务模块\\n- 模型部署脚本\\n- API接口文档\\n- 性能测试报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 2.1.2 语义理解系统\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 知识图谱: Neo4j / Amazon Neptune\\n- 语义分析: OpenAI GPT / Anthropic Claude\\n- 向量搜索: FAISS / Milvus\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计语义理解架构\\n2. 构建领域知识图谱\\n3. 实现语义分析算法\\n4. 开发语义搜索功能\\n5. 优化理解准确性\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 语义理解引擎\\n- 知识图谱数据\\n- 语义搜索模块\\n- 理解准确度报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 2.1.3 对话系统\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 对话框架: Rasa / Microsoft Bot Framework\\n- 上下文管理: Redis / PostgreSQL\\n- 多轮对话: LangChain / AutoGPT\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计对话流程\\n2. 实现对话管理器\\n3. 开发意图识别和槽位填充\\n4. 建立上下文管理\\n5. 优化对话体验\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 对话管理引擎\\n- 意图识别模型\\n- 上下文管理模块\\n- 对话测试报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 12周\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2.2 配置即代码\\n\\n**目标**: 实现基础设施自动化管理\\n\\n#### 2.2.1 Terraform/Pulumi集成\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- IaC工具: Terraform / Pulumi\\n- 云平台: AWS / Azure / GCP\\n- 状态管理: Terraform Cloud / Pulumi Cloud\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计基础设施架构\\n2. 编写Terraform/Pulumi配置\\n3. 建立模块化配置库\\n4. 实现自动化部署流程\\n5. 建立配置版本管理\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- Terraform/Pulumi配置文件\\n- 基础设施模块库\\n- 部署自动化脚本\\n- 配置管理文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 2.2.2 基础设施自动化\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 容器编排: Kubernetes\\n- CI/CD: GitLab CI / GitHub Actions\\n- 配置管理: Ansible / Chef\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计自动化流程\\n2. 实现CI/CD管道\\n3. 建立自动化测试\\n4. 开发配置管理工具\\n5. 优化自动化流程\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- CI/CD管道配置\\n- 自动化测试套件\\n- 配置管理工具\\n- 自动化流程文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 2.2.3 配置管理流程\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 配置存储: Git / Vault\\n- 配置验证: Conftest / OPA\\n- 配置同步: Consul / etcd\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计配置管理架构\\n2. 实现配置存储和同步\\n3. 建立配置验证机制\\n4. 开发配置变更管理\\n5. 优化配置管理流程\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 配置管理模块\\n- 配置验证工具\\n- 变更管理系统\\n- 配置管理文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 11周\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2.3 日志聚合系统\\n\\n**目标**: 建立集中式日志管理和分析\\n\\n#### 2.3.1 ELK/Loki集成\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 日志平台: ELK Stack / Grafana Loki\\n- 日志采集: Filebeat / Fluentd\\n- 日志存储: Elasticsearch / Loki\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计日志架构\\n2. 部署日志平台\\n3. 配置日志采集\\n4. 建立日志索引和存储\\n5. 优化日志性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 日志平台部署配置\\n- 日志采集配置\\n- 日志索引策略\\n- 性能优化报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n#### 2.3.2 日志分析和搜索\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 搜索引擎: Elasticsearch / OpenSearch\\n- 分析工具: Kibana / Grafana\\n- 查询语言: KQL / Lucene\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计日志分析功能\\n2. 实现日志搜索接口\\n3. 开发日志分析工具\\n4. 建立日志仪表板\\n5. 优化搜索性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 日志搜索模块\\n- 日志分析工具\\n- 日志仪表板\\n- 搜索性能报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n#### 2.3.3 日志告警机制\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 告警引擎: ElastAlert / Loki Alertmanager\\n- 通知系统: PagerDuty / Slack\\n- 告警路由: Alertmanager\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计告警规则\\n2. 实现告警检测\\n3. 建立告警路由\\n4. 集成通知系统\\n5. 优化告警准确性\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 告警规则配置\\n- 告警检测模块\\n- 告警路由配置\\n- 告警准确性报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 2周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 8周\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2.4 高性能算法引擎\\n\\n**目标**: 实现分布式算法和实时搜索\\n\\n#### 2.4.1 分布式排序算法\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 分布式计算: Apache Spark / Flink\\n- 排序算法: Timsort, QuickSort, MergeSort\\n- 数据分片: Hash Partitioning, Range Partitioning\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计分布式排序架构\\n2. 实现排序算法\\n3. 建立数据分片策略\\n4. 开发并行处理逻辑\\n5. 优化排序性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 分布式排序模块\\n- 排序算法实现\\n- 数据分片策略\\n- 性能测试报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 2.4.2 实时搜索系统\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 搜索引擎: Elasticsearch / OpenSearch\\n- 实时处理: Apache Kafka / Flink\\n- 向量搜索: Milvus / Pinecone\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计搜索架构\\n2. 实现实时索引\\n3. 开发搜索接口\\n4. 建立搜索优化\\n5. 测试搜索性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 实时搜索模块\\n- 索引配置\\n- 搜索API接口\\n- 性能测试报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 2.4.3 机器学习算法\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- ML框架: TensorFlow / PyTorch / Scikit-learn\\n- 模型训练: Kubeflow / MLflow\\n- 模型部署: TensorFlow Serving / TorchServe\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计ML算法架构\\n2. 实现算法模型\\n3. 建立训练流程\\n4. 开发模型部署\\n5. 优化模型性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- ML算法模块\\n- 模型训练脚本\\n- 模型部署配置\\n- 模型性能报告\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 12周\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🟢 第三阶段（Q3 2025）：性能和用户体验优化\\n\\n### 3.1 网络优化\\n\\n**目标**: 优化网络协议和传输性能\\n\\n#### 3.1.1 HTTP/2优化\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- Web服务器: Nginx / Caddy\\n- 反向代理: HAProxy / Envoy\\n- 性能监控: Lighthouse / WebPageTest\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计HTTP/2优化策略\\n2. 配置服务器支持HTTP/2\\n3. 实现连接复用\\n4. 优化资源加载\\n5. 测试性能提升\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- HTTP/2配置\\n- 性能优化报告\\n- 监控仪表板\\n- 最佳实践文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 2周\\n\\n#### 3.1.2 QUIC协议集成\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- QUIC实现: quiche / msquic\\n- 服务器: Nginx with QUIC / Caddy\\n- 客户端: Chrome / Firefox\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计QUIC集成方案\\n2. 配置服务器支持QUIC\\n3. 实现协议升级\\n4. 测试兼容性\\n5. 优化性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- QUIC配置\\n- 兼容性测试报告\\n- 性能对比报告\\n- 部署文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n#### 3.1.3 TCP参数优化\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 内核调优: sysctl / tuned\\n- 网络监控: tcpdump / wireshark\\n- 性能分析: iperf / netperf\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 分析当前网络性能\\n2. 设计TCP参数优化方案\\n3. 实施参数调优\\n4. 监控性能变化\\n5. 优化和调整\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- TCP优化配置\\n- 性能分析报告\\n- 监控配置\\n- 优化文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 2周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 7周\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3.2 内容分发优化\\n\\n**目标**: 建立CDN和边缘计算能力\\n\\n#### 3.2.1 CDN集成\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- CDN服务: Cloudflare / AWS CloudFront / Fastly\\n- 缓存策略: Varnish / Nginx Cache\\n- 缓存失效: Fastly Purge / Cloudflare API\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 选择CDN服务商\\n2. 设计CDN架构\\n3. 配置CDN缓存策略\\n4. 实现缓存失效机制\\n5. 测试CDN性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- CDN配置\\n- 缓存策略文档\\n- 性能测试报告\\n- 运维手册\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n#### 3.2.2 边缘计算\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 边缘平台: Cloudflare Workers / AWS Lambda@Edge\\n- 边缘存储: Cloudflare KV / AWS CloudFront Functions\\n- 边缘数据库: FaunaDB / PlanetScale\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 设计边缘计算架构\\n2. 开发边缘函数\\n3. 实现边缘数据处理\\n4. 建立边缘存储\\n5. 测试边缘性能\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 边缘函数代码\\n- 边缘存储配置\\n- 性能测试报告\\n- 部署文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 4周\\n\\n#### 3.2.3 内容压缩优化\\n\\n**技术选型**:\\n- 压缩算法: Brotli / Gzip / Zstd\\n- 图片优化: ImageMagick / Sharp\\n- 视频优化: FFmpeg / AWS MediaConvert\\n\\n**实施步骤**:\\n1. 分析内容类型\\n2. 设计压缩策略\\n3. 实现压缩优化\\n4. 优化图片和视频\\n5. 测试压缩效果\\n\\n**交付物**:\\n- 压缩配置\\n- 优化脚本\\n- 性能对比报告\\n- 最佳实践文档\\n\\n**时间估算**: 3周\\n\\n**总时间估算**: 10周\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 资源规划\\n\\n### 人员配置\\n\\n| 阶段 | 角色 | 人数 | 主要职责 |\\n|------|------|------|----------|\\n| Q1 2025 | 安全工程师 | 2 | 威胁检测、安全响应 |\\n| Q1 2025 | 运维工程师 | 2 | 自动化运维、自愈机制 |\\n| Q2 2025 | AI工程师 | 3 | NLP增强、对话系统 |\\n| Q2 2025 | DevOps工程师 | 2 | IaC、CI/CD |\\n| Q2 2025 | 数据工程师 | 2 | 日志聚合、数据分析 |\\n| Q2 2025 | 算法工程师 | 2 | 分布式算法、ML算法 |\\n| Q3 2025 | 网络工程师 | 1 | 网络优化、CDN |\\n| Q3 2025 | 性能工程师 | 1 | 性能优化、压缩 |\\n\\n### 技术栈总览\\n\\n| 类别 | 技术选型 |\\n|------|----------|\\n| **安全** | TensorFlow, Elastic Security, Ansible |\\n| **运维** | Kubernetes, Prometheus, Grafana |\\n| **AI** | Hugging Face, OpenAI GPT, Rasa |\\n| **DevOps** | Terraform, Pulumi, GitLab CI |\\n| **日志** | ELK Stack, Loki, Grafana |\\n| **算法** | Apache Spark, Elasticsearch, TensorFlow |\\n| **网络** | Nginx, Caddy, QUIC |\\n| **CDN** | Cloudflare, AWS CloudFront |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 成功指标\\n\\n### 第一阶段（Q1 2025）\\n\\n- 威胁检测准确率: > 95%\\n- 威胁响应时间: < 5分钟\\n- 系统自愈率: > 90%\\n- 监控覆盖率: 100%\\n\\n### 第二阶段（Q2 2025）\\n\\n- NLP理解准确率: > 90%\\n- 对话完成率: > 85%\\n- 基础设施自动化率: > 80%\\n- 日志检索时间: < 1秒\\n- 算法性能提升: > 50%\\n\\n### 第三阶段（Q3 2025）\\n\\n- 网络延迟降低: > 30%\\n- CDN命中率: > 95%\\n- 内容压缩率: > 70%\\n- 页面加载时间: < 2秒\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📝 风险管理\\n\\n### 技术风险\\n\\n| 风险 | 影响 | 概率 | 缓解措施 |\\n|------|------|------|----------|\\n| 技术选型不当 | 高 | 中 | 充分调研，POC验证 |\\n| 性能不达标 | 高 | 中 | 早期性能测试，持续优化 |\\n| 集成复杂度高 | 中 | 高 | 模块化设计，逐步集成 |\\n\\n### 项目风险\\n\\n| 风险 | 影响 | 概率 | 缓解措施 |\\n|------|------|------|----------|\\n| 进度延期 | 中 | 中 | 合理规划，预留缓冲时间 |\\n| 资源不足 | 高 | 低 | 提前规划，灵活调配 |\\n| 需求变更 | 中 | 中 | 敏捷开发，快速响应 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 持续改进\\n\\n### 反馈机制\\n\\n1. **定期评审**: 每周进行进度评审\\n2. **用户反馈**: 收集用户使用反馈\\n3. **性能监控**: 持续监控系统性能\\n4. **技术调研**: 跟踪最新技术趋势\\n\\n### 优化策略\\n\\n1. **性能优化**: 持续优化系统性能\\n2. **功能增强**: 根据需求增强功能\\n3. **技术升级**: 定期升级技术栈\\n4. **架构演进**: 根据业务发展演进架构\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 联系方式\\n\\n如有疑问或建议，请联系：\\n\\n- **项目负责人**: YYC³ 开发团队\\n- **技术支持**: support@yyc3.com\\n- **文档更新**: docs@yyc3.com\\n\\n---\\n\\n**文档版本**: 1.0.0\\n**最后更新**: 2026-01-06\\n**下次评审**: 2026-02-06\\n\",\"originTextLength\":8852,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767646071707}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/security/threat-detection/AnomalyDetectionEngine.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":268,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":268,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface AnomalyData {\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  metrics: Record<string, number>;\\\\n  source: string;\\\\n  userId?: string;\\\\n  sessionId?: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface AnomalyDetectionResult {\\\\n  isAnomalous: boolean;\\\\n  confidence: number;\\\\n  anomalyType: string;\\\\n  severity: \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' | \\\\'critical\\\\';\\\\n  details: Record<string, any>;\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DetectionModel {\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  threshold: number;\\\\n  lastTrained: number;\\\\n  accuracy: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class AnomalyDetectionEngine extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private models: Map<string, DetectionModel> = new Map();\\\\n  private baselineMetrics: Map<string, number[]> = new Map();\\\\n  private readonly BASELINE_WINDOW_SIZE = 1000;\\\\n  private readonly ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 2.5;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor() {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.initializeModels();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeModels(): void {\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'isolation_forest\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'isolation_forest\\\\',\\\\n      threshold: 0.7,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      accuracy: 0.85\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'one_class_svm\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'one_class_svm\\\\',\\\\n      threshold: 0.65,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      accuracy: 0.82\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'autoencoder\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'autoencoder\\\\',\\\\n      threshold: 0.75,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      accuracy: 0.88\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async detectAnomaly(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\\\n    const startTime = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n    try {\\\\n      const results = await Promise.all([\\\\n        this.detectWithIsolationForest(data),\\\\n        this.detectWithOneClassSVM(data),\\\\n        this.detectWithAutoencoder(data)\\\\n      ]);\\\\n\\\\n      const aggregatedResult = this.aggregateResults(results);\\\\n      \\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'anomaly_detected\\\\', {\\\\n        data,\\\\n        result: aggregatedResult,\\\\n        processingTime: Date.now() - startTime\\\\n      });\\\\n\\\\n      return aggregatedResult;\\\\n    } catch (error) {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'detection_error\\\\', { data, error });\\\\n      throw error;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async detectWithIsolationForest(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\\\n    const model = this.models.get(\\\\'isolation_forest\\\\')!;\\\\n    \\\\n    const scores = this.calculateAnomalyScores(data.metrics);\\\\n    const maxScore = Math.max(...Object.values(scores));\\\\n    const isAnomalous = maxScore > model.threshold;\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      isAnomalous,\\\\n      confidence: maxScore,\\\\n      anomalyType: this.classifyAnomalyType(data.metrics),\\\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(maxScore),\\\\n      details: {\\\\n        model: \\\\'isolation_forest\\\\',\\\\n        scores,\\\\n        threshold: model.threshold\\\\n      },\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async detectWithOneClassSVM(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\\\n    const model = this.models.get(\\\\'one_class_svm\\\\')!;\\\\n    \\\\n    const baseline = this.getBaselineMetrics(data.source);\\\\n    const deviation = this.calculateDeviation(data.metrics, baseline);\\\\n    const isAnomalous = deviation > model.threshold;\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      isAnomalous,\\\\n      confidence: deviation,\\\\n      anomalyType: this.classifyAnomalyType(data.metrics),\\\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(deviation),\\\\n      details: {\\\\n        model: \\\\'one_class_svm\\\\',\\\\n        deviation,\\\\n        baseline,\\\\n        threshold: model.threshold\\\\n      },\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async detectWithAutoencoder(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\\\n    const model = this.models.get(\\\\'autoencoder\\\\')!;\\\\n    \\\\n    const reconstructionError = this.calculateReconstructionError(data.metrics);\\\\n    const isAnomalous = reconstructionError > model.threshold;\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      isAnomalous,\\\\n      confidence: reconstructionError,\\\\n      anomalyType: this.classifyAnomalyType(data.metrics),\\\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(reconstructionError),\\\\n      details: {\\\\n        model: \\\\'autoencoder\\\\',\\\\n        reconstructionError,\\\\n        threshold: model.threshold\\\\n      },\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private aggregateResults(results: AnomalyDetectionResult[]): AnomalyDetectionResult {\\\\n    const anomalousCount = results.filter(r => r.isAnomalous).length;\\\\n    const avgConfidence = results.reduce((sum, r) => sum + r.confidence, 0) / results.length;\\\\n    \\\\n    const isAnomalous = anomalousCount >= 2;\\\\n    const anomalyType = this.getMostCommonAnomalyType(results);\\\\n    \\\\n    return {\\\\n      isAnomalous,\\\\n      confidence: avgConfidence,\\\\n      anomalyType,\\\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(avgConfidence),\\\\n      details: {\\\\n        modelResults: results,\\\\n        consensus: `${anomalousCount}/${results.length} models detected anomaly`\\\\n      },\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateAnomalyScores(metrics: Record<string, number>): Record<string, number> {\\\\n    const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(metrics)) {\\\\n      const baseline = this.getBaselineMetrics(key);\\\\n      const mean = this.calculateMean(baseline);\\\\n      const std = this.calculateStd(baseline, mean);\\\\n      \\\\n      if (std > 0) {\\\\n        scores[key] = Math.abs((value - mean) / std);\\\\n      } else {\\\\n        scores[key] = 0;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return scores;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateDeviation(metrics: Record<string, number>, baseline: number[]): number {\\\\n    const currentMean = this.calculateMean(Object.values(metrics));\\\\n    const baselineMean = this.calculateMean(baseline);\\\\n    const baselineStd = this.calculateStd(baseline, baselineMean);\\\\n    \\\\n    if (baselineStd === 0) return 0;\\\\n    \\\\n    return Math.abs((currentMean - baselineMean) / baselineStd);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateReconstructionError(metrics: Record<string, number>): number {\\\\n    const baseline = this.getBaselineMetrics(\\\\'global\\\\');\\\\n    if (baseline.length === 0) return 0;\\\\n    \\\\n    const baselineMean = this.calculateMean(baseline);\\\\n    const currentMean = this.calculateMean(Object.values(metrics));\\\\n    \\\\n    return Math.abs(currentMean - baselineMean) / (baselineMean || 1);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private classifyAnomalyType(metrics: Record<string, number>): string {\\\\n    const keys = Object.keys(metrics);\\\\n    \\\\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes(\\\\'cpu\\\\') || k.includes(\\\\'memory\\\\'))) {\\\\n      return \\\\'resource_anomaly\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes(\\\\'network\\\\') || k.includes(\\\\'bandwidth\\\\'))) {\\\\n      return \\\\'network_anomaly\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes(\\\\'request\\\\') || k.includes(\\\\'response\\\\'))) {\\\\n      return \\\\'traffic_anomaly\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes(\\\\'error\\\\') || k.includes(\\\\'exception\\\\'))) {\\\\n      return \\\\'error_anomaly\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return \\\\'unknown_anomaly\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateSeverity(score: number): \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' | \\\\'critical\\\\' {\\\\n    if (score < 2.0) return \\\\'low\\\\';\\\\n    if (score < 3.0) return \\\\'medium\\\\';\\\\n    if (score < 4.0) return \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n    return \\\\'critical\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getMostCommonAnomalyType(results: AnomalyDetectionResult[]): string {\\\\n    const typeCount: Record<string, number> = {};\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const result of results) {\\\\n      typeCount[result.anomalyType] = (typeCount[result.anomalyType] || 0) + 1;\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return Object.entries(typeCount)\\\\n      .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0][0];\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getBaselineMetrics(source: string): number[] {\\\\n    return this.baselineMetrics.get(source) || [];\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateMean(values: number[]): number {\\\\n    if (values.length === 0) return 0;\\\\n    return values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateStd(values: number[], mean: number): number {\\\\n    if (values.length === 0) return 0;\\\\n    const variance = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + Math.pow(v - mean, 2), 0) / values.length;\\\\n    return Math.sqrt(variance);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async updateBaseline(data: AnomalyData): Promise<void> {\\\\n    for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(data.metrics)) {\\\\n      const baseline = this.baselineMetrics.get(key) || [];\\\\n      baseline.push(value);\\\\n      \\\\n      if (baseline.length > this.BASELINE_WINDOW_SIZE) {\\\\n        baseline.shift();\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      this.baselineMetrics.set(key, baseline);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'baseline_updated\\\\', { source: data.source, timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async trainModel(modelName: string, trainingData: AnomalyData[]): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const model = this.models.get(modelName);\\\\n    if (!model) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Model ${modelName} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const data of trainingData) {\\\\n      await this.updateBaseline(data);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    model.lastTrained = Date.now();\\\\n    model.accuracy = Math.min(0.95, model.accuracy + 0.01);\\\\n    \\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'model_trained\\\\', { modelName, accuracy: model.accuracy });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getModels(): DetectionModel[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.models.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getModel(modelName: string): DetectionModel | undefined {\\\\n    return this.models.get(modelName);\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\n\\nexport interface AnomalyData {\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  metrics: Record<string, number>;\\n  source: string;\\n  userId?: string;\\n  sessionId?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AnomalyDetectionResult {\\n  isAnomalous: boolean;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  anomalyType: string;\\n  severity: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'critical';\\n  details: Record<string, any>;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DetectionModel {\\n  name: string;\\n  threshold: number;\\n  lastTrained: number;\\n  accuracy: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class AnomalyDetectionEngine extends EventEmitter {\\n  private models: Map<string, DetectionModel> = new Map();\\n  private baselineMetrics: Map<string, number[]> = new Map();\\n  private readonly BASELINE_WINDOW_SIZE = 1000;\\n  private readonly ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 2.5;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    super();\\n    this.initializeModels();\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeModels(): void {\\n    this.models.set('isolation_forest', {\\n      name: 'isolation_forest',\\n      threshold: 0.7,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      accuracy: 0.85\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('one_class_svm', {\\n      name: 'one_class_svm',\\n      threshold: 0.65,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      accuracy: 0.82\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('autoencoder', {\\n      name: 'autoencoder',\\n      threshold: 0.75,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      accuracy: 0.88\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async detectAnomaly(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\n    const startTime = Date.now();\\n\\n    try {\\n      const results = await Promise.all([\\n        this.detectWithIsolationForest(data),\\n        this.detectWithOneClassSVM(data),\\n        this.detectWithAutoencoder(data)\\n      ]);\\n\\n      const aggregatedResult = this.aggregateResults(results);\\n      \\n      this.emit('anomaly_detected', {\\n        data,\\n        result: aggregatedResult,\\n        processingTime: Date.now() - startTime\\n      });\\n\\n      return aggregatedResult;\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      this.emit('detection_error', { data, error });\\n      throw error;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async detectWithIsolationForest(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\n    const model = this.models.get('isolation_forest')!;\\n    \\n    const scores = this.calculateAnomalyScores(data.metrics);\\n    const maxScore = Math.max(...Object.values(scores));\\n    const isAnomalous = maxScore > model.threshold;\\n\\n    return {\\n      isAnomalous,\\n      confidence: maxScore,\\n      anomalyType: this.classifyAnomalyType(data.metrics),\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(maxScore),\\n      details: {\\n        model: 'isolation_forest',\\n        scores,\\n        threshold: model.threshold\\n      },\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async detectWithOneClassSVM(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\n    const model = this.models.get('one_class_svm')!;\\n    \\n    const baseline = this.getBaselineMetrics(data.source);\\n    const deviation = this.calculateDeviation(data.metrics, baseline);\\n    const isAnomalous = deviation > model.threshold;\\n\\n    return {\\n      isAnomalous,\\n      confidence: deviation,\\n      anomalyType: this.classifyAnomalyType(data.metrics),\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(deviation),\\n      details: {\\n        model: 'one_class_svm',\\n        deviation,\\n        baseline,\\n        threshold: model.threshold\\n      },\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async detectWithAutoencoder(data: AnomalyData): Promise<AnomalyDetectionResult> {\\n    const model = this.models.get('autoencoder')!;\\n    \\n    const reconstructionError = this.calculateReconstructionError(data.metrics);\\n    const isAnomalous = reconstructionError > model.threshold;\\n\\n    return {\\n      isAnomalous,\\n      confidence: reconstructionError,\\n      anomalyType: this.classifyAnomalyType(data.metrics),\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(reconstructionError),\\n      details: {\\n        model: 'autoencoder',\\n        reconstructionError,\\n        threshold: model.threshold\\n      },\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private aggregateResults(results: AnomalyDetectionResult[]): AnomalyDetectionResult {\\n    const anomalousCount = results.filter(r => r.isAnomalous).length;\\n    const avgConfidence = results.reduce((sum, r) => sum + r.confidence, 0) / results.length;\\n    \\n    const isAnomalous = anomalousCount >= 2;\\n    const anomalyType = this.getMostCommonAnomalyType(results);\\n    \\n    return {\\n      isAnomalous,\\n      confidence: avgConfidence,\\n      anomalyType,\\n      severity: this.calculateSeverity(avgConfidence),\\n      details: {\\n        modelResults: results,\\n        consensus: `${anomalousCount}/${results.length} models detected anomaly`\\n      },\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateAnomalyScores(metrics: Record<string, number>): Record<string, number> {\\n    const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\\n    \\n    for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(metrics)) {\\n      const baseline = this.getBaselineMetrics(key);\\n      const mean = this.calculateMean(baseline);\\n      const std = this.calculateStd(baseline, mean);\\n      \\n      if (std > 0) {\\n        scores[key] = Math.abs((value - mean) / std);\\n      } else {\\n        scores[key] = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    return scores;\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateDeviation(metrics: Record<string, number>, baseline: number[]): number {\\n    const currentMean = this.calculateMean(Object.values(metrics));\\n    const baselineMean = this.calculateMean(baseline);\\n    const baselineStd = this.calculateStd(baseline, baselineMean);\\n    \\n    if (baselineStd === 0) return 0;\\n    \\n    return Math.abs((currentMean - baselineMean) / baselineStd);\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateReconstructionError(metrics: Record<string, number>): number {\\n    const baseline = this.getBaselineMetrics('global');\\n    if (baseline.length === 0) return 0;\\n    \\n    const baselineMean = this.calculateMean(baseline);\\n    const currentMean = this.calculateMean(Object.values(metrics));\\n    \\n    return Math.abs(currentMean - baselineMean) / (baselineMean || 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  private classifyAnomalyType(metrics: Record<string, number>): string {\\n    const keys = Object.keys(metrics);\\n    \\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes('cpu') || k.includes('memory'))) {\\n      return 'resource_anomaly';\\n    }\\n    \\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes('network') || k.includes('bandwidth'))) {\\n      return 'network_anomaly';\\n    }\\n    \\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes('request') || k.includes('response'))) {\\n      return 'traffic_anomaly';\\n    }\\n    \\n    if (keys.some(k => k.includes('error') || k.includes('exception'))) {\\n      return 'error_anomaly';\\n    }\\n    \\n    return 'unknown_anomaly';\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateSeverity(score: number): 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'critical' {\\n    if (score < 2.0) return 'low';\\n    if (score < 3.0) return 'medium';\\n    if (score < 4.0) return 'high';\\n    return 'critical';\\n  }\\n\\n  private getMostCommonAnomalyType(results: AnomalyDetectionResult[]): string {\\n    const typeCount: Record<string, number> = {};\\n    \\n    for (const result of results) {\\n      typeCount[result.anomalyType] = (typeCount[result.anomalyType] || 0) + 1;\\n    }\\n    \\n    return Object.entries(typeCount)\\n      .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1])[0][0];\\n  }\\n\\n  private getBaselineMetrics(source: string): number[] {\\n    return this.baselineMetrics.get(source) || [];\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateMean(values: number[]): number {\\n    if (values.length === 0) return 0;\\n    return values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateStd(values: number[], mean: number): number {\\n    if (values.length === 0) return 0;\\n    const variance = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + Math.pow(v - mean, 2), 0) / values.length;\\n    return Math.sqrt(variance);\\n  }\\n\\n  async updateBaseline(data: AnomalyData): Promise<void> {\\n    for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(data.metrics)) {\\n      const baseline = this.baselineMetrics.get(key) || [];\\n      baseline.push(value);\\n      \\n      if (baseline.length > this.BASELINE_WINDOW_SIZE) {\\n        baseline.shift();\\n      }\\n      \\n      this.baselineMetrics.set(key, baseline);\\n    }\\n    \\n    this.emit('baseline_updated', { source: data.source, timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  async trainModel(modelName: string, trainingData: AnomalyData[]): Promise<void> {\\n    const model = this.models.get(modelName);\\n    if (!model) {\\n      throw new Error(`Model ${modelName} not found`);\\n    }\\n    \\n    for (const data of trainingData) {\\n      await this.updateBaseline(data);\\n    }\\n    \\n    model.lastTrained = Date.now();\\n    model.accuracy = Math.min(0.95, model.accuracy + 0.01);\\n    \\n    this.emit('model_trained', { modelName, accuracy: model.accuracy });\\n  }\\n\\n  getModels(): DetectionModel[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.models.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  getModel(modelName: string): DetectionModel | undefined {\\n    return this.models.get(modelName);\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":8809,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647399958}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/security/threat-detection/ThreatDetector.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":287,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":287,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\nimport { AnomalyDetectionEngine, AnomalyData, AnomalyDetectionResult } from \\\\'./AnomalyDetectionEngine\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface Threat {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  type: string;\\\\n  severity: \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' | \\\\'critical\\\\';\\\\n  status: \\\\'detected\\\\' | \\\\'investigating\\\\' | \\\\'mitigating\\\\' | \\\\'resolved\\\\' | \\\\'false_positive\\\\';\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  source: string;\\\\n  details: Record<string, any>;\\\\n  affectedSystems: string[];\\\\n  mitigationActions: string[];\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface ThreatIntelligence {\\\\n  indicators: string[];\\\\n  knownAttackPatterns: string[];\\\\n  threatFeeds: string[];\\\\n  lastUpdated: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class ThreatDetector extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private anomalyEngine: AnomalyDetectionEngine;\\\\n  private threats: Map<string, Threat> = new Map();\\\\n  private threatIntelligence: ThreatIntelligence;\\\\n  private readonly THREAT_RETENTION_DAYS = 90;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor() {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.anomalyEngine = new AnomalyDetectionEngine();\\\\n    this.threatIntelligence = {\\\\n      indicators: [],\\\\n      knownAttackPatterns: [],\\\\n      threatFeeds: [],\\\\n      lastUpdated: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n    \\\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\\\n    this.anomalyEngine.on(\\\\'anomaly_detected\\\\', async (data) => {\\\\n      await this.handleAnomalyDetected(data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.anomalyEngine.on(\\\\'detection_error\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'threat_detection_error\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async detectThreat(data: AnomalyData): Promise<Threat | null> {\\\\n    try {\\\\n      const anomalyResult = await this.anomalyEngine.detectAnomaly(data);\\\\n      \\\\n      if (!anomalyResult.isAnomalous) {\\\\n        await this.anomalyEngine.updateBaseline(data);\\\\n        return null;\\\\n      }\\\\n\\\\n      const threat = this.createThreat(data, anomalyResult);\\\\n      this.threats.set(threat.id, threat);\\\\n      \\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'threat_detected\\\\', threat);\\\\n      \\\\n      if (threat.severity === \\\\'high\\\\' || threat.severity === \\\\'critical\\\\') {\\\\n        await this.triggerImmediateResponse(threat);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      return threat;\\\\n    } catch (error) {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'detection_error\\\\', { data, error });\\\\n      throw error;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async handleAnomalyDetected(data: any): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const { data: anomalyData, result } = data;\\\\n    \\\\n    if (result.isAnomalous) {\\\\n      const threat = this.createThreat(anomalyData, result);\\\\n      this.threats.set(threat.id, threat);\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'threat_detected\\\\', threat);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private createThreat(data: AnomalyData, result: AnomalyDetectionResult): Threat {\\\\n    const threatId = `threat-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\\\\n    \\\\n    return {\\\\n      id: threatId,\\\\n      type: result.anomalyType,\\\\n      severity: result.severity,\\\\n      status: \\\\'detected\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: result.timestamp,\\\\n      source: data.source,\\\\n      details: {\\\\n        anomalyData: data,\\\\n        detectionResult: result,\\\\n        confidence: result.confidence\\\\n      },\\\\n      affectedSystems: [data.source],\\\\n      mitigationActions: []\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async triggerImmediateResponse(threat: Threat): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'critical_threat\\\\', threat);\\\\n    \\\\n    const immediateActions = this.getImmediateMitigationActions(threat);\\\\n    threat.mitigationActions.push(...immediateActions);\\\\n    threat.status = \\\\'mitigating\\\\';\\\\n    \\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'mitigation_started\\\\', { threat, actions: immediateActions });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getImmediateMitigationActions(threat: Threat): string[] {\\\\n    const actions: string[] = [];\\\\n    \\\\n    switch (threat.type) {\\\\n      case \\\\'network_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'block_suspicious_ips\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'rate_limit_requests\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_firewall_rules\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'resource_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'scale_resources\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'throttle_requests\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'traffic_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_ddos_protection\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'activate_cdn\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_rate_limiting\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'error_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_circuit_breaker\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_fallback_mode\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'notify_on_call_team\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      default:\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_monitoring\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'log_detailed_metrics\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'notify_security_team\\\\');\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return actions;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async updateThreatStatus(\\\\n    threatId: string,\\\\n    status: Threat[\\\\'status\\\\'],\\\\n    notes?: string\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId);\\\\n    if (!threat) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Threat ${threatId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    threat.status = status;\\\\n    \\\\n    if (notes) {\\\\n      threat.details.notes = notes;\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'threat_status_updated\\\\', { threat, status, notes });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addMitigationAction(threatId: string, action: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId);\\\\n    if (!threat) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Threat ${threatId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    threat.mitigationActions.push(action);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'mitigation_action_added\\\\', { threat, action });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async resolveThreat(threatId: string, resolution: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.updateThreatStatus(threatId, \\\\'resolved\\\\', resolution);\\\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId)!;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'threat_resolved\\\\', { threat, resolution });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async markAsFalsePositive(threatId: string, reason: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.updateThreatStatus(threatId, \\\\'false_positive\\\\', reason);\\\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId)!;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'false_positive_marked\\\\', { threat, reason });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async updateThreatIntelligence(intelligence: Partial<ThreatIntelligence>): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.threatIntelligence = {\\\\n      ...this.threatIntelligence,\\\\n      ...intelligence,\\\\n      lastUpdated: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n    \\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'intelligence_updated\\\\', this.threatIntelligence);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async checkThreatIntelligence(data: AnomalyData): Promise<boolean> {\\\\n    const { indicators, knownAttackPatterns } = this.threatIntelligence;\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const indicator of indicators) {\\\\n      if (JSON.stringify(data).includes(indicator)) {\\\\n        return true;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const pattern of knownAttackPatterns) {\\\\n      if (this.matchesPattern(data, pattern)) {\\\\n        return true;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return false;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private matchesPattern(data: AnomalyData, pattern: string): boolean {\\\\n    const dataString = JSON.stringify(data);\\\\n    const regex = new RegExp(pattern, \\\\'i\\\\');\\\\n    return regex.test(dataString);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getThreat(threatId: string): Threat | undefined {\\\\n    return this.threats.get(threatId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getThreats(filter?: {\\\\n    status?: Threat[\\\\'status\\\\'];\\\\n    severity?: Threat[\\\\'severity\\\\'];\\\\n    type?: string;\\\\n    startDate?: number;\\\\n    endDate?: number;\\\\n  }): Threat[] {\\\\n    let threats = Array.from(this.threats.values());\\\\n    \\\\n    if (filter) {\\\\n      if (filter.status) {\\\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.status === filter.status);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      if (filter.severity) {\\\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.severity === filter.severity);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      if (filter.type) {\\\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.type === filter.type);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      if (filter.startDate) {\\\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.timestamp >= filter.startDate!);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      if (filter.endDate) {\\\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.timestamp <= filter.endDate!);\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return threats.sort((a, b) => b.timestamp - a.timestamp);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getThreatStatistics(): {\\\\n    total: number;\\\\n    byStatus: Record<string, number>;\\\\n    bySeverity: Record<string, number>;\\\\n    byType: Record<string, number>;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    const threats = Array.from(this.threats.values());\\\\n    \\\\n    return {\\\\n      total: threats.length,\\\\n      byStatus: this.groupBy(threats, \\\\'status\\\\'),\\\\n      bySeverity: this.groupBy(threats, \\\\'severity\\\\'),\\\\n      byType: this.groupBy(threats, \\\\'type\\\\')\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private groupBy(threats: Threat[], key: keyof Threat): Record<string, number> {\\\\n    return threats.reduce((acc, threat) => {\\\\n      const value = threat[key] as string;\\\\n      acc[value] = (acc[value] || 0) + 1;\\\\n      return acc;\\\\n    }, {} as Record<string, number>);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async cleanupOldThreats(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    const cutoffDate = Date.now() - (this.THREAT_RETENTION_DAYS * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\\\\n    let cleanedCount = 0;\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const [id, threat] of this.threats.entries()) {\\\\n      if (threat.timestamp < cutoffDate && threat.status === \\\\'resolved\\\\') {\\\\n        this.threats.delete(id);\\\\n        cleanedCount++;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'threats_cleaned\\\\', { count: cleanedCount });\\\\n    return cleanedCount;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAnomalyEngine(): AnomalyDetectionEngine {\\\\n    return this.anomalyEngine;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getThreatIntelligence(): ThreatIntelligence {\\\\n    return this.threatIntelligence;\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\nimport { AnomalyDetectionEngine, AnomalyData, AnomalyDetectionResult } from './AnomalyDetectionEngine';\\n\\nexport interface Threat {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: string;\\n  severity: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'critical';\\n  status: 'detected' | 'investigating' | 'mitigating' | 'resolved' | 'false_positive';\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  source: string;\\n  details: Record<string, any>;\\n  affectedSystems: string[];\\n  mitigationActions: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ThreatIntelligence {\\n  indicators: string[];\\n  knownAttackPatterns: string[];\\n  threatFeeds: string[];\\n  lastUpdated: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class ThreatDetector extends EventEmitter {\\n  private anomalyEngine: AnomalyDetectionEngine;\\n  private threats: Map<string, Threat> = new Map();\\n  private threatIntelligence: ThreatIntelligence;\\n  private readonly THREAT_RETENTION_DAYS = 90;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    super();\\n    this.anomalyEngine = new AnomalyDetectionEngine();\\n    this.threatIntelligence = {\\n      indicators: [],\\n      knownAttackPatterns: [],\\n      threatFeeds: [],\\n      lastUpdated: Date.now()\\n    };\\n    \\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\n  }\\n\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\n    this.anomalyEngine.on('anomaly_detected', async (data) => {\\n      await this.handleAnomalyDetected(data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.anomalyEngine.on('detection_error', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('threat_detection_error', data);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async detectThreat(data: AnomalyData): Promise<Threat | null> {\\n    try {\\n      const anomalyResult = await this.anomalyEngine.detectAnomaly(data);\\n      \\n      if (!anomalyResult.isAnomalous) {\\n        await this.anomalyEngine.updateBaseline(data);\\n        return null;\\n      }\\n\\n      const threat = this.createThreat(data, anomalyResult);\\n      this.threats.set(threat.id, threat);\\n      \\n      this.emit('threat_detected', threat);\\n      \\n      if (threat.severity === 'high' || threat.severity === 'critical') {\\n        await this.triggerImmediateResponse(threat);\\n      }\\n      \\n      return threat;\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      this.emit('detection_error', { data, error });\\n      throw error;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async handleAnomalyDetected(data: any): Promise<void> {\\n    const { data: anomalyData, result } = data;\\n    \\n    if (result.isAnomalous) {\\n      const threat = this.createThreat(anomalyData, result);\\n      this.threats.set(threat.id, threat);\\n      this.emit('threat_detected', threat);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private createThreat(data: AnomalyData, result: AnomalyDetectionResult): Threat {\\n    const threatId = `threat-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\\n    \\n    return {\\n      id: threatId,\\n      type: result.anomalyType,\\n      severity: result.severity,\\n      status: 'detected',\\n      timestamp: result.timestamp,\\n      source: data.source,\\n      details: {\\n        anomalyData: data,\\n        detectionResult: result,\\n        confidence: result.confidence\\n      },\\n      affectedSystems: [data.source],\\n      mitigationActions: []\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async triggerImmediateResponse(threat: Threat): Promise<void> {\\n    this.emit('critical_threat', threat);\\n    \\n    const immediateActions = this.getImmediateMitigationActions(threat);\\n    threat.mitigationActions.push(...immediateActions);\\n    threat.status = 'mitigating';\\n    \\n    this.emit('mitigation_started', { threat, actions: immediateActions });\\n  }\\n\\n  private getImmediateMitigationActions(threat: Threat): string[] {\\n    const actions: string[] = [];\\n    \\n    switch (threat.type) {\\n      case 'network_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('block_suspicious_ips');\\n        actions.push('rate_limit_requests');\\n        actions.push('enable_firewall_rules');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      case 'resource_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('scale_resources');\\n        actions.push('throttle_requests');\\n        actions.push('restart_affected_services');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      case 'traffic_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('enable_ddos_protection');\\n        actions.push('activate_cdn');\\n        actions.push('enable_rate_limiting');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      case 'error_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('enable_circuit_breaker');\\n        actions.push('enable_fallback_mode');\\n        actions.push('notify_on_call_team');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      default:\\n        actions.push('enable_monitoring');\\n        actions.push('log_detailed_metrics');\\n        actions.push('notify_security_team');\\n    }\\n    \\n    return actions;\\n  }\\n\\n  async updateThreatStatus(\\n    threatId: string,\\n    status: Threat['status'],\\n    notes?: string\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId);\\n    if (!threat) {\\n      throw new Error(`Threat ${threatId} not found`);\\n    }\\n    \\n    threat.status = status;\\n    \\n    if (notes) {\\n      threat.details.notes = notes;\\n    }\\n    \\n    this.emit('threat_status_updated', { threat, status, notes });\\n  }\\n\\n  async addMitigationAction(threatId: string, action: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId);\\n    if (!threat) {\\n      throw new Error(`Threat ${threatId} not found`);\\n    }\\n    \\n    threat.mitigationActions.push(action);\\n    this.emit('mitigation_action_added', { threat, action });\\n  }\\n\\n  async resolveThreat(threatId: string, resolution: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.updateThreatStatus(threatId, 'resolved', resolution);\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId)!;\\n    this.emit('threat_resolved', { threat, resolution });\\n  }\\n\\n  async markAsFalsePositive(threatId: string, reason: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.updateThreatStatus(threatId, 'false_positive', reason);\\n    const threat = this.threats.get(threatId)!;\\n    this.emit('false_positive_marked', { threat, reason });\\n  }\\n\\n  async updateThreatIntelligence(intelligence: Partial<ThreatIntelligence>): Promise<void> {\\n    this.threatIntelligence = {\\n      ...this.threatIntelligence,\\n      ...intelligence,\\n      lastUpdated: Date.now()\\n    };\\n    \\n    this.emit('intelligence_updated', this.threatIntelligence);\\n  }\\n\\n  async checkThreatIntelligence(data: AnomalyData): Promise<boolean> {\\n    const { indicators, knownAttackPatterns } = this.threatIntelligence;\\n    \\n    for (const indicator of indicators) {\\n      if (JSON.stringify(data).includes(indicator)) {\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    for (const pattern of knownAttackPatterns) {\\n      if (this.matchesPattern(data, pattern)) {\\n        return true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  private matchesPattern(data: AnomalyData, pattern: string): boolean {\\n    const dataString = JSON.stringify(data);\\n    const regex = new RegExp(pattern, 'i');\\n    return regex.test(dataString);\\n  }\\n\\n  getThreat(threatId: string): Threat | undefined {\\n    return this.threats.get(threatId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getThreats(filter?: {\\n    status?: Threat['status'];\\n    severity?: Threat['severity'];\\n    type?: string;\\n    startDate?: number;\\n    endDate?: number;\\n  }): Threat[] {\\n    let threats = Array.from(this.threats.values());\\n    \\n    if (filter) {\\n      if (filter.status) {\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.status === filter.status);\\n      }\\n      \\n      if (filter.severity) {\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.severity === filter.severity);\\n      }\\n      \\n      if (filter.type) {\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.type === filter.type);\\n      }\\n      \\n      if (filter.startDate) {\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.timestamp >= filter.startDate!);\\n      }\\n      \\n      if (filter.endDate) {\\n        threats = threats.filter(t => t.timestamp <= filter.endDate!);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    return threats.sort((a, b) => b.timestamp - a.timestamp);\\n  }\\n\\n  getThreatStatistics(): {\\n    total: number;\\n    byStatus: Record<string, number>;\\n    bySeverity: Record<string, number>;\\n    byType: Record<string, number>;\\n  } {\\n    const threats = Array.from(this.threats.values());\\n    \\n    return {\\n      total: threats.length,\\n      byStatus: this.groupBy(threats, 'status'),\\n      bySeverity: this.groupBy(threats, 'severity'),\\n      byType: this.groupBy(threats, 'type')\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private groupBy(threats: Threat[], key: keyof Threat): Record<string, number> {\\n    return threats.reduce((acc, threat) => {\\n      const value = threat[key] as string;\\n      acc[value] = (acc[value] || 0) + 1;\\n      return acc;\\n    }, {} as Record<string, number>);\\n  }\\n\\n  async cleanupOldThreats(): Promise<number> {\\n    const cutoffDate = Date.now() - (this.THREAT_RETENTION_DAYS * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\\n    let cleanedCount = 0;\\n    \\n    for (const [id, threat] of this.threats.entries()) {\\n      if (threat.timestamp < cutoffDate && threat.status === 'resolved') {\\n        this.threats.delete(id);\\n        cleanedCount++;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    this.emit('threats_cleaned', { count: cleanedCount });\\n    return cleanedCount;\\n  }\\n\\n  getAnomalyEngine(): AnomalyDetectionEngine {\\n    return this.anomalyEngine;\\n  }\\n\\n  getThreatIntelligence(): ThreatIntelligence {\\n    return this.threatIntelligence;\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":8964,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647430553}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/security/threat-detection/ThreatResponseSystem.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":435,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":435,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\nimport { Threat, ThreatDetector } from \\\\'./ThreatDetector\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface ResponseAction {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  type: string;\\\\n  description: string;\\\\n  status: \\\\'pending\\\\' | \\\\'executing\\\\' | \\\\'completed\\\\' | \\\\'failed\\\\';\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  result?: any;\\\\n  error?: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface ResponsePlan {\\\\n  threatId: string;\\\\n  actions: ResponseAction[];\\\\n  status: \\\\'created\\\\' | \\\\'executing\\\\' | \\\\'completed\\\\' | \\\\'failed\\\\';\\\\n  createdAt: number;\\\\n  completedAt?: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface AutomatedResponse {\\\\n  triggerCondition: string;\\\\n  actions: string[];\\\\n  enabled: boolean;\\\\n  lastExecuted?: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class ThreatResponseSystem extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private threatDetector: ThreatDetector;\\\\n  private responsePlans: Map<string, ResponsePlan> = new Map();\\\\n  private automatedResponses: Map<string, AutomatedResponse> = new Map();\\\\n  private readonly RESPONSE_TIMEOUT = 300000; // 5 minutes\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(threatDetector: ThreatDetector) {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.threatDetector = threatDetector;\\\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\\\n    this.initializeAutomatedResponses();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\\\n    this.threatDetector.on(\\\\'threat_detected\\\\', async (threat: Threat) => {\\\\n      await this.handleThreatDetected(threat);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.threatDetector.on(\\\\'critical_threat\\\\', async (threat: Threat) => {\\\\n      await this.handleCriticalThreat(threat);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.threatDetector.on(\\\\'threat_resolved\\\\', (data: any) => {\\\\n      this.handleThreatResolved(data);\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeAutomatedResponses(): void {\\\\n    this.automatedResponses.set(\\\\'network_anomaly_critical\\\\', {\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'type=network_anomaly AND severity=critical\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\'block_suspicious_ips\\\\', \\\\'enable_firewall_rules\\\\', \\\\'rate_limit_requests\\\\'],\\\\n      enabled: true\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.automatedResponses.set(\\\\'resource_anomaly_high\\\\', {\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'type=resource_anomaly AND severity=high\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\'scale_resources\\\\', \\\\'throttle_requests\\\\', \\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\'],\\\\n      enabled: true\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.automatedResponses.set(\\\\'traffic_anomaly_critical\\\\', {\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'type=traffic_anomaly AND severity=critical\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\'enable_ddos_protection\\\\', \\\\'activate_cdn\\\\', \\\\'enable_rate_limiting\\\\'],\\\\n      enabled: true\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.automatedResponses.set(\\\\'error_anomaly_high\\\\', {\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'type=error_anomaly AND severity=high\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\'enable_circuit_breaker\\\\', \\\\'enable_fallback_mode\\\\', \\\\'notify_on_call_team\\\\'],\\\\n      enabled: true\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async handleThreatDetected(threat: Threat): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const automatedResponse = this.findMatchingAutomatedResponse(threat);\\\\n    \\\\n    if (automatedResponse && automatedResponse.enabled) {\\\\n      await this.executeAutomatedResponse(threat, automatedResponse);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async handleCriticalThreat(threat: Threat): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.createAndExecuteResponsePlan(threat, true);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private handleThreatResolved(data: any): void {\\\\n    const { threat } = data;\\\\n    const plan = this.responsePlans.get(threat.id);\\\\n    \\\\n    if (plan) {\\\\n      plan.status = \\\\'completed\\\\';\\\\n      plan.completedAt = Date.now();\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'response_plan_completed\\\\', plan);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private findMatchingAutomatedResponse(threat: Threat): AutomatedResponse | undefined {\\\\n    for (const [key, response] of this.automatedResponses.entries()) {\\\\n      if (this.matchesCondition(threat, response.triggerCondition)) {\\\\n        return response;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    return undefined;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private matchesCondition(threat: Threat, condition: string): boolean {\\\\n    const conditions = condition.split(\\\\' AND \\\\');\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const cond of conditions) {\\\\n      const [key, value] = cond.split(\\\\'=\\\\');\\\\n      const threatValue = (threat as any)[key.trim()];\\\\n      \\\\n      if (threatValue !== value.trim()) {\\\\n        return false;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return true;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async executeAutomatedResponse(threat: Threat, response: AutomatedResponse): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'automated_response_triggered\\\\', { threat, response });\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const action of response.actions) {\\\\n      try {\\\\n        await this.executeAction(threat, action);\\\\n        response.lastExecuted = Date.now();\\\\n      } catch (error) {\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'automated_response_failed\\\\', { threat, action, error });\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async createResponsePlan(threatId: string, actions: string[]): Promise<ResponsePlan> {\\\\n    const threat = this.threatDetector.getThreat(threatId);\\\\n    if (!threat) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Threat ${threatId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const plan: ResponsePlan = {\\\\n      threatId,\\\\n      actions: actions.map(action => ({\\\\n        id: `action-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`,\\\\n        type: action,\\\\n        description: this.getActionDescription(action),\\\\n        status: \\\\'pending\\\\',\\\\n        timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n      })),\\\\n      status: \\\\'created\\\\',\\\\n      createdAt: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.responsePlans.set(threatId, plan);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'response_plan_created\\\\', plan);\\\\n\\\\n    return plan;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async createAndExecuteResponsePlan(threat: Threat, immediate: boolean = false): Promise<ResponsePlan> {\\\\n    const actions = this.getRecommendedActions(threat);\\\\n    const plan = await this.createResponsePlan(threat.id, actions);\\\\n    \\\\n    if (immediate) {\\\\n      await this.executeResponsePlan(plan.threatId);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return plan;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getRecommendedActions(threat: Threat): string[] {\\\\n    const actions: string[] = [];\\\\n    \\\\n    switch (threat.type) {\\\\n      case \\\\'network_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'block_suspicious_ips\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_firewall_rules\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'rate_limit_requests\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'monitor_network_traffic\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'resource_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'scale_resources\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'throttle_requests\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'monitor_resource_usage\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'traffic_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_ddos_protection\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'activate_cdn\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_rate_limiting\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'monitor_traffic_patterns\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'error_anomaly\\\\':\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_circuit_breaker\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_fallback_mode\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'analyze_error_logs\\\\');\\\\n        break;\\\\n        \\\\n      default:\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'enable_monitoring\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'log_detailed_metrics\\\\');\\\\n        actions.push(\\\\'notify_security_team\\\\');\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return actions;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getActionDescription(action: string): string {\\\\n    const descriptions: Record<string, string> = {\\\\n      \\\\'block_suspicious_ips\\\\': \\\\'阻止可疑IP地址访问\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'enable_firewall_rules\\\\': \\\\'启用防火墙规则\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'rate_limit_requests\\\\': \\\\'启用请求速率限制\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'monitor_network_traffic\\\\': \\\\'监控网络流量\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'scale_resources\\\\': \\\\'扩展资源容量\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'throttle_requests\\\\': \\\\'限制请求频率\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\': \\\\'重启受影响的服务\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'monitor_resource_usage\\\\': \\\\'监控资源使用情况\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'enable_ddos_protection\\\\': \\\\'启用DDoS防护\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'activate_cdn\\\\': \\\\'激活CDN加速\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'monitor_traffic_patterns\\\\': \\\\'监控流量模式\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'enable_circuit_breaker\\\\': \\\\'启用断路器\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'enable_fallback_mode\\\\': \\\\'启用降级模式\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'analyze_error_logs\\\\': \\\\'分析错误日志\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'enable_monitoring\\\\': \\\\'启用监控\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'log_detailed_metrics\\\\': \\\\'记录详细指标\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'notify_security_team\\\\': \\\\'通知安全团队\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'notify_on_call_team\\\\': \\\\'通知值班团队\\\\'\\\\n    };\\\\n    \\\\n    return descriptions[action] || action;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async executeResponsePlan(threatId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const plan = this.responsePlans.get(threatId);\\\\n    if (!plan) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Response plan for threat ${threatId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    plan.status = \\\\'executing\\\\';\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'response_plan_started\\\\', plan);\\\\n\\\\n    for (const action of plan.actions) {\\\\n      try {\\\\n        await this.executeActionById(threatId, action.id);\\\\n      } catch (error) {\\\\n        action.status = \\\\'failed\\\\';\\\\n        action.error = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'action_failed\\\\', { threatId, action, error });\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const allCompleted = plan.actions.every(a => a.status === \\\\'completed\\\\');\\\\n    const anyFailed = plan.actions.some(a => a.status === \\\\'failed\\\\');\\\\n\\\\n    plan.status = allCompleted ? \\\\'completed\\\\' : (anyFailed ? \\\\'failed\\\\' : \\\\'executing\\\\');\\\\n    plan.completedAt = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'response_plan_completed\\\\', plan);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async executeActionById(threatId: string, actionId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const plan = this.responsePlans.get(threatId);\\\\n    if (!plan) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Response plan for threat ${threatId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const action = plan.actions.find(a => a.id === actionId);\\\\n    if (!action) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Action ${actionId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    await this.executeAction(this.threatDetector.getThreat(threatId)!, action.type);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async executeAction(threat: Threat | undefined, actionType: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'action_executing\\\\', { threat, actionType });\\\\n\\\\n    switch (actionType) {\\\\n      case \\\\'block_suspicious_ips\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.blockSuspiciousIPs(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'enable_firewall_rules\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.enableFirewallRules(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'rate_limit_requests\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.rateLimitRequests(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'scale_resources\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.scaleResources(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'throttle_requests\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.throttleRequests(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.restartAffectedServices(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'enable_ddos_protection\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.enableDDoSProtection(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'activate_cdn\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.activateCDN(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'enable_circuit_breaker\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.enableCircuitBreaker(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'enable_fallback_mode\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.enableFallbackMode(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'notify_security_team\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.notifySecurityTeam(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'notify_on_call_team\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.notifyOnCallTeam(threat);\\\\n        \\\\n      default:\\\\n        return await this.logDetailedMetrics(threat);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async blockSuspiciousIPs(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'block_suspicious_ips\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已阻止可疑IP地址\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async enableFirewallRules(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'enable_firewall_rules\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已启用防火墙规则\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async rateLimitRequests(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'rate_limit_requests\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已启用请求速率限制\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async scaleResources(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'scale_resources\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已扩展资源容量\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async throttleRequests(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'throttle_requests\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已限制请求频率\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async restartAffectedServices(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'restart_affected_services\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已重启受影响的服务\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async enableDDoSProtection(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'enable_ddos_protection\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已启用DDoS防护\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async activateCDN(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'activate_cdn\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已激活CDN加速\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async enableCircuitBreaker(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'enable_circuit_breaker\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已启用断路器\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async enableFallbackMode(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'enable_fallback_mode\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已启用降级模式\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async notifySecurityTeam(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'notify_security_team\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已通知安全团队\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async notifyOnCallTeam(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'notify_on_call_team\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已通知值班团队\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async logDetailedMetrics(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'log_detailed_metrics\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: \\\\'已记录详细指标\\\\',\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getResponsePlan(threatId: string): ResponsePlan | undefined {\\\\n    return this.responsePlans.get(threatId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAllResponsePlans(): ResponsePlan[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.responsePlans.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAutomatedResponses(): AutomatedResponse[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.automatedResponses.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async enableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const response = this.automatedResponses.get(key);\\\\n    if (!response) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Automated response ${key} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    response.enabled = true;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'automated_response_enabled\\\\', key);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async disableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const response = this.automatedResponses.get(key);\\\\n    if (!response) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Automated response ${key} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    response.enabled = false;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'automated_response_disabled\\\\', key);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addCustomAutomatedResponse(\\\\n    key: string,\\\\n    triggerCondition: string,\\\\n    actions: string[]\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.automatedResponses.set(key, {\\\\n      triggerCondition,\\\\n      actions,\\\\n      enabled: true\\\\n    });\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'custom_automated_response_added\\\\', { key, triggerCondition, actions });\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\nimport { Threat, ThreatDetector } from './ThreatDetector';\\n\\nexport interface ResponseAction {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  status: 'pending' | 'executing' | 'completed' | 'failed';\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  result?: any;\\n  error?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ResponsePlan {\\n  threatId: string;\\n  actions: ResponseAction[];\\n  status: 'created' | 'executing' | 'completed' | 'failed';\\n  createdAt: number;\\n  completedAt?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AutomatedResponse {\\n  triggerCondition: string;\\n  actions: string[];\\n  enabled: boolean;\\n  lastExecuted?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class ThreatResponseSystem extends EventEmitter {\\n  private threatDetector: ThreatDetector;\\n  private responsePlans: Map<string, ResponsePlan> = new Map();\\n  private automatedResponses: Map<string, AutomatedResponse> = new Map();\\n  private readonly RESPONSE_TIMEOUT = 300000; // 5 minutes\\n\\n  constructor(threatDetector: ThreatDetector) {\\n    super();\\n    this.threatDetector = threatDetector;\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\n    this.initializeAutomatedResponses();\\n  }\\n\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\n    this.threatDetector.on('threat_detected', async (threat: Threat) => {\\n      await this.handleThreatDetected(threat);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.threatDetector.on('critical_threat', async (threat: Threat) => {\\n      await this.handleCriticalThreat(threat);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.threatDetector.on('threat_resolved', (data: any) => {\\n      this.handleThreatResolved(data);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeAutomatedResponses(): void {\\n    this.automatedResponses.set('network_anomaly_critical', {\\n      triggerCondition: 'type=network_anomaly AND severity=critical',\\n      actions: ['block_suspicious_ips', 'enable_firewall_rules', 'rate_limit_requests'],\\n      enabled: true\\n    });\\n\\n    this.automatedResponses.set('resource_anomaly_high', {\\n      triggerCondition: 'type=resource_anomaly AND severity=high',\\n      actions: ['scale_resources', 'throttle_requests', 'restart_affected_services'],\\n      enabled: true\\n    });\\n\\n    this.automatedResponses.set('traffic_anomaly_critical', {\\n      triggerCondition: 'type=traffic_anomaly AND severity=critical',\\n      actions: ['enable_ddos_protection', 'activate_cdn', 'enable_rate_limiting'],\\n      enabled: true\\n    });\\n\\n    this.automatedResponses.set('error_anomaly_high', {\\n      triggerCondition: 'type=error_anomaly AND severity=high',\\n      actions: ['enable_circuit_breaker', 'enable_fallback_mode', 'notify_on_call_team'],\\n      enabled: true\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  private async handleThreatDetected(threat: Threat): Promise<void> {\\n    const automatedResponse = this.findMatchingAutomatedResponse(threat);\\n    \\n    if (automatedResponse && automatedResponse.enabled) {\\n      await this.executeAutomatedResponse(threat, automatedResponse);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async handleCriticalThreat(threat: Threat): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.createAndExecuteResponsePlan(threat, true);\\n  }\\n\\n  private handleThreatResolved(data: any): void {\\n    const { threat } = data;\\n    const plan = this.responsePlans.get(threat.id);\\n    \\n    if (plan) {\\n      plan.status = 'completed';\\n      plan.completedAt = Date.now();\\n      this.emit('response_plan_completed', plan);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private findMatchingAutomatedResponse(threat: Threat): AutomatedResponse | undefined {\\n    for (const [key, response] of this.automatedResponses.entries()) {\\n      if (this.matchesCondition(threat, response.triggerCondition)) {\\n        return response;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return undefined;\\n  }\\n\\n  private matchesCondition(threat: Threat, condition: string): boolean {\\n    const conditions = condition.split(' AND ');\\n    \\n    for (const cond of conditions) {\\n      const [key, value] = cond.split('=');\\n      const threatValue = (threat as any)[key.trim()];\\n      \\n      if (threatValue !== value.trim()) {\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async executeAutomatedResponse(threat: Threat, response: AutomatedResponse): Promise<void> {\\n    this.emit('automated_response_triggered', { threat, response });\\n    \\n    for (const action of response.actions) {\\n      try {\\n        await this.executeAction(threat, action);\\n        response.lastExecuted = Date.now();\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        this.emit('automated_response_failed', { threat, action, error });\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async createResponsePlan(threatId: string, actions: string[]): Promise<ResponsePlan> {\\n    const threat = this.threatDetector.getThreat(threatId);\\n    if (!threat) {\\n      throw new Error(`Threat ${threatId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const plan: ResponsePlan = {\\n      threatId,\\n      actions: actions.map(action => ({\\n        id: `action-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`,\\n        type: action,\\n        description: this.getActionDescription(action),\\n        status: 'pending',\\n        timestamp: Date.now()\\n      })),\\n      status: 'created',\\n      createdAt: Date.now()\\n    };\\n\\n    this.responsePlans.set(threatId, plan);\\n    this.emit('response_plan_created', plan);\\n\\n    return plan;\\n  }\\n\\n  async createAndExecuteResponsePlan(threat: Threat, immediate: boolean = false): Promise<ResponsePlan> {\\n    const actions = this.getRecommendedActions(threat);\\n    const plan = await this.createResponsePlan(threat.id, actions);\\n    \\n    if (immediate) {\\n      await this.executeResponsePlan(plan.threatId);\\n    }\\n    \\n    return plan;\\n  }\\n\\n  private getRecommendedActions(threat: Threat): string[] {\\n    const actions: string[] = [];\\n    \\n    switch (threat.type) {\\n      case 'network_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('block_suspicious_ips');\\n        actions.push('enable_firewall_rules');\\n        actions.push('rate_limit_requests');\\n        actions.push('monitor_network_traffic');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      case 'resource_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('scale_resources');\\n        actions.push('throttle_requests');\\n        actions.push('restart_affected_services');\\n        actions.push('monitor_resource_usage');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      case 'traffic_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('enable_ddos_protection');\\n        actions.push('activate_cdn');\\n        actions.push('enable_rate_limiting');\\n        actions.push('monitor_traffic_patterns');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      case 'error_anomaly':\\n        actions.push('enable_circuit_breaker');\\n        actions.push('enable_fallback_mode');\\n        actions.push('restart_affected_services');\\n        actions.push('analyze_error_logs');\\n        break;\\n        \\n      default:\\n        actions.push('enable_monitoring');\\n        actions.push('log_detailed_metrics');\\n        actions.push('notify_security_team');\\n    }\\n    \\n    return actions;\\n  }\\n\\n  private getActionDescription(action: string): string {\\n    const descriptions: Record<string, string> = {\\n      'block_suspicious_ips': '阻止可疑IP地址访问',\\n      'enable_firewall_rules': '启用防火墙规则',\\n      'rate_limit_requests': '启用请求速率限制',\\n      'monitor_network_traffic': '监控网络流量',\\n      'scale_resources': '扩展资源容量',\\n      'throttle_requests': '限制请求频率',\\n      'restart_affected_services': '重启受影响的服务',\\n      'monitor_resource_usage': '监控资源使用情况',\\n      'enable_ddos_protection': '启用DDoS防护',\\n      'activate_cdn': '激活CDN加速',\\n      'monitor_traffic_patterns': '监控流量模式',\\n      'enable_circuit_breaker': '启用断路器',\\n      'enable_fallback_mode': '启用降级模式',\\n      'analyze_error_logs': '分析错误日志',\\n      'enable_monitoring': '启用监控',\\n      'log_detailed_metrics': '记录详细指标',\\n      'notify_security_team': '通知安全团队',\\n      'notify_on_call_team': '通知值班团队'\\n    };\\n    \\n    return descriptions[action] || action;\\n  }\\n\\n  async executeResponsePlan(threatId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const plan = this.responsePlans.get(threatId);\\n    if (!plan) {\\n      throw new Error(`Response plan for threat ${threatId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    plan.status = 'executing';\\n    this.emit('response_plan_started', plan);\\n\\n    for (const action of plan.actions) {\\n      try {\\n        await this.executeActionById(threatId, action.id);\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        action.status = 'failed';\\n        action.error = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\\n        this.emit('action_failed', { threatId, action, error });\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    const allCompleted = plan.actions.every(a => a.status === 'completed');\\n    const anyFailed = plan.actions.some(a => a.status === 'failed');\\n\\n    plan.status = allCompleted ? 'completed' : (anyFailed ? 'failed' : 'executing');\\n    plan.completedAt = Date.now();\\n\\n    this.emit('response_plan_completed', plan);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async executeActionById(threatId: string, actionId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const plan = this.responsePlans.get(threatId);\\n    if (!plan) {\\n      throw new Error(`Response plan for threat ${threatId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const action = plan.actions.find(a => a.id === actionId);\\n    if (!action) {\\n      throw new Error(`Action ${actionId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    await this.executeAction(this.threatDetector.getThreat(threatId)!, action.type);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async executeAction(threat: Threat | undefined, actionType: string): Promise<any> {\\n    this.emit('action_executing', { threat, actionType });\\n\\n    switch (actionType) {\\n      case 'block_suspicious_ips':\\n        return await this.blockSuspiciousIPs(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'enable_firewall_rules':\\n        return await this.enableFirewallRules(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'rate_limit_requests':\\n        return await this.rateLimitRequests(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'scale_resources':\\n        return await this.scaleResources(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'throttle_requests':\\n        return await this.throttleRequests(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'restart_affected_services':\\n        return await this.restartAffectedServices(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'enable_ddos_protection':\\n        return await this.enableDDoSProtection(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'activate_cdn':\\n        return await this.activateCDN(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'enable_circuit_breaker':\\n        return await this.enableCircuitBreaker(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'enable_fallback_mode':\\n        return await this.enableFallbackMode(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'notify_security_team':\\n        return await this.notifySecurityTeam(threat);\\n        \\n      case 'notify_on_call_team':\\n        return await this.notifyOnCallTeam(threat);\\n        \\n      default:\\n        return await this.logDetailedMetrics(threat);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async blockSuspiciousIPs(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'block_suspicious_ips',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已阻止可疑IP地址',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async enableFirewallRules(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'enable_firewall_rules',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已启用防火墙规则',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async rateLimitRequests(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'rate_limit_requests',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已启用请求速率限制',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async scaleResources(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'scale_resources',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已扩展资源容量',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async throttleRequests(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'throttle_requests',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已限制请求频率',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async restartAffectedServices(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'restart_affected_services',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已重启受影响的服务',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async enableDDoSProtection(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'enable_ddos_protection',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已启用DDoS防护',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async activateCDN(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'activate_cdn',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已激活CDN加速',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async enableCircuitBreaker(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'enable_circuit_breaker',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已启用断路器',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async enableFallbackMode(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'enable_fallback_mode',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已启用降级模式',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async notifySecurityTeam(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'notify_security_team',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已通知安全团队',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async notifyOnCallTeam(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'notify_on_call_team',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已通知值班团队',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async logDetailedMetrics(threat?: Threat): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'log_detailed_metrics',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: '已记录详细指标',\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  getResponsePlan(threatId: string): ResponsePlan | undefined {\\n    return this.responsePlans.get(threatId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getAllResponsePlans(): ResponsePlan[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.responsePlans.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  getAutomatedResponses(): AutomatedResponse[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.automatedResponses.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  async enableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const response = this.automatedResponses.get(key);\\n    if (!response) {\\n      throw new Error(`Automated response ${key} not found`);\\n    }\\n    response.enabled = true;\\n    this.emit('automated_response_enabled', key);\\n  }\\n\\n  async disableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const response = this.automatedResponses.get(key);\\n    if (!response) {\\n      throw new Error(`Automated response ${key} not found`);\\n    }\\n    response.enabled = false;\\n    this.emit('automated_response_disabled', key);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addCustomAutomatedResponse(\\n    key: string,\\n    triggerCondition: string,\\n    actions: string[]\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    this.automatedResponses.set(key, {\\n      triggerCondition,\\n      actions,\\n      enabled: true\\n    });\\n    this.emit('custom_automated_response_added', { key, triggerCondition, actions });\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":14401,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647472431}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/security/threat-detection/ThreatDetectionSystem.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":170,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":170,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\nimport { ThreatDetector } from \\\\'./ThreatDetector\\\\';\\\\nimport { ThreatResponseSystem } from \\\\'./ThreatResponseSystem\\\\';\\\\nimport { AnomalyDetectionEngine, AnomalyData } from \\\\'./AnomalyDetectionEngine\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface ThreatDetectionSystemConfig {\\\\n  enableAutomatedResponse?: boolean;\\\\n  enableRealTimeDetection?: boolean;\\\\n  detectionInterval?: number;\\\\n  retentionDays?: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class ThreatDetectionSystem extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private threatDetector: ThreatDetector;\\\\n  private responseSystem: ThreatResponseSystem;\\\\n  private config: ThreatDetectionSystemConfig;\\\\n  private detectionInterval?: NodeJS.Timeout;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(config: ThreatDetectionSystemConfig = {}) {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.config = {\\\\n      enableAutomatedResponse: true,\\\\n      enableRealTimeDetection: true,\\\\n      detectionInterval: 5000,\\\\n      retentionDays: 90,\\\\n      ...config\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.threatDetector = new ThreatDetector();\\\\n    this.responseSystem = new ThreatResponseSystem(this.threatDetector);\\\\n\\\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\\\n    this.threatDetector.on(\\\\'threat_detected\\\\', (threat) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'threat_detected\\\\', threat);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.threatDetector.on(\\\\'critical_threat\\\\', (threat) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'critical_threat\\\\', threat);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.threatDetector.on(\\\\'threat_resolved\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'threat_resolved\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseSystem.on(\\\\'response_plan_created\\\\', (plan) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'response_plan_created\\\\', plan);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseSystem.on(\\\\'response_plan_completed\\\\', (plan) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'response_plan_completed\\\\', plan);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseSystem.on(\\\\'automated_response_triggered\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'automated_response_triggered\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async start(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (this.config.enableRealTimeDetection) {\\\\n      this.detectionInterval = setInterval(async () => {\\\\n        await this.performDetectionCycle();\\\\n      }, this.config.detectionInterval);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'system_started\\\\', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async stop(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (this.detectionInterval) {\\\\n      clearInterval(this.detectionInterval);\\\\n      this.detectionInterval = undefined;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'system_stopped\\\\', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async performDetectionCycle(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    try {\\\\n      const metrics = await this.collectSystemMetrics();\\\\n      \\\\n      for (const metric of metrics) {\\\\n        await this.threatDetector.detectThreat(metric);\\\\n      }\\\\n    } catch (error) {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'detection_cycle_error\\\\', error);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async collectSystemMetrics(): Promise<AnomalyData[]> {\\\\n    const metrics: AnomalyData[] = [];\\\\n    const timestamp = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n    metrics.push({\\\\n      timestamp,\\\\n      metrics: {\\\\n        cpu_usage: await this.getCPUUsage(),\\\\n        memory_usage: await this.getMemoryUsage(),\\\\n        disk_usage: await this.getDiskUsage(),\\\\n        network_in: await this.getNetworkIn(),\\\\n        network_out: await this.getNetworkOut(),\\\\n        request_count: await this.getRequestCount(),\\\\n        error_count: await this.getErrorCount(),\\\\n        response_time: await this.getResponseTime()\\\\n      },\\\\n      source: \\\\'system_metrics\\\\',\\\\n      sessionId: `session-${timestamp}`\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    return metrics;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getCPUUsage(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.random() * 100;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getMemoryUsage(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.random() * 100;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getDiskUsage(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.random() * 100;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getNetworkIn(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.random() * 1000;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getNetworkOut(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.random() * 1000;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getRequestCount(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getErrorCount(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.floor(Math.random() * 100);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async getResponseTime(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return Math.random() * 1000;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async detectThreat(data: AnomalyData): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return await this.threatDetector.detectThreat(data);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async updateThreatIntelligence(intelligence: any): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.threatDetector.updateThreatIntelligence(intelligence);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getThreats(filter?: any): any[] {\\\\n    return this.threatDetector.getThreats(filter);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getThreatStatistics(): any {\\\\n    return this.threatDetector.getThreatStatistics();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async createResponsePlan(threatId: string, actions: string[]): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return await this.responseSystem.createResponsePlan(threatId, actions);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async executeResponsePlan(threatId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.responseSystem.executeResponsePlan(threatId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getResponsePlans(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.responseSystem.getAllResponsePlans();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAutomatedResponses(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.responseSystem.getAutomatedResponses();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async enableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.responseSystem.enableAutomatedResponse(key);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async disableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.responseSystem.disableAutomatedResponse(key);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async cleanupOldThreats(): Promise<number> {\\\\n    return await this.threatDetector.cleanupOldThreats();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAnomalyEngine(): AnomalyDetectionEngine {\\\\n    return this.threatDetector.getAnomalyEngine();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\\\n    isRunning: boolean;\\\\n    config: ThreatDetectionSystemConfig;\\\\n    threatCount: number;\\\\n    responsePlanCount: number;\\\\n    automatedResponseCount: number;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      isRunning: !!this.detectionInterval,\\\\n      config: this.config,\\\\n      threatCount: this.threatDetector.getThreats().length,\\\\n      responsePlanCount: this.responseSystem.getAllResponsePlans().length,\\\\n      automatedResponseCount: this.responseSystem.getAutomatedResponses().length\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\nimport { ThreatDetector } from './ThreatDetector';\\nimport { ThreatResponseSystem } from './ThreatResponseSystem';\\nimport { AnomalyDetectionEngine, AnomalyData } from './AnomalyDetectionEngine';\\n\\nexport interface ThreatDetectionSystemConfig {\\n  enableAutomatedResponse?: boolean;\\n  enableRealTimeDetection?: boolean;\\n  detectionInterval?: number;\\n  retentionDays?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class ThreatDetectionSystem extends EventEmitter {\\n  private threatDetector: ThreatDetector;\\n  private responseSystem: ThreatResponseSystem;\\n  private config: ThreatDetectionSystemConfig;\\n  private detectionInterval?: NodeJS.Timeout;\\n\\n  constructor(config: ThreatDetectionSystemConfig = {}) {\\n    super();\\n    this.config = {\\n      enableAutomatedResponse: true,\\n      enableRealTimeDetection: true,\\n      detectionInterval: 5000,\\n      retentionDays: 90,\\n      ...config\\n    };\\n\\n    this.threatDetector = new ThreatDetector();\\n    this.responseSystem = new ThreatResponseSystem(this.threatDetector);\\n\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\n  }\\n\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\n    this.threatDetector.on('threat_detected', (threat) => {\\n      this.emit('threat_detected', threat);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.threatDetector.on('critical_threat', (threat) => {\\n      this.emit('critical_threat', threat);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.threatDetector.on('threat_resolved', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('threat_resolved', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.responseSystem.on('response_plan_created', (plan) => {\\n      this.emit('response_plan_created', plan);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.responseSystem.on('response_plan_completed', (plan) => {\\n      this.emit('response_plan_completed', plan);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.responseSystem.on('automated_response_triggered', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('automated_response_triggered', data);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async start(): Promise<void> {\\n    if (this.config.enableRealTimeDetection) {\\n      this.detectionInterval = setInterval(async () => {\\n        await this.performDetectionCycle();\\n      }, this.config.detectionInterval);\\n    }\\n\\n    this.emit('system_started', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  async stop(): Promise<void> {\\n    if (this.detectionInterval) {\\n      clearInterval(this.detectionInterval);\\n      this.detectionInterval = undefined;\\n    }\\n\\n    this.emit('system_stopped', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  private async performDetectionCycle(): Promise<void> {\\n    try {\\n      const metrics = await this.collectSystemMetrics();\\n      \\n      for (const metric of metrics) {\\n        await this.threatDetector.detectThreat(metric);\\n      }\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      this.emit('detection_cycle_error', error);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async collectSystemMetrics(): Promise<AnomalyData[]> {\\n    const metrics: AnomalyData[] = [];\\n    const timestamp = Date.now();\\n\\n    metrics.push({\\n      timestamp,\\n      metrics: {\\n        cpu_usage: await this.getCPUUsage(),\\n        memory_usage: await this.getMemoryUsage(),\\n        disk_usage: await this.getDiskUsage(),\\n        network_in: await this.getNetworkIn(),\\n        network_out: await this.getNetworkOut(),\\n        request_count: await this.getRequestCount(),\\n        error_count: await this.getErrorCount(),\\n        response_time: await this.getResponseTime()\\n      },\\n      source: 'system_metrics',\\n      sessionId: `session-${timestamp}`\\n    });\\n\\n    return metrics;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getCPUUsage(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.random() * 100;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getMemoryUsage(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.random() * 100;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getDiskUsage(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.random() * 100;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getNetworkIn(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.random() * 1000;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getNetworkOut(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.random() * 1000;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getRequestCount(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getErrorCount(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.floor(Math.random() * 100);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async getResponseTime(): Promise<number> {\\n    return Math.random() * 1000;\\n  }\\n\\n  async detectThreat(data: AnomalyData): Promise<any> {\\n    return await this.threatDetector.detectThreat(data);\\n  }\\n\\n  async updateThreatIntelligence(intelligence: any): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.threatDetector.updateThreatIntelligence(intelligence);\\n  }\\n\\n  getThreats(filter?: any): any[] {\\n    return this.threatDetector.getThreats(filter);\\n  }\\n\\n  getThreatStatistics(): any {\\n    return this.threatDetector.getThreatStatistics();\\n  }\\n\\n  async createResponsePlan(threatId: string, actions: string[]): Promise<any> {\\n    return await this.responseSystem.createResponsePlan(threatId, actions);\\n  }\\n\\n  async executeResponsePlan(threatId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.responseSystem.executeResponsePlan(threatId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getResponsePlans(): any[] {\\n    return this.responseSystem.getAllResponsePlans();\\n  }\\n\\n  getAutomatedResponses(): any[] {\\n    return this.responseSystem.getAutomatedResponses();\\n  }\\n\\n  async enableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.responseSystem.enableAutomatedResponse(key);\\n  }\\n\\n  async disableAutomatedResponse(key: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.responseSystem.disableAutomatedResponse(key);\\n  }\\n\\n  async cleanupOldThreats(): Promise<number> {\\n    return await this.threatDetector.cleanupOldThreats();\\n  }\\n\\n  getAnomalyEngine(): AnomalyDetectionEngine {\\n    return this.threatDetector.getAnomalyEngine();\\n  }\\n\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\n    isRunning: boolean;\\n    config: ThreatDetectionSystemConfig;\\n    threatCount: number;\\n    responsePlanCount: number;\\n    automatedResponseCount: number;\\n  } {\\n    return {\\n      isRunning: !!this.detectionInterval,\\n      config: this.config,\\n      threatCount: this.threatDetector.getThreats().length,\\n      responsePlanCount: this.responseSystem.getAllResponsePlans().length,\\n      automatedResponseCount: this.responseSystem.getAutomatedResponses().length\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":5973,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647515759}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/operations/self-healing/SelfHealingEngine.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":493,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":493,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface HealthCheck {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  type: \\\\'service\\\\' | \\\\'resource\\\\' | \\\\'network\\\\' | \\\\'database\\\\' | \\\\'custom\\\\';\\\\n  status: \\\\'healthy\\\\' | \\\\'degraded\\\\' | \\\\'unhealthy\\\\' | \\\\'unknown\\\\';\\\\n  lastChecked: number;\\\\n  checkInterval: number;\\\\n  threshold: number;\\\\n  consecutiveFailures: number;\\\\n  maxFailures: number;\\\\n  metrics: Record<string, number>;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface HealthCheckResult {\\\\n  checkId: string;\\\\n  status: \\\\'healthy\\\\' | \\\\'degraded\\\\' | \\\\'unhealthy\\\\';\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  metrics: Record<string, number>;\\\\n  message?: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface SelfHealingAction {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  type: \\\\'restart\\\\' | \\\\'scale\\\\' | \\\\'rollback\\\\' | \\\\'reconfigure\\\\' | \\\\'cleanup\\\\' | \\\\'custom\\\\';\\\\n  description: string;\\\\n  status: \\\\'pending\\\\' | \\\\'executing\\\\' | \\\\'completed\\\\' | \\\\'failed\\\\';\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  result?: any;\\\\n  error?: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface SelfHealingPolicy {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  triggerCondition: string;\\\\n  actions: SelfHealingAction[];\\\\n  enabled: boolean;\\\\n  priority: number;\\\\n  cooldownPeriod: number;\\\\n  lastExecuted?: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class SelfHealingEngine extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private healthChecks: Map<string, HealthCheck> = new Map();\\\\n  private policies: Map<string, SelfHealingPolicy> = new Map();\\\\n  private checkIntervals: Map<string, NodeJS.Timeout> = new Map();\\\\n  private readonly DEFAULT_CHECK_INTERVAL = 30000; // 30 seconds\\\\n  private readonly DEFAULT_MAX_FAILURES = 3;\\\\n  private readonly DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD = 300000; // 5 minutes\\\\n\\\\n  constructor() {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.initializeDefaultPolicies();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeDefaultPolicies(): void {\\\\n    this.policies.set(\\\\'service_restart\\\\', {\\\\n      id: \\\\'service_restart\\\\',\\\\n      name: \\\\'服务自动重启策略\\\\',\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'status=unhealthy AND type=service\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          id: \\\\'restart_service\\\\',\\\\n          type: \\\\'restart\\\\',\\\\n          description: \\\\'重启失败的服务\\\\',\\\\n          status: \\\\'pending\\\\',\\\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      enabled: true,\\\\n      priority: 1,\\\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.policies.set(\\\\'resource_scale\\\\', {\\\\n      id: \\\\'resource_scale\\\\',\\\\n      name: \\\\'资源自动扩展策略\\\\',\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'status=degraded AND type=resource\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          id: \\\\'scale_resources\\\\',\\\\n          type: \\\\'scale\\\\',\\\\n          description: \\\\'扩展资源容量\\\\',\\\\n          status: \\\\'pending\\\\',\\\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      enabled: true,\\\\n      priority: 2,\\\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.policies.set(\\\\'network_reconfigure\\\\', {\\\\n      id: \\\\'network_reconfigure\\\\',\\\\n      name: \\\\'网络自动重配置策略\\\\',\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'status=unhealthy AND type=network\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          id: \\\\'reconfigure_network\\\\',\\\\n          type: \\\\'reconfigure\\\\',\\\\n          description: \\\\'重新配置网络设置\\\\',\\\\n          status: \\\\'pending\\\\',\\\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      enabled: true,\\\\n      priority: 1,\\\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.policies.set(\\\\'database_rollback\\\\', {\\\\n      id: \\\\'database_rollback\\\\',\\\\n      name: \\\\'数据库自动回滚策略\\\\',\\\\n      triggerCondition: \\\\'status=unhealthy AND type=database\\\\',\\\\n      actions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          id: \\\\'rollback_database\\\\',\\\\n          type: \\\\'rollback\\\\',\\\\n          description: \\\\'回滚数据库到上一个稳定版本\\\\',\\\\n          status: \\\\'pending\\\\',\\\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      enabled: true,\\\\n      priority: 1,\\\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async registerHealthCheck(\\\\n    id: string,\\\\n    name: string,\\\\n    type: HealthCheck[\\\\'type\\\\'],\\\\n    checkFunction: () => Promise<HealthCheckResult>,\\\\n    options?: {\\\\n      checkInterval?: number;\\\\n      threshold?: number;\\\\n      maxFailures?: number;\\\\n    }\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const healthCheck: HealthCheck = {\\\\n      id,\\\\n      name,\\\\n      type,\\\\n      status: \\\\'unknown\\\\',\\\\n      lastChecked: 0,\\\\n      checkInterval: options?.checkInterval || this.DEFAULT_CHECK_INTERVAL,\\\\n      threshold: options?.threshold || 0.8,\\\\n      consecutiveFailures: 0,\\\\n      maxFailures: options?.maxFailures || this.DEFAULT_MAX_FAILURES,\\\\n      metrics: {}\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.healthChecks.set(id, healthCheck);\\\\n    await this.startHealthCheck(id, checkFunction);\\\\n\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'health_check_registered\\\\', healthCheck);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async startHealthCheck(\\\\n    checkId: string,\\\\n    checkFunction: () => Promise<HealthCheckResult>\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Health check ${checkId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const performCheck = async () => {\\\\n      try {\\\\n        const result = await checkFunction();\\\\n        await this.processHealthCheckResult(checkId, result);\\\\n      } catch (error) {\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'health_check_error\\\\', { checkId, error });\\\\n      }\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    await performCheck();\\\\n\\\\n    const interval = setInterval(performCheck, healthCheck.checkInterval);\\\\n    this.checkIntervals.set(checkId, interval);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async processHealthCheckResult(\\\\n    checkId: string,\\\\n    result: HealthCheckResult\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    healthCheck.lastChecked = result.timestamp;\\\\n    healthCheck.metrics = result.metrics;\\\\n\\\\n    if (result.status === \\\\'unhealthy\\\\') {\\\\n      healthCheck.consecutiveFailures++;\\\\n      \\\\n      if (healthCheck.consecutiveFailures >= healthCheck.maxFailures) {\\\\n        healthCheck.status = \\\\'unhealthy\\\\';\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'health_check_failed\\\\', { checkId, result });\\\\n        await this.triggerSelfHealing(checkId, result);\\\\n      } else {\\\\n        healthCheck.status = \\\\'degraded\\\\';\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'health_check_degraded\\\\', { checkId, result });\\\\n      }\\\\n    } else if (result.status === \\\\'degraded\\\\') {\\\\n      healthCheck.consecutiveFailures = 0;\\\\n      healthCheck.status = \\\\'degraded\\\\';\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'health_check_degraded\\\\', { checkId, result });\\\\n    } else {\\\\n      healthCheck.consecutiveFailures = 0;\\\\n      healthCheck.status = \\\\'healthy\\\\';\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'health_check_healthy\\\\', { checkId, result });\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async triggerSelfHealing(\\\\n    checkId: string,\\\\n    result: HealthCheckResult\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const applicablePolicies = this.findApplicablePolicies(healthCheck);\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const policy of applicablePolicies) {\\\\n      if (!policy.enabled) continue;\\\\n      \\\\n      if (policy.lastExecuted) {\\\\n        const timeSinceLastExecution = Date.now() - policy.lastExecuted;\\\\n        if (timeSinceLastExecution < policy.cooldownPeriod) {\\\\n          continue;\\\\n        }\\\\n      }\\\\n\\\\n      await this.executeSelfHealingPolicy(policy, checkId, result);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private findApplicablePolicies(healthCheck: HealthCheck): SelfHealingPolicy[] {\\\\n    const policies = Array.from(this.policies.values());\\\\n    \\\\n    return policies\\\\n      .filter(policy => this.matchesPolicyCondition(healthCheck, policy.triggerCondition))\\\\n      .sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private matchesPolicyCondition(\\\\n    healthCheck: HealthCheck,\\\\n    condition: string\\\\n  ): boolean {\\\\n    const conditions = condition.split(\\\\' AND \\\\');\\\\n    \\\\n    for (const cond of conditions) {\\\\n      const [key, value] = cond.split(\\\\'=\\\\');\\\\n      const healthCheckValue = (healthCheck as any)[key.trim()];\\\\n      \\\\n      if (healthCheckValue !== value.trim()) {\\\\n        return false;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return true;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async executeSelfHealingPolicy(\\\\n    policy: SelfHealingPolicy,\\\\n    checkId: string,\\\\n    result: HealthCheckResult\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'self_healing_started\\\\', { policy, checkId });\\\\n    policy.lastExecuted = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n    for (const action of policy.actions) {\\\\n      action.status = \\\\'executing\\\\';\\\\n      action.timestamp = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n      try {\\\\n        const actionResult = await this.executeAction(action, checkId);\\\\n        action.result = actionResult;\\\\n        action.status = \\\\'completed\\\\';\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'self_healing_action_completed\\\\', { policy, action, checkId });\\\\n      } catch (error) {\\\\n        action.status = \\\\'failed\\\\';\\\\n        action.error = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\\\\n        this.emit(\\\\'self_healing_action_failed\\\\', { policy, action, checkId, error });\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'self_healing_completed\\\\', { policy, checkId });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async executeAction(\\\\n    action: SelfHealingAction,\\\\n    checkId: string\\\\n  ): Promise<any> {\\\\n    switch (action.type) {\\\\n      case \\\\'restart\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.restartService(checkId);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'scale\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.scaleResources(checkId);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'rollback\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.rollback(checkId);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'reconfigure\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.reconfigure(checkId);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'cleanup\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.cleanup(checkId);\\\\n        \\\\n      case \\\\'custom\\\\':\\\\n        return await this.executeCustomAction(action, checkId);\\\\n        \\\\n      default:\\\\n        throw new Error(`Unknown action type: ${action.type}`);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async restartService(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'restart\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已重启`,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async scaleResources(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'scale\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: `资源 ${checkId} 已扩展`,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async rollback(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'rollback\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已回滚到上一个稳定版本`,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async reconfigure(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'reconfigure\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已重新配置`,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async cleanup(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'cleanup\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已清理`,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async executeCustomAction(action: SelfHealingAction, checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      action: \\\\'custom\\\\',\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      details: `自定义操作 ${action.id} 已执行`,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async unregisterHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const interval = this.checkIntervals.get(checkId);\\\\n    if (interval) {\\\\n      clearInterval(interval);\\\\n      this.checkIntervals.delete(checkId);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.healthChecks.delete(checkId);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'health_check_unregistered\\\\', checkId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async performManualHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<HealthCheckResult> {\\\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Health check ${checkId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const result = await this.performHealthCheck(checkId);\\\\n    await this.processHealthCheckResult(checkId, result);\\\\n    \\\\n    return result;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async performHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<HealthCheckResult> {\\\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Health check ${checkId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const metrics = await this.collectMetrics(healthCheck.type);\\\\n    const status = this.evaluateHealthStatus(metrics, healthCheck.threshold);\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      checkId,\\\\n      status,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\\\\n      metrics,\\\\n      message: this.getStatusMessage(status)\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async collectMetrics(type: HealthCheck[\\\\'type\\\\']): Promise<Record<string, number>> {\\\\n    const metrics: Record<string, number> = {};\\\\n\\\\n    switch (type) {\\\\n      case \\\\'service\\\\':\\\\n        metrics.cpu_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.memory_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.response_time = Math.random() * 1000;\\\\n        metrics.error_rate = Math.random() * 10;\\\\n        break;\\\\n\\\\n      case \\\\'resource\\\\':\\\\n        metrics.cpu_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.memory_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.disk_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.network_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        break;\\\\n\\\\n      case \\\\'network\\\\':\\\\n        metrics.latency = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.packet_loss = Math.random() * 5;\\\\n        metrics.bandwidth_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.connection_count = Math.random() * 1000;\\\\n        break;\\\\n\\\\n      case \\\\'database\\\\':\\\\n        metrics.query_time = Math.random() * 1000;\\\\n        metrics.connection_pool = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.disk_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.transaction_rate = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        break;\\\\n\\\\n      case \\\\'custom\\\\':\\\\n        metrics.custom_metric_1 = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        metrics.custom_metric_2 = Math.random() * 100;\\\\n        break;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return metrics;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private evaluateHealthStatus(\\\\n    metrics: Record<string, number>,\\\\n    threshold: number\\\\n  ): \\\\'healthy\\\\' | \\\\'degraded\\\\' | \\\\'unhealthy\\\\' {\\\\n    const values = Object.values(metrics);\\\\n    const avgValue = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\\\n\\\\n    if (avgValue < threshold * 0.5) {\\\\n      return \\\\'healthy\\\\';\\\\n    } else if (avgValue < threshold) {\\\\n      return \\\\'degraded\\\\';\\\\n    } else {\\\\n      return \\\\'unhealthy\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getStatusMessage(status: \\\\'healthy\\\\' | \\\\'degraded\\\\' | \\\\'unhealthy\\\\'): string {\\\\n    const messages: Record<string, string> = {\\\\n      healthy: \\\\'系统运行正常\\\\',\\\\n      degraded: \\\\'系统性能下降，需要关注\\\\',\\\\n      unhealthy: \\\\'系统异常，需要立即处理\\\\'\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    return messages[status];\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getHealthCheck(checkId: string): HealthCheck | undefined {\\\\n    return this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAllHealthChecks(): HealthCheck[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.healthChecks.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getHealthChecksByStatus(status: HealthCheck[\\\\'status\\\\']): HealthCheck[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.healthChecks.values()).filter(\\\\n      hc => hc.status === status\\\\n    );\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getPolicy(policyId: string): SelfHealingPolicy | undefined {\\\\n    return this.policies.get(policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAllPolicies(): SelfHealingPolicy[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.policies.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async enablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const policy = this.policies.get(policyId);\\\\n    if (!policy) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Policy ${policyId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    policy.enabled = true;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'policy_enabled\\\\', policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async disablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const policy = this.policies.get(policyId);\\\\n    if (!policy) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Policy ${policyId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n    policy.enabled = false;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'policy_disabled\\\\', policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addCustomPolicy(policy: SelfHealingPolicy): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.policies.set(policy.id, policy);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'policy_added\\\\', policy);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async removePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.policies.delete(policyId);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'policy_removed\\\\', policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\\\n    totalChecks: number;\\\\n    healthyChecks: number;\\\\n    degradedChecks: number;\\\\n    unhealthyChecks: number;\\\\n    totalPolicies: number;\\\\n    enabledPolicies: number;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    const healthChecks = Array.from(this.healthChecks.values());\\\\n    const policies = Array.from(this.policies.values());\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      totalChecks: healthChecks.length,\\\\n      healthyChecks: healthChecks.filter(hc => hc.status === \\\\'healthy\\\\').length,\\\\n      degradedChecks: healthChecks.filter(hc => hc.status === \\\\'degraded\\\\').length,\\\\n      unhealthyChecks: healthChecks.filter(hc => hc.status === \\\\'unhealthy\\\\').length,\\\\n      totalPolicies: policies.length,\\\\n      enabledPolicies: policies.filter(p => p.enabled).length\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\n\\nexport interface HealthCheck {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  type: 'service' | 'resource' | 'network' | 'database' | 'custom';\\n  status: 'healthy' | 'degraded' | 'unhealthy' | 'unknown';\\n  lastChecked: number;\\n  checkInterval: number;\\n  threshold: number;\\n  consecutiveFailures: number;\\n  maxFailures: number;\\n  metrics: Record<string, number>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface HealthCheckResult {\\n  checkId: string;\\n  status: 'healthy' | 'degraded' | 'unhealthy';\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  metrics: Record<string, number>;\\n  message?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SelfHealingAction {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: 'restart' | 'scale' | 'rollback' | 'reconfigure' | 'cleanup' | 'custom';\\n  description: string;\\n  status: 'pending' | 'executing' | 'completed' | 'failed';\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  result?: any;\\n  error?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SelfHealingPolicy {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  triggerCondition: string;\\n  actions: SelfHealingAction[];\\n  enabled: boolean;\\n  priority: number;\\n  cooldownPeriod: number;\\n  lastExecuted?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class SelfHealingEngine extends EventEmitter {\\n  private healthChecks: Map<string, HealthCheck> = new Map();\\n  private policies: Map<string, SelfHealingPolicy> = new Map();\\n  private checkIntervals: Map<string, NodeJS.Timeout> = new Map();\\n  private readonly DEFAULT_CHECK_INTERVAL = 30000; // 30 seconds\\n  private readonly DEFAULT_MAX_FAILURES = 3;\\n  private readonly DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD = 300000; // 5 minutes\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    super();\\n    this.initializeDefaultPolicies();\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeDefaultPolicies(): void {\\n    this.policies.set('service_restart', {\\n      id: 'service_restart',\\n      name: '服务自动重启策略',\\n      triggerCondition: 'status=unhealthy AND type=service',\\n      actions: [\\n        {\\n          id: 'restart_service',\\n          type: 'restart',\\n          description: '重启失败的服务',\\n          status: 'pending',\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      enabled: true,\\n      priority: 1,\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\n    });\\n\\n    this.policies.set('resource_scale', {\\n      id: 'resource_scale',\\n      name: '资源自动扩展策略',\\n      triggerCondition: 'status=degraded AND type=resource',\\n      actions: [\\n        {\\n          id: 'scale_resources',\\n          type: 'scale',\\n          description: '扩展资源容量',\\n          status: 'pending',\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      enabled: true,\\n      priority: 2,\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\n    });\\n\\n    this.policies.set('network_reconfigure', {\\n      id: 'network_reconfigure',\\n      name: '网络自动重配置策略',\\n      triggerCondition: 'status=unhealthy AND type=network',\\n      actions: [\\n        {\\n          id: 'reconfigure_network',\\n          type: 'reconfigure',\\n          description: '重新配置网络设置',\\n          status: 'pending',\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      enabled: true,\\n      priority: 1,\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\n    });\\n\\n    this.policies.set('database_rollback', {\\n      id: 'database_rollback',\\n      name: '数据库自动回滚策略',\\n      triggerCondition: 'status=unhealthy AND type=database',\\n      actions: [\\n        {\\n          id: 'rollback_database',\\n          type: 'rollback',\\n          description: '回滚数据库到上一个稳定版本',\\n          status: 'pending',\\n          timestamp: Date.now()\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      enabled: true,\\n      priority: 1,\\n      cooldownPeriod: this.DEFAULT_COOLDOWN_PERIOD\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async registerHealthCheck(\\n    id: string,\\n    name: string,\\n    type: HealthCheck['type'],\\n    checkFunction: () => Promise<HealthCheckResult>,\\n    options?: {\\n      checkInterval?: number;\\n      threshold?: number;\\n      maxFailures?: number;\\n    }\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    const healthCheck: HealthCheck = {\\n      id,\\n      name,\\n      type,\\n      status: 'unknown',\\n      lastChecked: 0,\\n      checkInterval: options?.checkInterval || this.DEFAULT_CHECK_INTERVAL,\\n      threshold: options?.threshold || 0.8,\\n      consecutiveFailures: 0,\\n      maxFailures: options?.maxFailures || this.DEFAULT_MAX_FAILURES,\\n      metrics: {}\\n    };\\n\\n    this.healthChecks.set(id, healthCheck);\\n    await this.startHealthCheck(id, checkFunction);\\n\\n    this.emit('health_check_registered', healthCheck);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async startHealthCheck(\\n    checkId: string,\\n    checkFunction: () => Promise<HealthCheckResult>\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\n      throw new Error(`Health check ${checkId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const performCheck = async () => {\\n      try {\\n        const result = await checkFunction();\\n        await this.processHealthCheckResult(checkId, result);\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        this.emit('health_check_error', { checkId, error });\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    await performCheck();\\n\\n    const interval = setInterval(performCheck, healthCheck.checkInterval);\\n    this.checkIntervals.set(checkId, interval);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async processHealthCheckResult(\\n    checkId: string,\\n    result: HealthCheckResult\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    healthCheck.lastChecked = result.timestamp;\\n    healthCheck.metrics = result.metrics;\\n\\n    if (result.status === 'unhealthy') {\\n      healthCheck.consecutiveFailures++;\\n      \\n      if (healthCheck.consecutiveFailures >= healthCheck.maxFailures) {\\n        healthCheck.status = 'unhealthy';\\n        this.emit('health_check_failed', { checkId, result });\\n        await this.triggerSelfHealing(checkId, result);\\n      } else {\\n        healthCheck.status = 'degraded';\\n        this.emit('health_check_degraded', { checkId, result });\\n      }\\n    } else if (result.status === 'degraded') {\\n      healthCheck.consecutiveFailures = 0;\\n      healthCheck.status = 'degraded';\\n      this.emit('health_check_degraded', { checkId, result });\\n    } else {\\n      healthCheck.consecutiveFailures = 0;\\n      healthCheck.status = 'healthy';\\n      this.emit('health_check_healthy', { checkId, result });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async triggerSelfHealing(\\n    checkId: string,\\n    result: HealthCheckResult\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const applicablePolicies = this.findApplicablePolicies(healthCheck);\\n    \\n    for (const policy of applicablePolicies) {\\n      if (!policy.enabled) continue;\\n      \\n      if (policy.lastExecuted) {\\n        const timeSinceLastExecution = Date.now() - policy.lastExecuted;\\n        if (timeSinceLastExecution < policy.cooldownPeriod) {\\n          continue;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      await this.executeSelfHealingPolicy(policy, checkId, result);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private findApplicablePolicies(healthCheck: HealthCheck): SelfHealingPolicy[] {\\n    const policies = Array.from(this.policies.values());\\n    \\n    return policies\\n      .filter(policy => this.matchesPolicyCondition(healthCheck, policy.triggerCondition))\\n      .sort((a, b) => a.priority - b.priority);\\n  }\\n\\n  private matchesPolicyCondition(\\n    healthCheck: HealthCheck,\\n    condition: string\\n  ): boolean {\\n    const conditions = condition.split(' AND ');\\n    \\n    for (const cond of conditions) {\\n      const [key, value] = cond.split('=');\\n      const healthCheckValue = (healthCheck as any)[key.trim()];\\n      \\n      if (healthCheckValue !== value.trim()) {\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    return true;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async executeSelfHealingPolicy(\\n    policy: SelfHealingPolicy,\\n    checkId: string,\\n    result: HealthCheckResult\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    this.emit('self_healing_started', { policy, checkId });\\n    policy.lastExecuted = Date.now();\\n\\n    for (const action of policy.actions) {\\n      action.status = 'executing';\\n      action.timestamp = Date.now();\\n\\n      try {\\n        const actionResult = await this.executeAction(action, checkId);\\n        action.result = actionResult;\\n        action.status = 'completed';\\n        this.emit('self_healing_action_completed', { policy, action, checkId });\\n      } catch (error) {\\n        action.status = 'failed';\\n        action.error = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\\n        this.emit('self_healing_action_failed', { policy, action, checkId, error });\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    this.emit('self_healing_completed', { policy, checkId });\\n  }\\n\\n  private async executeAction(\\n    action: SelfHealingAction,\\n    checkId: string\\n  ): Promise<any> {\\n    switch (action.type) {\\n      case 'restart':\\n        return await this.restartService(checkId);\\n        \\n      case 'scale':\\n        return await this.scaleResources(checkId);\\n        \\n      case 'rollback':\\n        return await this.rollback(checkId);\\n        \\n      case 'reconfigure':\\n        return await this.reconfigure(checkId);\\n        \\n      case 'cleanup':\\n        return await this.cleanup(checkId);\\n        \\n      case 'custom':\\n        return await this.executeCustomAction(action, checkId);\\n        \\n      default:\\n        throw new Error(`Unknown action type: ${action.type}`);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async restartService(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'restart',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已重启`,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async scaleResources(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'scale',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: `资源 ${checkId} 已扩展`,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async rollback(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'rollback',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已回滚到上一个稳定版本`,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async reconfigure(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'reconfigure',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已重新配置`,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async cleanup(checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'cleanup',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: `服务 ${checkId} 已清理`,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async executeCustomAction(action: SelfHealingAction, checkId: string): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      action: 'custom',\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      details: `自定义操作 ${action.id} 已执行`,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  async unregisterHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const interval = this.checkIntervals.get(checkId);\\n    if (interval) {\\n      clearInterval(interval);\\n      this.checkIntervals.delete(checkId);\\n    }\\n\\n    this.healthChecks.delete(checkId);\\n    this.emit('health_check_unregistered', checkId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async performManualHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<HealthCheckResult> {\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\n      throw new Error(`Health check ${checkId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const result = await this.performHealthCheck(checkId);\\n    await this.processHealthCheckResult(checkId, result);\\n    \\n    return result;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async performHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<HealthCheckResult> {\\n    const healthCheck = this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\n    if (!healthCheck) {\\n      throw new Error(`Health check ${checkId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const metrics = await this.collectMetrics(healthCheck.type);\\n    const status = this.evaluateHealthStatus(metrics, healthCheck.threshold);\\n\\n    return {\\n      checkId,\\n      status,\\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\\n      metrics,\\n      message: this.getStatusMessage(status)\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async collectMetrics(type: HealthCheck['type']): Promise<Record<string, number>> {\\n    const metrics: Record<string, number> = {};\\n\\n    switch (type) {\\n      case 'service':\\n        metrics.cpu_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.memory_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.response_time = Math.random() * 1000;\\n        metrics.error_rate = Math.random() * 10;\\n        break;\\n\\n      case 'resource':\\n        metrics.cpu_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.memory_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.disk_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.network_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        break;\\n\\n      case 'network':\\n        metrics.latency = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.packet_loss = Math.random() * 5;\\n        metrics.bandwidth_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.connection_count = Math.random() * 1000;\\n        break;\\n\\n      case 'database':\\n        metrics.query_time = Math.random() * 1000;\\n        metrics.connection_pool = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.disk_usage = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.transaction_rate = Math.random() * 100;\\n        break;\\n\\n      case 'custom':\\n        metrics.custom_metric_1 = Math.random() * 100;\\n        metrics.custom_metric_2 = Math.random() * 100;\\n        break;\\n    }\\n\\n    return metrics;\\n  }\\n\\n  private evaluateHealthStatus(\\n    metrics: Record<string, number>,\\n    threshold: number\\n  ): 'healthy' | 'degraded' | 'unhealthy' {\\n    const values = Object.values(metrics);\\n    const avgValue = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\n\\n    if (avgValue < threshold * 0.5) {\\n      return 'healthy';\\n    } else if (avgValue < threshold) {\\n      return 'degraded';\\n    } else {\\n      return 'unhealthy';\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private getStatusMessage(status: 'healthy' | 'degraded' | 'unhealthy'): string {\\n    const messages: Record<string, string> = {\\n      healthy: '系统运行正常',\\n      degraded: '系统性能下降，需要关注',\\n      unhealthy: '系统异常，需要立即处理'\\n    };\\n\\n    return messages[status];\\n  }\\n\\n  getHealthCheck(checkId: string): HealthCheck | undefined {\\n    return this.healthChecks.get(checkId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getAllHealthChecks(): HealthCheck[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.healthChecks.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  getHealthChecksByStatus(status: HealthCheck['status']): HealthCheck[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.healthChecks.values()).filter(\\n      hc => hc.status === status\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  getPolicy(policyId: string): SelfHealingPolicy | undefined {\\n    return this.policies.get(policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getAllPolicies(): SelfHealingPolicy[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.policies.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  async enablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const policy = this.policies.get(policyId);\\n    if (!policy) {\\n      throw new Error(`Policy ${policyId} not found`);\\n    }\\n    policy.enabled = true;\\n    this.emit('policy_enabled', policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async disablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const policy = this.policies.get(policyId);\\n    if (!policy) {\\n      throw new Error(`Policy ${policyId} not found`);\\n    }\\n    policy.enabled = false;\\n    this.emit('policy_disabled', policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addCustomPolicy(policy: SelfHealingPolicy): Promise<void> {\\n    this.policies.set(policy.id, policy);\\n    this.emit('policy_added', policy);\\n  }\\n\\n  async removePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    this.policies.delete(policyId);\\n    this.emit('policy_removed', policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\n    totalChecks: number;\\n    healthyChecks: number;\\n    degradedChecks: number;\\n    unhealthyChecks: number;\\n    totalPolicies: number;\\n    enabledPolicies: number;\\n  } {\\n    const healthChecks = Array.from(this.healthChecks.values());\\n    const policies = Array.from(this.policies.values());\\n\\n    return {\\n      totalChecks: healthChecks.length,\\n      healthyChecks: healthChecks.filter(hc => hc.status === 'healthy').length,\\n      degradedChecks: healthChecks.filter(hc => hc.status === 'degraded').length,\\n      unhealthyChecks: healthChecks.filter(hc => hc.status === 'unhealthy').length,\\n      totalPolicies: policies.length,\\n      enabledPolicies: policies.filter(p => p.enabled).length\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":15691,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647586222}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/operations/predictive-maintenance/PredictiveMaintenanceSystem.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":401,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":401,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface MetricData {\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  value: number;\\\\n  metadata?: Record<string, any>;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface PredictionResult {\\\\n  metricName: string;\\\\n  currentValue: number;\\\\n  predictedValue: number;\\\\n  confidence: number;\\\\n  timeHorizon: number;\\\\n  anomalyProbability: number;\\\\n  recommendation: string;\\\\n  urgency: \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' | \\\\'critical\\\\';\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface MaintenanceTask {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  type: \\\\'preventive\\\\' | \\\\'predictive\\\\' | \\\\'corrective\\\\';\\\\n  description: string;\\\\n  status: \\\\'scheduled\\\\' | \\\\'in_progress\\\\' | \\\\'completed\\\\' | \\\\'cancelled\\\\';\\\\n  scheduledTime: number;\\\\n  estimatedDuration: number;\\\\n  priority: \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' | \\\\'critical\\\\';\\\\n  affectedSystems: string[];\\\\n  steps: string[];\\\\n  result?: any;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface PredictionModel {\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  type: \\\\'linear_regression\\\\' | \\\\'time_series\\\\' | \\\\'anomaly_detection\\\\' | \\\\'custom\\\\';\\\\n  accuracy: number;\\\\n  lastTrained: number;\\\\n  trainingDataSize: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class PredictiveMaintenanceSystem extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private metricsHistory: Map<string, MetricData[]> = new Map();\\\\n  private predictions: Map<string, PredictionResult[]> = new Map();\\\\n  private maintenanceTasks: Map<string, MaintenanceTask> = new Map();\\\\n  private models: Map<string, PredictionModel> = new Map();\\\\n  private readonly HISTORY_WINDOW_SIZE = 1000;\\\\n  private readonly PREDICTION_HORIZON = 3600000; // 1 hour\\\\n  private readonly ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 0.7;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor() {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.initializeModels();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeModels(): void {\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'linear_regression\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'linear_regression\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'linear_regression\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.85,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      trainingDataSize: 0\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'time_series\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'time_series\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'time_series\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.88,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      trainingDataSize: 0\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'anomaly_detection\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'anomaly_detection\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'anomaly_detection\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.82,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      trainingDataSize: 0\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async recordMetric(metricName: string, value: number, metadata?: Record<string, any>): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const metricData: MetricData = {\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\\\\n      value,\\\\n      metadata\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName) || [];\\\\n    history.push(metricData);\\\\n\\\\n    if (history.length > this.HISTORY_WINDOW_SIZE) {\\\\n      history.shift();\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.metricsHistory.set(metricName, history);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'metric_recorded\\\\', { metricName, value, timestamp: metricData.timestamp });\\\\n\\\\n    await this.checkForPredictiveAlerts(metricName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async checkForPredictiveAlerts(metricName: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName);\\\\n    if (!history || history.length < 10) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const prediction = await this.predictMetric(metricName, this.PREDICTION_HORIZON);\\\\n    \\\\n    if (prediction.urgency === \\\\'high\\\\' || prediction.urgency === \\\\'critical\\\\') {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'predictive_alert\\\\', prediction);\\\\n      await this.scheduleMaintenanceTask(prediction);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async predictMetric(metricName: string, timeHorizon: number): Promise<PredictionResult> {\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName);\\\\n    if (!history || history.length < 10) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Insufficient data for prediction of ${metricName}`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const currentValue = history[history.length - 1].value;\\\\n    const predictions = await Promise.all([\\\\n      this.predictWithLinearRegression(metricName, timeHorizon),\\\\n      this.predictWithTimeSeries(metricName, timeHorizon),\\\\n      this.detectAnomaly(metricName)\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    const aggregatedPrediction = this.aggregatePredictions(predictions, currentValue, timeHorizon);\\\\n    \\\\n    this.addPrediction(metricName, aggregatedPrediction);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'prediction_made\\\\', aggregatedPrediction);\\\\n\\\\n    return aggregatedPrediction;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async predictWithLinearRegression(\\\\n    metricName: string,\\\\n    timeHorizon: number\\\\n  ): Promise<{ predictedValue: number; confidence: number }> {\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName)!;\\\\n    const n = history.length;\\\\n    \\\\n    let sumX = 0;\\\\n    let sumY = 0;\\\\n    let sumXY = 0;\\\\n    let sumX2 = 0;\\\\n\\\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\\\n      const x = i;\\\\n      const y = history[i].value;\\\\n      sumX += x;\\\\n      sumY += y;\\\\n      sumXY += x * y;\\\\n      sumX2 += x * x;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const slope = (n * sumXY - sumX * sumY) / (n * sumX2 - sumX * sumX);\\\\n    const intercept = (sumY - slope * sumX) / n;\\\\n\\\\n    const predictedX = n + (timeHorizon / 1000);\\\\n    const predictedValue = slope * predictedX + intercept;\\\\n\\\\n    const confidence = this.calculateConfidence(history, predictedValue);\\\\n\\\\n    return { predictedValue, confidence };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async predictWithTimeSeries(\\\\n    metricName: string,\\\\n    timeHorizon: number\\\\n  ): Promise<{ predictedValue: number; confidence: number }> {\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName)!;\\\\n    const recentValues = history.slice(-20).map(d => d.value);\\\\n    \\\\n    const avgChange = this.calculateAverageChange(recentValues);\\\\n    const currentValue = recentValues[recentValues.length - 1];\\\\n    const predictedValue = currentValue + avgChange * (timeHorizon / 1000);\\\\n\\\\n    const confidence = this.calculateConfidence(history, predictedValue);\\\\n\\\\n    return { predictedValue, confidence };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async detectAnomaly(metricName: string): Promise<{ anomalyProbability: number }> {\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName)!;\\\\n    const values = history.map(d => d.value);\\\\n    \\\\n    const mean = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\\\n    const variance = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + Math.pow(v - mean, 2), 0) / values.length;\\\\n    const std = Math.sqrt(variance);\\\\n\\\\n    const currentValue = values[values.length - 1];\\\\n    const zScore = Math.abs((currentValue - mean) / (std || 1));\\\\n    \\\\n    const anomalyProbability = Math.min(1, zScore / 3);\\\\n\\\\n    return { anomalyProbability };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private aggregatePredictions(\\\\n    predictions: any[],\\\\n    currentValue: number,\\\\n    timeHorizon: number\\\\n  ): PredictionResult {\\\\n    const lrPrediction = predictions[0];\\\\n    const tsPrediction = predictions[1];\\\\n    const anomalyResult = predictions[2];\\\\n\\\\n    const avgPredictedValue = (lrPrediction.predictedValue + tsPrediction.predictedValue) / 2;\\\\n    const avgConfidence = (lrPrediction.confidence + tsPrediction.confidence) / 2;\\\\n\\\\n    const result: PredictionResult = {\\\\n      metricName: \\\\'unknown\\\\',\\\\n      currentValue,\\\\n      predictedValue: avgPredictedValue,\\\\n      confidence: avgConfidence,\\\\n      timeHorizon,\\\\n      anomalyProbability: anomalyResult.anomalyProbability,\\\\n      recommendation: this.generateRecommendation(currentValue, avgPredictedValue, anomalyResult.anomalyProbability),\\\\n      urgency: this.calculateUrgency(avgPredictedValue, currentValue, anomalyResult.anomalyProbability)\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    return result;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateConfidence(history: MetricData[], predictedValue: number): number {\\\\n    const values = history.map(d => d.value);\\\\n    const mean = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\\\n    const variance = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + Math.pow(v - mean, 2), 0) / values.length;\\\\n    const std = Math.sqrt(variance);\\\\n\\\\n    const error = Math.abs(predictedValue - mean);\\\\n    const confidence = Math.max(0, 1 - (error / (std * 2 || 1)));\\\\n\\\\n    return confidence;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateAverageChange(values: number[]): number {\\\\n    let totalChange = 0;\\\\n    for (let i = 1; i < values.length; i++) {\\\\n      totalChange += values[i] - values[i - 1];\\\\n    }\\\\n    return totalChange / (values.length - 1);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private generateRecommendation(\\\\n    currentValue: number,\\\\n    predictedValue: number,\\\\n    anomalyProbability: number\\\\n  ): string {\\\\n    const changePercent = Math.abs((predictedValue - currentValue) / (currentValue || 1)) * 100;\\\\n\\\\n    if (anomalyProbability > this.ANOMALY_THRESHOLD) {\\\\n      return \\\\'检测到异常模式，建议立即检查系统状态并采取预防措施\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (changePercent > 20) {\\\\n      return \\\\'预测值将显著变化，建议提前准备应对措施\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (changePercent > 10) {\\\\n      return \\\\'预测值将有所变化，建议关注系统状态\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return \\\\'系统状态正常，继续监控\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateUrgency(\\\\n    predictedValue: number,\\\\n    currentValue: number,\\\\n    anomalyProbability: number\\\\n  ): \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' | \\\\'critical\\\\' {\\\\n    const changePercent = Math.abs((predictedValue - currentValue) / (currentValue || 1)) * 100;\\\\n\\\\n    if (anomalyProbability > 0.8 || changePercent > 50) {\\\\n      return \\\\'critical\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (anomalyProbability > this.ANOMALY_THRESHOLD || changePercent > 30) {\\\\n      return \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (changePercent > 20) {\\\\n      return \\\\'medium\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return \\\\'low\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private addPrediction(metricName: string, prediction: PredictionResult): void {\\\\n    prediction.metricName = metricName;\\\\n    const predictions = this.predictions.get(metricName) || [];\\\\n    predictions.push(prediction);\\\\n\\\\n    if (predictions.length > 100) {\\\\n      predictions.shift();\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.predictions.set(metricName, predictions);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async scheduleMaintenanceTask(prediction: PredictionResult): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const taskId = `maintenance-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\\\\n    \\\\n    const task: MaintenanceTask = {\\\\n      id: taskId,\\\\n      type: \\\\'predictive\\\\',\\\\n      description: `基于预测的预防性维护：${prediction.metricName}`,\\\\n      status: \\\\'scheduled\\\\',\\\\n      scheduledTime: Date.now() + (prediction.urgency === \\\\'critical\\\\' ? 300000 : 3600000),\\\\n      estimatedDuration: prediction.urgency === \\\\'critical\\\\' ? 30 : 60,\\\\n      priority: prediction.urgency,\\\\n      affectedSystems: [prediction.metricName],\\\\n      steps: this.generateMaintenanceSteps(prediction)\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.maintenanceTasks.set(taskId, task);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'maintenance_task_scheduled\\\\', task);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private generateMaintenanceSteps(prediction: PredictionResult): string[] {\\\\n    const steps: string[] = [\\\\n      \\\\'检查系统日志和指标\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'分析预测结果和异常模式\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'评估当前系统状态\\\\'\\\\n    ];\\\\n\\\\n    if (prediction.urgency === \\\\'critical\\\\') {\\\\n      steps.push(\\\\'立即执行紧急维护措施\\\\');\\\\n      steps.push(\\\\'通知运维团队\\\\');\\\\n    } else if (prediction.urgency === \\\\'high\\\\') {\\\\n      steps.push(\\\\'准备维护计划\\\\');\\\\n      steps.push(\\\\'协调资源分配\\\\');\\\\n    } else {\\\\n      steps.push(\\\\'制定预防性维护计划\\\\');\\\\n      steps.push(\\\\'安排维护时间窗口\\\\');\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    steps.push(\\\\'执行维护操作\\\\');\\\\n    steps.push(\\\\'验证维护结果\\\\');\\\\n    steps.push(\\\\'更新系统文档\\\\');\\\\n\\\\n    return steps;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async scheduleCustomMaintenanceTask(task: Omit<MaintenanceTask, \\\\'id\\\\'>): Promise<MaintenanceTask> {\\\\n    const taskId = `maintenance-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\\\\n    \\\\n    const newTask: MaintenanceTask = {\\\\n      ...task,\\\\n      id: taskId\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.maintenanceTasks.set(taskId, newTask);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'maintenance_task_scheduled\\\\', newTask);\\\\n\\\\n    return newTask;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async executeMaintenanceTask(taskId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const task = this.maintenanceTasks.get(taskId);\\\\n    if (!task) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Maintenance task ${taskId} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    task.status = \\\\'in_progress\\\\';\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'maintenance_task_started\\\\', task);\\\\n\\\\n    try {\\\\n      const result = await this.performMaintenance(task);\\\\n      task.status = \\\\'completed\\\\';\\\\n      task.result = result;\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'maintenance_task_completed\\\\', task);\\\\n    } catch (error) {\\\\n      task.status = \\\\'cancelled\\\\';\\\\n      task.result = { error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error) };\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'maintenance_task_failed\\\\', { task, error });\\\\n      throw error;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async performMaintenance(task: MaintenanceTask): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      task: task.id,\\\\n      status: \\\\'completed\\\\',\\\\n      stepsExecuted: task.steps.length,\\\\n      duration: task.estimatedDuration,\\\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getPredictions(metricName?: string): PredictionResult[] {\\\\n    if (metricName) {\\\\n      return this.predictions.get(metricName) || [];\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    const allPredictions: PredictionResult[] = [];\\\\n    for (const predictions of this.predictions.values()) {\\\\n      allPredictions.push(...predictions);\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return allPredictions.sort((a, b) => b.timestamp - a.timestamp);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getMaintenanceTasks(filter?: {\\\\n    status?: MaintenanceTask[\\\\'status\\\\'];\\\\n    type?: MaintenanceTask[\\\\'type\\\\'];\\\\n    priority?: MaintenanceTask[\\\\'priority\\\\'];\\\\n  }): MaintenanceTask[] {\\\\n    let tasks = Array.from(this.maintenanceTasks.values());\\\\n    \\\\n    if (filter) {\\\\n      if (filter.status) {\\\\n        tasks = tasks.filter(t => t.status === filter.status);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      if (filter.type) {\\\\n        tasks = tasks.filter(t => t.type === filter.type);\\\\n      }\\\\n      \\\\n      if (filter.priority) {\\\\n        tasks = tasks.filter(t => t.priority === filter.priority);\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    \\\\n    return tasks.sort((a, b) => a.scheduledTime - b.scheduledTime);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getMetricHistory(metricName: string): MetricData[] {\\\\n    return this.metricsHistory.get(metricName) || [];\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getModels(): PredictionModel[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.models.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async trainModel(modelName: string, metricName: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const model = this.models.get(modelName);\\\\n    if (!model) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Model ${modelName} not found`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName);\\\\n    if (!history || history.length < 50) {\\\\n      throw new Error(`Insufficient training data for ${metricName}`);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    model.lastTrained = Date.now();\\\\n    model.trainingDataSize = history.length;\\\\n    model.accuracy = Math.min(0.95, model.accuracy + 0.01);\\\\n\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'model_trained\\\\', { modelName, accuracy: model.accuracy });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\\\n    totalMetrics: number;\\\\n    totalPredictions: number;\\\\n    totalMaintenanceTasks: number;\\\\n    scheduledTasks: number;\\\\n    inProgressTasks: number;\\\\n    completedTasks: number;\\\\n    modelCount: number;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    const tasks = Array.from(this.maintenanceTasks.values());\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      totalMetrics: this.metricsHistory.size,\\\\n      totalPredictions: Array.from(this.predictions.values())\\\\n        .reduce((sum, p) => sum + p.length, 0),\\\\n      totalMaintenanceTasks: tasks.length,\\\\n      scheduledTasks: tasks.filter(t => t.status === \\\\'scheduled\\\\').length,\\\\n      inProgressTasks: tasks.filter(t => t.status === \\\\'in_progress\\\\').length,\\\\n      completedTasks: tasks.filter(t => t.status === \\\\'completed\\\\').length,\\\\n      modelCount: this.models.size\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\n\\nexport interface MetricData {\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  value: number;\\n  metadata?: Record<string, any>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PredictionResult {\\n  metricName: string;\\n  currentValue: number;\\n  predictedValue: number;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  timeHorizon: number;\\n  anomalyProbability: number;\\n  recommendation: string;\\n  urgency: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'critical';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MaintenanceTask {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: 'preventive' | 'predictive' | 'corrective';\\n  description: string;\\n  status: 'scheduled' | 'in_progress' | 'completed' | 'cancelled';\\n  scheduledTime: number;\\n  estimatedDuration: number;\\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'critical';\\n  affectedSystems: string[];\\n  steps: string[];\\n  result?: any;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PredictionModel {\\n  name: string;\\n  type: 'linear_regression' | 'time_series' | 'anomaly_detection' | 'custom';\\n  accuracy: number;\\n  lastTrained: number;\\n  trainingDataSize: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class PredictiveMaintenanceSystem extends EventEmitter {\\n  private metricsHistory: Map<string, MetricData[]> = new Map();\\n  private predictions: Map<string, PredictionResult[]> = new Map();\\n  private maintenanceTasks: Map<string, MaintenanceTask> = new Map();\\n  private models: Map<string, PredictionModel> = new Map();\\n  private readonly HISTORY_WINDOW_SIZE = 1000;\\n  private readonly PREDICTION_HORIZON = 3600000; // 1 hour\\n  private readonly ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 0.7;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    super();\\n    this.initializeModels();\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeModels(): void {\\n    this.models.set('linear_regression', {\\n      name: 'linear_regression',\\n      type: 'linear_regression',\\n      accuracy: 0.85,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      trainingDataSize: 0\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('time_series', {\\n      name: 'time_series',\\n      type: 'time_series',\\n      accuracy: 0.88,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      trainingDataSize: 0\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('anomaly_detection', {\\n      name: 'anomaly_detection',\\n      type: 'anomaly_detection',\\n      accuracy: 0.82,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      trainingDataSize: 0\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async recordMetric(metricName: string, value: number, metadata?: Record<string, any>): Promise<void> {\\n    const metricData: MetricData = {\\n      timestamp: Date.now(),\\n      value,\\n      metadata\\n    };\\n\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName) || [];\\n    history.push(metricData);\\n\\n    if (history.length > this.HISTORY_WINDOW_SIZE) {\\n      history.shift();\\n    }\\n\\n    this.metricsHistory.set(metricName, history);\\n    this.emit('metric_recorded', { metricName, value, timestamp: metricData.timestamp });\\n\\n    await this.checkForPredictiveAlerts(metricName);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async checkForPredictiveAlerts(metricName: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName);\\n    if (!history || history.length < 10) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const prediction = await this.predictMetric(metricName, this.PREDICTION_HORIZON);\\n    \\n    if (prediction.urgency === 'high' || prediction.urgency === 'critical') {\\n      this.emit('predictive_alert', prediction);\\n      await this.scheduleMaintenanceTask(prediction);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async predictMetric(metricName: string, timeHorizon: number): Promise<PredictionResult> {\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName);\\n    if (!history || history.length < 10) {\\n      throw new Error(`Insufficient data for prediction of ${metricName}`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const currentValue = history[history.length - 1].value;\\n    const predictions = await Promise.all([\\n      this.predictWithLinearRegression(metricName, timeHorizon),\\n      this.predictWithTimeSeries(metricName, timeHorizon),\\n      this.detectAnomaly(metricName)\\n    ]);\\n\\n    const aggregatedPrediction = this.aggregatePredictions(predictions, currentValue, timeHorizon);\\n    \\n    this.addPrediction(metricName, aggregatedPrediction);\\n    this.emit('prediction_made', aggregatedPrediction);\\n\\n    return aggregatedPrediction;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async predictWithLinearRegression(\\n    metricName: string,\\n    timeHorizon: number\\n  ): Promise<{ predictedValue: number; confidence: number }> {\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName)!;\\n    const n = history.length;\\n    \\n    let sumX = 0;\\n    let sumY = 0;\\n    let sumXY = 0;\\n    let sumX2 = 0;\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n      const x = i;\\n      const y = history[i].value;\\n      sumX += x;\\n      sumY += y;\\n      sumXY += x * y;\\n      sumX2 += x * x;\\n    }\\n\\n    const slope = (n * sumXY - sumX * sumY) / (n * sumX2 - sumX * sumX);\\n    const intercept = (sumY - slope * sumX) / n;\\n\\n    const predictedX = n + (timeHorizon / 1000);\\n    const predictedValue = slope * predictedX + intercept;\\n\\n    const confidence = this.calculateConfidence(history, predictedValue);\\n\\n    return { predictedValue, confidence };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async predictWithTimeSeries(\\n    metricName: string,\\n    timeHorizon: number\\n  ): Promise<{ predictedValue: number; confidence: number }> {\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName)!;\\n    const recentValues = history.slice(-20).map(d => d.value);\\n    \\n    const avgChange = this.calculateAverageChange(recentValues);\\n    const currentValue = recentValues[recentValues.length - 1];\\n    const predictedValue = currentValue + avgChange * (timeHorizon / 1000);\\n\\n    const confidence = this.calculateConfidence(history, predictedValue);\\n\\n    return { predictedValue, confidence };\\n  }\\n\\n  private async detectAnomaly(metricName: string): Promise<{ anomalyProbability: number }> {\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName)!;\\n    const values = history.map(d => d.value);\\n    \\n    const mean = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\n    const variance = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + Math.pow(v - mean, 2), 0) / values.length;\\n    const std = Math.sqrt(variance);\\n\\n    const currentValue = values[values.length - 1];\\n    const zScore = Math.abs((currentValue - mean) / (std || 1));\\n    \\n    const anomalyProbability = Math.min(1, zScore / 3);\\n\\n    return { anomalyProbability };\\n  }\\n\\n  private aggregatePredictions(\\n    predictions: any[],\\n    currentValue: number,\\n    timeHorizon: number\\n  ): PredictionResult {\\n    const lrPrediction = predictions[0];\\n    const tsPrediction = predictions[1];\\n    const anomalyResult = predictions[2];\\n\\n    const avgPredictedValue = (lrPrediction.predictedValue + tsPrediction.predictedValue) / 2;\\n    const avgConfidence = (lrPrediction.confidence + tsPrediction.confidence) / 2;\\n\\n    const result: PredictionResult = {\\n      metricName: 'unknown',\\n      currentValue,\\n      predictedValue: avgPredictedValue,\\n      confidence: avgConfidence,\\n      timeHorizon,\\n      anomalyProbability: anomalyResult.anomalyProbability,\\n      recommendation: this.generateRecommendation(currentValue, avgPredictedValue, anomalyResult.anomalyProbability),\\n      urgency: this.calculateUrgency(avgPredictedValue, currentValue, anomalyResult.anomalyProbability)\\n    };\\n\\n    return result;\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateConfidence(history: MetricData[], predictedValue: number): number {\\n    const values = history.map(d => d.value);\\n    const mean = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + v, 0) / values.length;\\n    const variance = values.reduce((sum, v) => sum + Math.pow(v - mean, 2), 0) / values.length;\\n    const std = Math.sqrt(variance);\\n\\n    const error = Math.abs(predictedValue - mean);\\n    const confidence = Math.max(0, 1 - (error / (std * 2 || 1)));\\n\\n    return confidence;\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateAverageChange(values: number[]): number {\\n    let totalChange = 0;\\n    for (let i = 1; i < values.length; i++) {\\n      totalChange += values[i] - values[i - 1];\\n    }\\n    return totalChange / (values.length - 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  private generateRecommendation(\\n    currentValue: number,\\n    predictedValue: number,\\n    anomalyProbability: number\\n  ): string {\\n    const changePercent = Math.abs((predictedValue - currentValue) / (currentValue || 1)) * 100;\\n\\n    if (anomalyProbability > this.ANOMALY_THRESHOLD) {\\n      return '检测到异常模式，建议立即检查系统状态并采取预防措施';\\n    }\\n\\n    if (changePercent > 20) {\\n      return '预测值将显著变化，建议提前准备应对措施';\\n    }\\n\\n    if (changePercent > 10) {\\n      return '预测值将有所变化，建议关注系统状态';\\n    }\\n\\n    return '系统状态正常，继续监控';\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateUrgency(\\n    predictedValue: number,\\n    currentValue: number,\\n    anomalyProbability: number\\n  ): 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' | 'critical' {\\n    const changePercent = Math.abs((predictedValue - currentValue) / (currentValue || 1)) * 100;\\n\\n    if (anomalyProbability > 0.8 || changePercent > 50) {\\n      return 'critical';\\n    }\\n\\n    if (anomalyProbability > this.ANOMALY_THRESHOLD || changePercent > 30) {\\n      return 'high';\\n    }\\n\\n    if (changePercent > 20) {\\n      return 'medium';\\n    }\\n\\n    return 'low';\\n  }\\n\\n  private addPrediction(metricName: string, prediction: PredictionResult): void {\\n    prediction.metricName = metricName;\\n    const predictions = this.predictions.get(metricName) || [];\\n    predictions.push(prediction);\\n\\n    if (predictions.length > 100) {\\n      predictions.shift();\\n    }\\n\\n    this.predictions.set(metricName, predictions);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async scheduleMaintenanceTask(prediction: PredictionResult): Promise<void> {\\n    const taskId = `maintenance-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\\n    \\n    const task: MaintenanceTask = {\\n      id: taskId,\\n      type: 'predictive',\\n      description: `基于预测的预防性维护：${prediction.metricName}`,\\n      status: 'scheduled',\\n      scheduledTime: Date.now() + (prediction.urgency === 'critical' ? 300000 : 3600000),\\n      estimatedDuration: prediction.urgency === 'critical' ? 30 : 60,\\n      priority: prediction.urgency,\\n      affectedSystems: [prediction.metricName],\\n      steps: this.generateMaintenanceSteps(prediction)\\n    };\\n\\n    this.maintenanceTasks.set(taskId, task);\\n    this.emit('maintenance_task_scheduled', task);\\n  }\\n\\n  private generateMaintenanceSteps(prediction: PredictionResult): string[] {\\n    const steps: string[] = [\\n      '检查系统日志和指标',\\n      '分析预测结果和异常模式',\\n      '评估当前系统状态'\\n    ];\\n\\n    if (prediction.urgency === 'critical') {\\n      steps.push('立即执行紧急维护措施');\\n      steps.push('通知运维团队');\\n    } else if (prediction.urgency === 'high') {\\n      steps.push('准备维护计划');\\n      steps.push('协调资源分配');\\n    } else {\\n      steps.push('制定预防性维护计划');\\n      steps.push('安排维护时间窗口');\\n    }\\n\\n    steps.push('执行维护操作');\\n    steps.push('验证维护结果');\\n    steps.push('更新系统文档');\\n\\n    return steps;\\n  }\\n\\n  async scheduleCustomMaintenanceTask(task: Omit<MaintenanceTask, 'id'>): Promise<MaintenanceTask> {\\n    const taskId = `maintenance-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\\n    \\n    const newTask: MaintenanceTask = {\\n      ...task,\\n      id: taskId\\n    };\\n\\n    this.maintenanceTasks.set(taskId, newTask);\\n    this.emit('maintenance_task_scheduled', newTask);\\n\\n    return newTask;\\n  }\\n\\n  async executeMaintenanceTask(taskId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const task = this.maintenanceTasks.get(taskId);\\n    if (!task) {\\n      throw new Error(`Maintenance task ${taskId} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    task.status = 'in_progress';\\n    this.emit('maintenance_task_started', task);\\n\\n    try {\\n      const result = await this.performMaintenance(task);\\n      task.status = 'completed';\\n      task.result = result;\\n      this.emit('maintenance_task_completed', task);\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      task.status = 'cancelled';\\n      task.result = { error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error) };\\n      this.emit('maintenance_task_failed', { task, error });\\n      throw error;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async performMaintenance(task: MaintenanceTask): Promise<any> {\\n    return {\\n      task: task.id,\\n      status: 'completed',\\n      stepsExecuted: task.steps.length,\\n      duration: task.estimatedDuration,\\n      timestamp: Date.now()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  getPredictions(metricName?: string): PredictionResult[] {\\n    if (metricName) {\\n      return this.predictions.get(metricName) || [];\\n    }\\n    \\n    const allPredictions: PredictionResult[] = [];\\n    for (const predictions of this.predictions.values()) {\\n      allPredictions.push(...predictions);\\n    }\\n    \\n    return allPredictions.sort((a, b) => b.timestamp - a.timestamp);\\n  }\\n\\n  getMaintenanceTasks(filter?: {\\n    status?: MaintenanceTask['status'];\\n    type?: MaintenanceTask['type'];\\n    priority?: MaintenanceTask['priority'];\\n  }): MaintenanceTask[] {\\n    let tasks = Array.from(this.maintenanceTasks.values());\\n    \\n    if (filter) {\\n      if (filter.status) {\\n        tasks = tasks.filter(t => t.status === filter.status);\\n      }\\n      \\n      if (filter.type) {\\n        tasks = tasks.filter(t => t.type === filter.type);\\n      }\\n      \\n      if (filter.priority) {\\n        tasks = tasks.filter(t => t.priority === filter.priority);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    \\n    return tasks.sort((a, b) => a.scheduledTime - b.scheduledTime);\\n  }\\n\\n  getMetricHistory(metricName: string): MetricData[] {\\n    return this.metricsHistory.get(metricName) || [];\\n  }\\n\\n  getModels(): PredictionModel[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.models.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  async trainModel(modelName: string, metricName: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const model = this.models.get(modelName);\\n    if (!model) {\\n      throw new Error(`Model ${modelName} not found`);\\n    }\\n\\n    const history = this.metricsHistory.get(metricName);\\n    if (!history || history.length < 50) {\\n      throw new Error(`Insufficient training data for ${metricName}`);\\n    }\\n\\n    model.lastTrained = Date.now();\\n    model.trainingDataSize = history.length;\\n    model.accuracy = Math.min(0.95, model.accuracy + 0.01);\\n\\n    this.emit('model_trained', { modelName, accuracy: model.accuracy });\\n  }\\n\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\n    totalMetrics: number;\\n    totalPredictions: number;\\n    totalMaintenanceTasks: number;\\n    scheduledTasks: number;\\n    inProgressTasks: number;\\n    completedTasks: number;\\n    modelCount: number;\\n  } {\\n    const tasks = Array.from(this.maintenanceTasks.values());\\n\\n    return {\\n      totalMetrics: this.metricsHistory.size,\\n      totalPredictions: Array.from(this.predictions.values())\\n        .reduce((sum, p) => sum + p.length, 0),\\n      totalMaintenanceTasks: tasks.length,\\n      scheduledTasks: tasks.filter(t => t.status === 'scheduled').length,\\n      inProgressTasks: tasks.filter(t => t.status === 'in_progress').length,\\n      completedTasks: tasks.filter(t => t.status === 'completed').length,\\n      modelCount: this.models.size\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":14423,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647647872}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/operations/AutomationOpsSystem.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":159,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":159,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\nimport { SelfHealingEngine } from \\\\'./self-healing/SelfHealingEngine\\\\';\\\\nimport { PredictiveMaintenanceSystem } from \\\\'./predictive-maintenance/PredictiveMaintenanceSystem\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface AutomationOpsConfig {\\\\n  enableSelfHealing?: boolean;\\\\n  enablePredictiveMaintenance?: boolean;\\\\n  healthCheckInterval?: number;\\\\n  predictionHorizon?: number;\\\\n  maintenanceWindow?: {\\\\n    start: number;\\\\n    end: number;\\\\n  };\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class AutomationOpsSystem extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private selfHealingEngine: SelfHealingEngine;\\\\n  private predictiveMaintenanceSystem: PredictiveMaintenanceSystem;\\\\n  private config: AutomationOpsConfig;\\\\n  private isRunning: boolean = false;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(config: AutomationOpsConfig = {}) {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.config = {\\\\n      enableSelfHealing: true,\\\\n      enablePredictiveMaintenance: true,\\\\n      healthCheckInterval: 30000,\\\\n      predictionHorizon: 3600000,\\\\n      maintenanceWindow: {\\\\n        start: 0,\\\\n        end: 24\\\\n      },\\\\n      ...config\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.selfHealingEngine = new SelfHealingEngine();\\\\n    this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem = new PredictiveMaintenanceSystem();\\\\n\\\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\\\n    this.selfHealingEngine.on(\\\\'health_check_failed\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'health_check_failed\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.selfHealingEngine.on(\\\\'self_healing_started\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'self_healing_started\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.selfHealingEngine.on(\\\\'self_healing_completed\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'self_healing_completed\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.on(\\\\'predictive_alert\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'predictive_alert\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.on(\\\\'maintenance_task_scheduled\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'maintenance_task_scheduled\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async start(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (this.isRunning) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.isRunning = true;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'system_started\\\\', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async stop(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (!this.isRunning) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.isRunning = false;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'system_stopped\\\\', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async registerHealthCheck(\\\\n    id: string,\\\\n    name: string,\\\\n    type: any,\\\\n    checkFunction: () => Promise<any>,\\\\n    options?: any\\\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (this.config.enableSelfHealing) {\\\\n      await this.selfHealingEngine.registerHealthCheck(id, name, type, checkFunction, options);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async unregisterHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.unregisterHealthCheck(checkId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async recordMetric(metricName: string, value: number, metadata?: Record<string, any>): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (this.config.enablePredictiveMaintenance) {\\\\n      await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.recordMetric(metricName, value, metadata);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async predictMetric(metricName: string, timeHorizon?: number): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.predictMetric(\\\\n      metricName,\\\\n      timeHorizon || this.config.predictionHorizon!\\\\n    );\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async scheduleMaintenanceTask(task: any): Promise<any> {\\\\n    return await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.scheduleCustomMaintenanceTask(task);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async executeMaintenanceTask(taskId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.executeMaintenanceTask(taskId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getHealthChecks(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getAllHealthChecks();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getHealthCheck(checkId: string): any {\\\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getHealthCheck(checkId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getHealthChecksByStatus(status: string): any[] {\\\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getHealthChecksByStatus(status as any);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getPredictions(metricName?: string): any[] {\\\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getPredictions(metricName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getMaintenanceTasks(filter?: any): any[] {\\\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getMaintenanceTasks(filter);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getMetricHistory(metricName: string): any[] {\\\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getMetricHistory(metricName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getPolicies(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getAllPolicies();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getPolicy(policyId: string): any {\\\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getPolicy(policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async enablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.enablePolicy(policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async disablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.disablePolicy(policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addCustomPolicy(policy: any): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.addCustomPolicy(policy);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async removePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.removePolicy(policyId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getModels(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getModels();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async trainModel(modelName: string, metricName: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.trainModel(modelName, metricName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\\\n    isRunning: boolean;\\\\n    config: AutomationOpsConfig;\\\\n    selfHealingStatus: any;\\\\n    predictiveMaintenanceStatus: any;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      isRunning: this.isRunning,\\\\n      config: this.config,\\\\n      selfHealingStatus: this.selfHealingEngine.getSystemStatus(),\\\\n      predictiveMaintenanceStatus: this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getSystemStatus()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSelfHealingEngine(): SelfHealingEngine {\\\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getPredictiveMaintenanceSystem(): PredictiveMaintenanceSystem {\\\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem;\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\nimport { SelfHealingEngine } from './self-healing/SelfHealingEngine';\\nimport { PredictiveMaintenanceSystem } from './predictive-maintenance/PredictiveMaintenanceSystem';\\n\\nexport interface AutomationOpsConfig {\\n  enableSelfHealing?: boolean;\\n  enablePredictiveMaintenance?: boolean;\\n  healthCheckInterval?: number;\\n  predictionHorizon?: number;\\n  maintenanceWindow?: {\\n    start: number;\\n    end: number;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport class AutomationOpsSystem extends EventEmitter {\\n  private selfHealingEngine: SelfHealingEngine;\\n  private predictiveMaintenanceSystem: PredictiveMaintenanceSystem;\\n  private config: AutomationOpsConfig;\\n  private isRunning: boolean = false;\\n\\n  constructor(config: AutomationOpsConfig = {}) {\\n    super();\\n    this.config = {\\n      enableSelfHealing: true,\\n      enablePredictiveMaintenance: true,\\n      healthCheckInterval: 30000,\\n      predictionHorizon: 3600000,\\n      maintenanceWindow: {\\n        start: 0,\\n        end: 24\\n      },\\n      ...config\\n    };\\n\\n    this.selfHealingEngine = new SelfHealingEngine();\\n    this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem = new PredictiveMaintenanceSystem();\\n\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\n  }\\n\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\n    this.selfHealingEngine.on('health_check_failed', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('health_check_failed', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.selfHealingEngine.on('self_healing_started', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('self_healing_started', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.selfHealingEngine.on('self_healing_completed', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('self_healing_completed', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.on('predictive_alert', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('predictive_alert', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.on('maintenance_task_scheduled', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('maintenance_task_scheduled', data);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async start(): Promise<void> {\\n    if (this.isRunning) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    this.isRunning = true;\\n    this.emit('system_started', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  async stop(): Promise<void> {\\n    if (!this.isRunning) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    this.isRunning = false;\\n    this.emit('system_stopped', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  async registerHealthCheck(\\n    id: string,\\n    name: string,\\n    type: any,\\n    checkFunction: () => Promise<any>,\\n    options?: any\\n  ): Promise<void> {\\n    if (this.config.enableSelfHealing) {\\n      await this.selfHealingEngine.registerHealthCheck(id, name, type, checkFunction, options);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async unregisterHealthCheck(checkId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.unregisterHealthCheck(checkId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async recordMetric(metricName: string, value: number, metadata?: Record<string, any>): Promise<void> {\\n    if (this.config.enablePredictiveMaintenance) {\\n      await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.recordMetric(metricName, value, metadata);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async predictMetric(metricName: string, timeHorizon?: number): Promise<any> {\\n    return await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.predictMetric(\\n      metricName,\\n      timeHorizon || this.config.predictionHorizon!\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  async scheduleMaintenanceTask(task: any): Promise<any> {\\n    return await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.scheduleCustomMaintenanceTask(task);\\n  }\\n\\n  async executeMaintenanceTask(taskId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.executeMaintenanceTask(taskId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getHealthChecks(): any[] {\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getAllHealthChecks();\\n  }\\n\\n  getHealthCheck(checkId: string): any {\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getHealthCheck(checkId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getHealthChecksByStatus(status: string): any[] {\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getHealthChecksByStatus(status as any);\\n  }\\n\\n  getPredictions(metricName?: string): any[] {\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getPredictions(metricName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getMaintenanceTasks(filter?: any): any[] {\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getMaintenanceTasks(filter);\\n  }\\n\\n  getMetricHistory(metricName: string): any[] {\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getMetricHistory(metricName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getPolicies(): any[] {\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getAllPolicies();\\n  }\\n\\n  getPolicy(policyId: string): any {\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine.getPolicy(policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async enablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.enablePolicy(policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async disablePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.disablePolicy(policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addCustomPolicy(policy: any): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.addCustomPolicy(policy);\\n  }\\n\\n  async removePolicy(policyId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.selfHealingEngine.removePolicy(policyId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getModels(): any[] {\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getModels();\\n  }\\n\\n  async trainModel(modelName: string, metricName: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.trainModel(modelName, metricName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\n    isRunning: boolean;\\n    config: AutomationOpsConfig;\\n    selfHealingStatus: any;\\n    predictiveMaintenanceStatus: any;\\n  } {\\n    return {\\n      isRunning: this.isRunning,\\n      config: this.config,\\n      selfHealingStatus: this.selfHealingEngine.getSystemStatus(),\\n      predictiveMaintenanceStatus: this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem.getSystemStatus()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  getSelfHealingEngine(): SelfHealingEngine {\\n    return this.selfHealingEngine;\\n  }\\n\\n  getPredictiveMaintenanceSystem(): PredictiveMaintenanceSystem {\\n    return this.predictiveMaintenanceSystem;\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":5611,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647671567}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/nlp/semantic-understanding/SemanticUnderstandingEngine.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":454,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":454,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface TextInput {\\\\n  text: string;\\\\n  language?: string;\\\\n  context?: Record<string, any>;\\\\n  userId?: string;\\\\n  sessionId?: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface SemanticAnalysis {\\\\n  text: string;\\\\n  language: string;\\\\n  sentiment: \\\\'positive\\\\' | \\\\'negative\\\\' | \\\\'neutral\\\\';\\\\n  confidence: number;\\\\n  intent: string;\\\\n  entities: Entity[];\\\\n  keywords: string[];\\\\n  topics: string[];\\\\n  emotion?: string;\\\\n  urgency?: \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface Entity {\\\\n  text: string;\\\\n  type: string;\\\\n  confidence: number;\\\\n  start: number;\\\\n  end: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface Intent {\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  confidence: number;\\\\n  slots: Record<string, any>;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface SemanticModel {\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  type: \\\\'sentiment\\\\' | \\\\'intent\\\\' | \\\\'entity\\\\' | \\\\'topic\\\\' | \\\\'custom\\\\';\\\\n  accuracy: number;\\\\n  lastTrained: number;\\\\n  language: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class SemanticUnderstandingEngine extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private models: Map<string, SemanticModel> = new Map();\\\\n  private intents: Map<string, Intent> = new Map();\\\\n  private entityTypes: Map<string, string[]> = new Map();\\\\n  private sentimentLexicon: Map<string, number> = new Map();\\\\n  private readonly CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD = 0.6;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor() {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.initializeModels();\\\\n    this.initializeIntents();\\\\n    this.initializeEntityTypes();\\\\n    this.initializeSentimentLexicon();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeModels(): void {\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'sentiment_zh\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'sentiment_zh\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'sentiment\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.85,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      language: \\\\'zh\\\\'\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'sentiment_en\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'sentiment_en\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'sentiment\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.87,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      language: \\\\'en\\\\'\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'intent_zh\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'intent_zh\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'intent\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.82,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      language: \\\\'zh\\\\'\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'entity_zh\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'entity_zh\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'entity\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.88,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      language: \\\\'zh\\\\'\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.models.set(\\\\'topic_zh\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'topic_zh\\\\',\\\\n      type: \\\\'topic\\\\',\\\\n      accuracy: 0.80,\\\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\\\n      language: \\\\'zh\\\\'\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeIntents(): void {\\\\n    this.intents.set(\\\\'greeting\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'greeting\\\\',\\\\n      confidence: 0.9,\\\\n      slots: {}\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.intents.set(\\\\'query\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'query\\\\',\\\\n      confidence: 0.85,\\\\n      slots: {\\\\n        query_type: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        subject: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        time_range: \\\\'\\\\'\\\\n      }\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.intents.set(\\\\'request\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'request\\\\',\\\\n      confidence: 0.88,\\\\n      slots: {\\\\n        action: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        target: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        parameters: {}\\\\n      }\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.intents.set(\\\\'complaint\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'complaint\\\\',\\\\n      confidence: 0.86,\\\\n      slots: {\\\\n        issue: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        severity: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        urgency: \\\\'\\\\'\\\\n      }\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.intents.set(\\\\'feedback\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'feedback\\\\',\\\\n      confidence: 0.84,\\\\n      slots: {\\\\n        rating: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        category: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        details: \\\\'\\\\'\\\\n      }\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.intents.set(\\\\'support\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'support\\\\',\\\\n      confidence: 0.87,\\\\n      slots: {\\\\n        problem: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        context: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        priority: \\\\'\\\\'\\\\n      }\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeEntityTypes(): void {\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'person\\\\', [\\\\'用户\\\\', \\\\'客户\\\\', \\\\'管理员\\\\', \\\\'开发者\\\\']);\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'organization\\\\', [\\\\'公司\\\\', \\\\'部门\\\\', \\\\'团队\\\\', \\\\'机构\\\\']);\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'location\\\\', [\\\\'北京\\\\', \\\\'上海\\\\', \\\\'广州\\\\', \\\\'深圳\\\\']);\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'time\\\\', [\\\\'今天\\\\', \\\\'明天\\\\', \\\\'昨天\\\\', \\\\'本周\\\\', \\\\'本月\\\\', \\\\'今年\\\\']);\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'number\\\\', [\\\\'一\\\\', \\\\'二\\\\', \\\\'三\\\\', \\\\'四\\\\', \\\\'五\\\\', \\\\'六\\\\', \\\\'七\\\\', \\\\'八\\\\', \\\\'九\\\\', \\\\'十\\\\']);\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'product\\\\', [\\\\'产品\\\\', \\\\'服务\\\\', \\\\'系统\\\\', \\\\'应用\\\\', \\\\'平台\\\\']);\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(\\\\'action\\\\', [\\\\'查询\\\\', \\\\'创建\\\\', \\\\'删除\\\\', \\\\'更新\\\\', \\\\'修改\\\\', \\\\'添加\\\\']);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeSentimentLexicon(): void {\\\\n    const positiveWords = [\\\\'好\\\\', \\\\'优秀\\\\', \\\\'满意\\\\', \\\\'喜欢\\\\', \\\\'棒\\\\', \\\\'赞\\\\', \\\\'感谢\\\\', \\\\'不错\\\\', \\\\'完美\\\\', \\\\'出色\\\\'];\\\\n    const negativeWords = [\\\\'差\\\\', \\\\'糟糕\\\\', \\\\'不满\\\\', \\\\'讨厌\\\\', \\\\'差劲\\\\', \\\\'失望\\\\', \\\\'糟糕\\\\', \\\\'错误\\\\', \\\\'失败\\\\', \\\\'问题\\\\'];\\\\n\\\\n    positiveWords.forEach(word => this.sentimentLexicon.set(word, 1));\\\\n    negativeWords.forEach(word => this.sentimentLexicon.set(word, -1));\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async analyze(input: TextInput): Promise<SemanticAnalysis> {\\\\n    const startTime = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n    try {\\\\n      const language = this.detectLanguage(input.text);\\\\n      \\\\n      const [sentiment, intent, entities, keywords, topics] = await Promise.all([\\\\n        this.analyzeSentiment(input.text, language),\\\\n        this.analyzeIntent(input.text, language),\\\\n        this.extractEntities(input.text, language),\\\\n        this.extractKeywords(input.text, language),\\\\n        this.extractTopics(input.text, language)\\\\n      ]);\\\\n\\\\n      const analysis: SemanticAnalysis = {\\\\n        text: input.text,\\\\n        language,\\\\n        sentiment: sentiment.sentiment,\\\\n        confidence: sentiment.confidence,\\\\n        intent: intent.name,\\\\n        entities,\\\\n        keywords,\\\\n        topics,\\\\n        emotion: this.detectEmotion(input.text, sentiment.sentiment),\\\\n        urgency: this.detectUrgency(input.text, intent.name, sentiment.sentiment)\\\\n      };\\\\n\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'analysis_completed\\\\', {\\\\n        input,\\\\n        analysis,\\\\n        processingTime: Date.now() - startTime\\\\n      });\\\\n\\\\n      return analysis;\\\\n    } catch (error) {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'analysis_error\\\\', { input, error });\\\\n      throw error;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private detectLanguage(text: string): string {\\\\n    const chinesePattern = /[\\\\\\\\u4e00-\\\\\\\\u9fa5]/;\\\\n    const englishPattern = /[a-zA-Z]/;\\\\n\\\\n    const chineseCount = (text.match(chinesePattern) || []).length;\\\\n    const englishCount = (text.match(englishPattern) || []).length;\\\\n\\\\n    if (chineseCount > englishCount) {\\\\n      return \\\\'zh\\\\';\\\\n    } else if (englishCount > chineseCount) {\\\\n      return \\\\'en\\\\';\\\\n    } else {\\\\n      return \\\\'zh\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async analyzeSentiment(text: string, language: string): Promise<{\\\\n    sentiment: \\\\'positive\\\\' | \\\\'negative\\\\' | \\\\'neutral\\\\';\\\\n    confidence: number;\\\\n  }> {\\\\n    let score = 0;\\\\n    let matchCount = 0;\\\\n\\\\n    for (const [word, value] of this.sentimentLexicon.entries()) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(word)) {\\\\n        score += value;\\\\n        matchCount++;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (matchCount === 0) {\\\\n      return { sentiment: \\\\'neutral\\\\', confidence: 0.5 };\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const avgScore = score / matchCount;\\\\n    const confidence = Math.min(1, 0.5 + Math.abs(avgScore) * 0.5);\\\\n\\\\n    if (avgScore > 0.2) {\\\\n      return { sentiment: \\\\'positive\\\\', confidence };\\\\n    } else if (avgScore < -0.2) {\\\\n      return { sentiment: \\\\'negative\\\\', confidence };\\\\n    } else {\\\\n      return { sentiment: \\\\'neutral\\\\', confidence };\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async analyzeIntent(text: string, language: string): Promise<Intent> {\\\\n    const intentScores: Map<string, number> = new Map();\\\\n\\\\n    for (const [intentName, intent] of this.intents.entries()) {\\\\n      const score = this.calculateIntentScore(text, intentName);\\\\n      intentScores.set(intentName, score);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const sortedIntents = Array.from(intentScores.entries())\\\\n      .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1]);\\\\n\\\\n    const [bestIntent, confidence] = sortedIntents[0];\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      name: bestIntent,\\\\n      confidence,\\\\n      slots: this.extractSlots(text, bestIntent)\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private calculateIntentScore(text: string, intentName: string): number {\\\\n    const intentPatterns: Record<string, string[]> = {\\\\n      greeting: [\\\\'你好\\\\', \\\\'您好\\\\', \\\\'早上好\\\\', \\\\'晚上好\\\\', \\\\'hello\\\\', \\\\'hi\\\\'],\\\\n      query: [\\\\'查询\\\\', \\\\'搜索\\\\', \\\\'找\\\\', \\\\'问\\\\', \\\\'query\\\\', \\\\'search\\\\', \\\\'find\\\\'],\\\\n      request: [\\\\'请\\\\', \\\\'帮我\\\\', \\\\'能否\\\\', \\\\'可以\\\\', \\\\'please\\\\', \\\\'help\\\\', \\\\'can\\\\'],\\\\n      complaint: [\\\\'投诉\\\\', \\\\'不满\\\\', \\\\'问题\\\\', \\\\'错误\\\\', \\\\'complaint\\\\', \\\\'issue\\\\', \\\\'error\\\\'],\\\\n      feedback: [\\\\'反馈\\\\', \\\\'评价\\\\', \\\\'建议\\\\', \\\\'意见\\\\', \\\\'feedback\\\\', \\\\'review\\\\', \\\\'suggestion\\\\'],\\\\n      support: [\\\\'帮助\\\\', \\\\'支持\\\\', \\\\'协助\\\\', \\\\'support\\\\', \\\\'help\\\\', \\\\'assist\\\\']\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    const patterns = intentPatterns[intentName] || [];\\\\n    let score = 0;\\\\n\\\\n    for (const pattern of patterns) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\\\n        score += 0.3;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return Math.min(1, score);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractSlots(text: string, intentName: string): Record<string, any> {\\\\n    const slots: Record<string, any> = {};\\\\n\\\\n    if (intentName === \\\\'query\\\\') {\\\\n      slots.query_type = this.extractQueryType(text);\\\\n      slots.subject = this.extractSubject(text);\\\\n      slots.time_range = this.extractTimeRange(text);\\\\n    } else if (intentName === \\\\'request\\\\') {\\\\n      slots.action = this.extractAction(text);\\\\n      slots.target = this.extractTarget(text);\\\\n      slots.parameters = this.extractParameters(text);\\\\n    } else if (intentName === \\\\'complaint\\\\') {\\\\n      slots.issue = this.extractIssue(text);\\\\n      slots.severity = this.extractSeverity(text);\\\\n      slots.urgency = this.extractUrgency(text);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return slots;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractQueryType(text: string): string {\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'用户\\\\')) return \\\\'user\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'订单\\\\')) return \\\\'order\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'产品\\\\')) return \\\\'product\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'系统\\\\')) return \\\\'system\\\\';\\\\n    return \\\\'general\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractSubject(text: string): string {\\\\n    const subjects = [\\\\'用户\\\\', \\\\'订单\\\\', \\\\'产品\\\\', \\\\'服务\\\\', \\\\'系统\\\\', \\\\'数据\\\\'];\\\\n    for (const subject of subjects) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(subject)) {\\\\n        return subject;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    return \\\\'\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractTimeRange(text: string): string {\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'今天\\\\')) return \\\\'today\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'本周\\\\')) return \\\\'week\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'本月\\\\')) return \\\\'month\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'今年\\\\')) return \\\\'year\\\\';\\\\n    return \\\\'all\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractAction(text: string): string {\\\\n    const actions = [\\\\'创建\\\\', \\\\'删除\\\\', \\\\'更新\\\\', \\\\'修改\\\\', \\\\'添加\\\\', \\\\'查询\\\\'];\\\\n    for (const action of actions) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(action)) {\\\\n        return action;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    return \\\\'\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractTarget(text: string): string {\\\\n    return this.extractSubject(text);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractParameters(text: string): Record<string, any> {\\\\n    const params: Record<string, any> = {};\\\\n    const numberMatch = text.match(/\\\\\\\\d+/);\\\\n    if (numberMatch) {\\\\n      params.number = parseInt(numberMatch[0]);\\\\n    }\\\\n    return params;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractIssue(text: string): string {\\\\n    const issues = [\\\\'性能\\\\', \\\\'安全\\\\', \\\\'功能\\\\', \\\\'界面\\\\', \\\\'数据\\\\'];\\\\n    for (const issue of issues) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(issue)) {\\\\n        return issue;\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n    return \\\\'\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractSeverity(text: string): string {\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'严重\\\\') || text.includes(\\\\'紧急\\\\')) return \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n    if (text.includes(\\\\'一般\\\\') || text.includes(\\\\'普通\\\\')) return \\\\'medium\\\\';\\\\n    return \\\\'low\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private extractUrgency(text: string): string {\\\\n    return this.extractSeverity(text);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async extractEntities(text: string, language: string): Promise<Entity[]> {\\\\n    const entities: Entity[] = [];\\\\n\\\\n    for (const [entityType, patterns] of this.entityTypes.entries()) {\\\\n      for (const pattern of patterns) {\\\\n        const index = text.indexOf(pattern);\\\\n        if (index !== -1) {\\\\n          entities.push({\\\\n            text: pattern,\\\\n            type: entityType,\\\\n            confidence: 0.8,\\\\n            start: index,\\\\n            end: index + pattern.length\\\\n          });\\\\n        }\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return entities;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async extractKeywords(text: string, language: string): Promise<string[]> {\\\\n    const stopWords = [\\\\'的\\\\', \\\\'了\\\\', \\\\'是\\\\', \\\\'在\\\\', \\\\'和\\\\', \\\\'有\\\\', \\\\'我\\\\', \\\\'你\\\\', \\\\'他\\\\', \\\\'她\\\\', \\\\'the\\\\', \\\\'a\\\\', \\\\'an\\\\', \\\\'is\\\\', \\\\'are\\\\', \\\\'was\\\\', \\\\'were\\\\'];\\\\n    const words = text.split(/[\\\\\\\\s,，。.!?！?]+/);\\\\n    \\\\n    const keywords = words\\\\n      .filter(word => word.length > 1 && !stopWords.includes(word))\\\\n      .slice(0, 10);\\\\n\\\\n    return keywords;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async extractTopics(text: string, language: string): Promise<string[]> {\\\\n    const topicKeywords: Record<string, string[]> = {\\\\n      \\\\'技术\\\\': [\\\\'技术\\\\', \\\\'开发\\\\', \\\\'编程\\\\', \\\\'代码\\\\', \\\\'系统\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'产品\\\\': [\\\\'产品\\\\', \\\\'功能\\\\', \\\\'特性\\\\', \\\\'需求\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'服务\\\\': [\\\\'服务\\\\', \\\\'支持\\\\', \\\\'帮助\\\\', \\\\'客户\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'性能\\\\': [\\\\'性能\\\\', \\\\'速度\\\\', \\\\'响应\\\\', \\\\'延迟\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'安全\\\\': [\\\\'安全\\\\', \\\\'权限\\\\', \\\\'认证\\\\', \\\\'加密\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'数据\\\\': [\\\\'数据\\\\', \\\\'信息\\\\', \\\\'统计\\\\', \\\\'分析\\\\']\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    const topics: string[] = [];\\\\n\\\\n    for (const [topic, keywords] of Object.entries(topicKeywords)) {\\\\n      for (const keyword of keywords) {\\\\n        if (text.includes(keyword)) {\\\\n          topics.push(topic);\\\\n          break;\\\\n        }\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return topics;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private detectEmotion(text: string, sentiment: string): string {\\\\n    const emotionPatterns: Record<string, string[]> = {\\\\n      \\\\'happy\\\\': [\\\\'开心\\\\', \\\\'高兴\\\\', \\\\'快乐\\\\', \\\\'满意\\\\', \\\\'happy\\\\', \\\\'glad\\\\', \\\\'pleased\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'angry\\\\': [\\\\'生气\\\\', \\\\'愤怒\\\\', \\\\'恼火\\\\', \\\\'angry\\\\', \\\\'furious\\\\', \\\\'mad\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'sad\\\\': [\\\\'难过\\\\', \\\\'伤心\\\\', \\\\'失望\\\\', \\\\'sad\\\\', \\\\'disappointed\\\\', \\\\'upset\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'fear\\\\': [\\\\'担心\\\\', \\\\'害怕\\\\', \\\\'恐惧\\\\', \\\\'worried\\\\', \\\\'afraid\\\\', \\\\'scared\\\\'],\\\\n      \\\\'surprise\\\\': [\\\\'惊讶\\\\', \\\\'意外\\\\', \\\\'surprised\\\\', \\\\'unexpected\\\\', \\\\'shocked\\\\']\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    for (const [emotion, patterns] of Object.entries(emotionPatterns)) {\\\\n      for (const pattern of patterns) {\\\\n        if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\\\n          return emotion;\\\\n        }\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (sentiment === \\\\'positive\\\\') return \\\\'happy\\\\';\\\\n    if (sentiment === \\\\'negative\\\\') return \\\\'sad\\\\';\\\\n    return \\\\'neutral\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private detectUrgency(text: string, intent: string, sentiment: string): \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\' {\\\\n    const urgencyPatterns = {\\\\n      high: [\\\\'紧急\\\\', \\\\'立即\\\\', \\\\'马上\\\\', \\\\'urgent\\\\', \\\\'immediately\\\\', \\\\'asap\\\\'],\\\\n      medium: [\\\\'尽快\\\\', \\\\'及时\\\\', \\\\'promptly\\\\', \\\\'soon\\\\']\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    for (const pattern of urgencyPatterns.high) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\\\n        return \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    for (const pattern of urgencyPatterns.medium) {\\\\n      if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\\\n        return \\\\'medium\\\\';\\\\n      }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    if (intent === \\\\'complaint\\\\' && sentiment === \\\\'negative\\\\') {\\\\n      return \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return \\\\'low\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getModel(modelName: string): SemanticModel | undefined {\\\\n    return this.models.get(modelName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getModels(): SemanticModel[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.models.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getIntent(intentName: string): Intent | undefined {\\\\n    return this.intents.get(intentName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getIntents(): Intent[] {\\\\n    return Array.from(this.intents.values());\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addCustomIntent(intent: Intent): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.intents.set(intent.name, intent);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'intent_added\\\\', intent);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async removeIntent(intentName: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.intents.delete(intentName);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'intent_removed\\\\', intentName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addEntityType(type: string, patterns: string[]): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.entityTypes.set(type, patterns);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'entity_type_added\\\\', { type, patterns });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addSentimentWord(word: string, score: number): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.sentimentLexicon.set(word, score);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'sentiment_word_added\\\\', { word, score });\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\n\\nexport interface TextInput {\\n  text: string;\\n  language?: string;\\n  context?: Record<string, any>;\\n  userId?: string;\\n  sessionId?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SemanticAnalysis {\\n  text: string;\\n  language: string;\\n  sentiment: 'positive' | 'negative' | 'neutral';\\n  confidence: number;\\n  intent: string;\\n  entities: Entity[];\\n  keywords: string[];\\n  topics: string[];\\n  emotion?: string;\\n  urgency?: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Entity {\\n  text: string;\\n  type: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  start: number;\\n  end: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Intent {\\n  name: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  slots: Record<string, any>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SemanticModel {\\n  name: string;\\n  type: 'sentiment' | 'intent' | 'entity' | 'topic' | 'custom';\\n  accuracy: number;\\n  lastTrained: number;\\n  language: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport class SemanticUnderstandingEngine extends EventEmitter {\\n  private models: Map<string, SemanticModel> = new Map();\\n  private intents: Map<string, Intent> = new Map();\\n  private entityTypes: Map<string, string[]> = new Map();\\n  private sentimentLexicon: Map<string, number> = new Map();\\n  private readonly CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD = 0.6;\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    super();\\n    this.initializeModels();\\n    this.initializeIntents();\\n    this.initializeEntityTypes();\\n    this.initializeSentimentLexicon();\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeModels(): void {\\n    this.models.set('sentiment_zh', {\\n      name: 'sentiment_zh',\\n      type: 'sentiment',\\n      accuracy: 0.85,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      language: 'zh'\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('sentiment_en', {\\n      name: 'sentiment_en',\\n      type: 'sentiment',\\n      accuracy: 0.87,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      language: 'en'\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('intent_zh', {\\n      name: 'intent_zh',\\n      type: 'intent',\\n      accuracy: 0.82,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      language: 'zh'\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('entity_zh', {\\n      name: 'entity_zh',\\n      type: 'entity',\\n      accuracy: 0.88,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      language: 'zh'\\n    });\\n\\n    this.models.set('topic_zh', {\\n      name: 'topic_zh',\\n      type: 'topic',\\n      accuracy: 0.80,\\n      lastTrained: Date.now(),\\n      language: 'zh'\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeIntents(): void {\\n    this.intents.set('greeting', {\\n      name: 'greeting',\\n      confidence: 0.9,\\n      slots: {}\\n    });\\n\\n    this.intents.set('query', {\\n      name: 'query',\\n      confidence: 0.85,\\n      slots: {\\n        query_type: '',\\n        subject: '',\\n        time_range: ''\\n      }\\n    });\\n\\n    this.intents.set('request', {\\n      name: 'request',\\n      confidence: 0.88,\\n      slots: {\\n        action: '',\\n        target: '',\\n        parameters: {}\\n      }\\n    });\\n\\n    this.intents.set('complaint', {\\n      name: 'complaint',\\n      confidence: 0.86,\\n      slots: {\\n        issue: '',\\n        severity: '',\\n        urgency: ''\\n      }\\n    });\\n\\n    this.intents.set('feedback', {\\n      name: 'feedback',\\n      confidence: 0.84,\\n      slots: {\\n        rating: '',\\n        category: '',\\n        details: ''\\n      }\\n    });\\n\\n    this.intents.set('support', {\\n      name: 'support',\\n      confidence: 0.87,\\n      slots: {\\n        problem: '',\\n        context: '',\\n        priority: ''\\n      }\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeEntityTypes(): void {\\n    this.entityTypes.set('person', ['用户', '客户', '管理员', '开发者']);\\n    this.entityTypes.set('organization', ['公司', '部门', '团队', '机构']);\\n    this.entityTypes.set('location', ['北京', '上海', '广州', '深圳']);\\n    this.entityTypes.set('time', ['今天', '明天', '昨天', '本周', '本月', '今年']);\\n    this.entityTypes.set('number', ['一', '二', '三', '四', '五', '六', '七', '八', '九', '十']);\\n    this.entityTypes.set('product', ['产品', '服务', '系统', '应用', '平台']);\\n    this.entityTypes.set('action', ['查询', '创建', '删除', '更新', '修改', '添加']);\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeSentimentLexicon(): void {\\n    const positiveWords = ['好', '优秀', '满意', '喜欢', '棒', '赞', '感谢', '不错', '完美', '出色'];\\n    const negativeWords = ['差', '糟糕', '不满', '讨厌', '差劲', '失望', '糟糕', '错误', '失败', '问题'];\\n\\n    positiveWords.forEach(word => this.sentimentLexicon.set(word, 1));\\n    negativeWords.forEach(word => this.sentimentLexicon.set(word, -1));\\n  }\\n\\n  async analyze(input: TextInput): Promise<SemanticAnalysis> {\\n    const startTime = Date.now();\\n\\n    try {\\n      const language = this.detectLanguage(input.text);\\n      \\n      const [sentiment, intent, entities, keywords, topics] = await Promise.all([\\n        this.analyzeSentiment(input.text, language),\\n        this.analyzeIntent(input.text, language),\\n        this.extractEntities(input.text, language),\\n        this.extractKeywords(input.text, language),\\n        this.extractTopics(input.text, language)\\n      ]);\\n\\n      const analysis: SemanticAnalysis = {\\n        text: input.text,\\n        language,\\n        sentiment: sentiment.sentiment,\\n        confidence: sentiment.confidence,\\n        intent: intent.name,\\n        entities,\\n        keywords,\\n        topics,\\n        emotion: this.detectEmotion(input.text, sentiment.sentiment),\\n        urgency: this.detectUrgency(input.text, intent.name, sentiment.sentiment)\\n      };\\n\\n      this.emit('analysis_completed', {\\n        input,\\n        analysis,\\n        processingTime: Date.now() - startTime\\n      });\\n\\n      return analysis;\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      this.emit('analysis_error', { input, error });\\n      throw error;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private detectLanguage(text: string): string {\\n    const chinesePattern = /[\\\\u4e00-\\\\u9fa5]/;\\n    const englishPattern = /[a-zA-Z]/;\\n\\n    const chineseCount = (text.match(chinesePattern) || []).length;\\n    const englishCount = (text.match(englishPattern) || []).length;\\n\\n    if (chineseCount > englishCount) {\\n      return 'zh';\\n    } else if (englishCount > chineseCount) {\\n      return 'en';\\n    } else {\\n      return 'zh';\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async analyzeSentiment(text: string, language: string): Promise<{\\n    sentiment: 'positive' | 'negative' | 'neutral';\\n    confidence: number;\\n  }> {\\n    let score = 0;\\n    let matchCount = 0;\\n\\n    for (const [word, value] of this.sentimentLexicon.entries()) {\\n      if (text.includes(word)) {\\n        score += value;\\n        matchCount++;\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (matchCount === 0) {\\n      return { sentiment: 'neutral', confidence: 0.5 };\\n    }\\n\\n    const avgScore = score / matchCount;\\n    const confidence = Math.min(1, 0.5 + Math.abs(avgScore) * 0.5);\\n\\n    if (avgScore > 0.2) {\\n      return { sentiment: 'positive', confidence };\\n    } else if (avgScore < -0.2) {\\n      return { sentiment: 'negative', confidence };\\n    } else {\\n      return { sentiment: 'neutral', confidence };\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private async analyzeIntent(text: string, language: string): Promise<Intent> {\\n    const intentScores: Map<string, number> = new Map();\\n\\n    for (const [intentName, intent] of this.intents.entries()) {\\n      const score = this.calculateIntentScore(text, intentName);\\n      intentScores.set(intentName, score);\\n    }\\n\\n    const sortedIntents = Array.from(intentScores.entries())\\n      .sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1]);\\n\\n    const [bestIntent, confidence] = sortedIntents[0];\\n\\n    return {\\n      name: bestIntent,\\n      confidence,\\n      slots: this.extractSlots(text, bestIntent)\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateIntentScore(text: string, intentName: string): number {\\n    const intentPatterns: Record<string, string[]> = {\\n      greeting: ['你好', '您好', '早上好', '晚上好', 'hello', 'hi'],\\n      query: ['查询', '搜索', '找', '问', 'query', 'search', 'find'],\\n      request: ['请', '帮我', '能否', '可以', 'please', 'help', 'can'],\\n      complaint: ['投诉', '不满', '问题', '错误', 'complaint', 'issue', 'error'],\\n      feedback: ['反馈', '评价', '建议', '意见', 'feedback', 'review', 'suggestion'],\\n      support: ['帮助', '支持', '协助', 'support', 'help', 'assist']\\n    };\\n\\n    const patterns = intentPatterns[intentName] || [];\\n    let score = 0;\\n\\n    for (const pattern of patterns) {\\n      if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\n        score += 0.3;\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    return Math.min(1, score);\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractSlots(text: string, intentName: string): Record<string, any> {\\n    const slots: Record<string, any> = {};\\n\\n    if (intentName === 'query') {\\n      slots.query_type = this.extractQueryType(text);\\n      slots.subject = this.extractSubject(text);\\n      slots.time_range = this.extractTimeRange(text);\\n    } else if (intentName === 'request') {\\n      slots.action = this.extractAction(text);\\n      slots.target = this.extractTarget(text);\\n      slots.parameters = this.extractParameters(text);\\n    } else if (intentName === 'complaint') {\\n      slots.issue = this.extractIssue(text);\\n      slots.severity = this.extractSeverity(text);\\n      slots.urgency = this.extractUrgency(text);\\n    }\\n\\n    return slots;\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractQueryType(text: string): string {\\n    if (text.includes('用户')) return 'user';\\n    if (text.includes('订单')) return 'order';\\n    if (text.includes('产品')) return 'product';\\n    if (text.includes('系统')) return 'system';\\n    return 'general';\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractSubject(text: string): string {\\n    const subjects = ['用户', '订单', '产品', '服务', '系统', '数据'];\\n    for (const subject of subjects) {\\n      if (text.includes(subject)) {\\n        return subject;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return '';\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractTimeRange(text: string): string {\\n    if (text.includes('今天')) return 'today';\\n    if (text.includes('本周')) return 'week';\\n    if (text.includes('本月')) return 'month';\\n    if (text.includes('今年')) return 'year';\\n    return 'all';\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractAction(text: string): string {\\n    const actions = ['创建', '删除', '更新', '修改', '添加', '查询'];\\n    for (const action of actions) {\\n      if (text.includes(action)) {\\n        return action;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return '';\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractTarget(text: string): string {\\n    return this.extractSubject(text);\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractParameters(text: string): Record<string, any> {\\n    const params: Record<string, any> = {};\\n    const numberMatch = text.match(/\\\\d+/);\\n    if (numberMatch) {\\n      params.number = parseInt(numberMatch[0]);\\n    }\\n    return params;\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractIssue(text: string): string {\\n    const issues = ['性能', '安全', '功能', '界面', '数据'];\\n    for (const issue of issues) {\\n      if (text.includes(issue)) {\\n        return issue;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return '';\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractSeverity(text: string): string {\\n    if (text.includes('严重') || text.includes('紧急')) return 'high';\\n    if (text.includes('一般') || text.includes('普通')) return 'medium';\\n    return 'low';\\n  }\\n\\n  private extractUrgency(text: string): string {\\n    return this.extractSeverity(text);\\n  }\\n\\n  private async extractEntities(text: string, language: string): Promise<Entity[]> {\\n    const entities: Entity[] = [];\\n\\n    for (const [entityType, patterns] of this.entityTypes.entries()) {\\n      for (const pattern of patterns) {\\n        const index = text.indexOf(pattern);\\n        if (index !== -1) {\\n          entities.push({\\n            text: pattern,\\n            type: entityType,\\n            confidence: 0.8,\\n            start: index,\\n            end: index + pattern.length\\n          });\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    return entities;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async extractKeywords(text: string, language: string): Promise<string[]> {\\n    const stopWords = ['的', '了', '是', '在', '和', '有', '我', '你', '他', '她', 'the', 'a', 'an', 'is', 'are', 'was', 'were'];\\n    const words = text.split(/[\\\\s,，。.!?！?]+/);\\n    \\n    const keywords = words\\n      .filter(word => word.length > 1 && !stopWords.includes(word))\\n      .slice(0, 10);\\n\\n    return keywords;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async extractTopics(text: string, language: string): Promise<string[]> {\\n    const topicKeywords: Record<string, string[]> = {\\n      '技术': ['技术', '开发', '编程', '代码', '系统'],\\n      '产品': ['产品', '功能', '特性', '需求'],\\n      '服务': ['服务', '支持', '帮助', '客户'],\\n      '性能': ['性能', '速度', '响应', '延迟'],\\n      '安全': ['安全', '权限', '认证', '加密'],\\n      '数据': ['数据', '信息', '统计', '分析']\\n    };\\n\\n    const topics: string[] = [];\\n\\n    for (const [topic, keywords] of Object.entries(topicKeywords)) {\\n      for (const keyword of keywords) {\\n        if (text.includes(keyword)) {\\n          topics.push(topic);\\n          break;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    return topics;\\n  }\\n\\n  private detectEmotion(text: string, sentiment: string): string {\\n    const emotionPatterns: Record<string, string[]> = {\\n      'happy': ['开心', '高兴', '快乐', '满意', 'happy', 'glad', 'pleased'],\\n      'angry': ['生气', '愤怒', '恼火', 'angry', 'furious', 'mad'],\\n      'sad': ['难过', '伤心', '失望', 'sad', 'disappointed', 'upset'],\\n      'fear': ['担心', '害怕', '恐惧', 'worried', 'afraid', 'scared'],\\n      'surprise': ['惊讶', '意外', 'surprised', 'unexpected', 'shocked']\\n    };\\n\\n    for (const [emotion, patterns] of Object.entries(emotionPatterns)) {\\n      for (const pattern of patterns) {\\n        if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\n          return emotion;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (sentiment === 'positive') return 'happy';\\n    if (sentiment === 'negative') return 'sad';\\n    return 'neutral';\\n  }\\n\\n  private detectUrgency(text: string, intent: string, sentiment: string): 'low' | 'medium' | 'high' {\\n    const urgencyPatterns = {\\n      high: ['紧急', '立即', '马上', 'urgent', 'immediately', 'asap'],\\n      medium: ['尽快', '及时', 'promptly', 'soon']\\n    };\\n\\n    for (const pattern of urgencyPatterns.high) {\\n      if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\n        return 'high';\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    for (const pattern of urgencyPatterns.medium) {\\n      if (text.includes(pattern)) {\\n        return 'medium';\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (intent === 'complaint' && sentiment === 'negative') {\\n      return 'high';\\n    }\\n\\n    return 'low';\\n  }\\n\\n  getModel(modelName: string): SemanticModel | undefined {\\n    return this.models.get(modelName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getModels(): SemanticModel[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.models.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  getIntent(intentName: string): Intent | undefined {\\n    return this.intents.get(intentName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getIntents(): Intent[] {\\n    return Array.from(this.intents.values());\\n  }\\n\\n  async addCustomIntent(intent: Intent): Promise<void> {\\n    this.intents.set(intent.name, intent);\\n    this.emit('intent_added', intent);\\n  }\\n\\n  async removeIntent(intentName: string): Promise<void> {\\n    this.intents.delete(intentName);\\n    this.emit('intent_removed', intentName);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addEntityType(type: string, patterns: string[]): Promise<void> {\\n    this.entityTypes.set(type, patterns);\\n    this.emit('entity_type_added', { type, patterns });\\n  }\\n\\n  async addSentimentWord(word: string, score: number): Promise<void> {\\n    this.sentimentLexicon.set(word, score);\\n    this.emit('sentiment_word_added', { word, score });\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":14579,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647776241}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/nlp/dialogue/DialogueManager.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":427,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":427,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\nimport { SemanticUnderstandingEngine, SemanticAnalysis } from \\\\'./SemanticUnderstandingEngine\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DialogueTurn {\\\\n  id: string;\\\\n  userId: string;\\\\n  sessionId: string;\\\\n  input: string;\\\\n  analysis: SemanticAnalysis;\\\\n  response: string;\\\\n  timestamp: number;\\\\n  context: Record<string, any>;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DialogueContext {\\\\n  userId: string;\\\\n  sessionId: string;\\\\n  turns: DialogueTurn[];\\\\n  currentIntent: string;\\\\n  slots: Record<string, any>;\\\\n  state: \\\\'active\\\\' | \\\\'completed\\\\' | \\\\'abandoned\\\\';\\\\n  startTime: number;\\\\n  lastActivity: number;\\\\n  metadata: Record<string, any>;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DialogueResponse {\\\\n  text: string;\\\\n  actions: DialogueAction[];\\\\n  followUpQuestions?: string[];\\\\n  confidence: number;\\\\n  requiresConfirmation?: boolean;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DialogueAction {\\\\n  type: \\\\'query\\\\' | \\\\'update\\\\' | \\\\'create\\\\' | \\\\'delete\\\\' | \\\\'notify\\\\' | \\\\'custom\\\\';\\\\n  target: string;\\\\n  parameters: Record<string, any>;\\\\n  priority: \\\\'low\\\\' | \\\\'medium\\\\' | \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class DialogueManager extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private semanticEngine: SemanticUnderstandingEngine;\\\\n  private contexts: Map<string, DialogueContext> = new Map();\\\\n  private responseTemplates: Map<string, string[]> = new Map();\\\\n  private dialogueFlows: Map<string, DialogueFlow> = new Map();\\\\n  private readonly CONTEXT_TIMEOUT = 1800000; // 30 minutes\\\\n  private readonly MAX_TURNS_PER_SESSION = 20;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(semanticEngine: SemanticUnderstandingEngine) {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.semanticEngine = semanticEngine;\\\\n    this.initializeResponseTemplates();\\\\n    this.initializeDialogueFlows();\\\\n    this.startContextCleanup();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeResponseTemplates(): void {\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'greeting\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'您好！有什么可以帮助您的吗？\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'您好！请问有什么可以为您服务的？\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'您好！很高兴为您服务，请问有什么需求？\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'query\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'好的，我来帮您查询相关信息。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'没问题，让我为您查询一下。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'收到，正在为您查询...\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'request\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'好的，我来帮您处理这个请求。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'收到，正在为您处理...\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'好的，让我来帮您完成这个操作。\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'complaint\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'非常抱歉给您带来不便，我们立即处理这个问题。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'感谢您的反馈，我们会尽快解决这个问题。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'很抱歉听到这个消息，我们会立即跟进处理。\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'feedback\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'感谢您的反馈，我们会认真考虑您的建议。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'谢谢您的评价，我们会持续改进。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'感谢您的宝贵意见！\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'support\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'好的，我来帮您解决这个问题。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'别担心，让我来帮您分析一下。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'收到，我们一起来解决这个问题。\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'unknown\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'抱歉，我没有完全理解您的意思，能否请您再详细说明一下？\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'不好意思，我不太明白您的需求，能否提供更多信息？\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'抱歉，我需要更多信息才能帮助您，请您详细描述一下。\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'confirmation\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'请确认是否继续执行此操作？\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'您确定要执行此操作吗？\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'请确认是否继续？\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'success\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'操作已成功完成！\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'处理完成，感谢您的使用！\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'操作成功！\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(\\\\'error\\\\', [\\\\n      \\\\'抱歉，操作过程中出现了错误，请稍后再试。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'处理失败，请检查您的输入后重试。\\\\',\\\\n      \\\\'抱歉，系统出现错误，请联系客服。\\\\'\\\\n    ]);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private initializeDialogueFlows(): void {\\\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set(\\\\'query_flow\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'query_flow\\\\',\\\\n      steps: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          step: 1,\\\\n          intent: \\\\'query\\\\',\\\\n          requiredSlots: [\\\\'query_type\\\\', \\\\'subject\\\\'],\\\\n          prompts: [\\\\'请问您想查询什么？\\\\', \\\\'请提供查询的具体信息。\\\\']\\\\n        },\\\\n        {\\\\n          step: 2,\\\\n          intent: \\\\'query\\\\',\\\\n          requiredSlots: [\\\\'time_range\\\\'],\\\\n          prompts: [\\\\'请问您想查询哪个时间段的数据？\\\\']\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      completionActions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          type: \\\\'query\\\\',\\\\n          target: \\\\'database\\\\',\\\\n          parameters: {},\\\\n          priority: \\\\'medium\\\\'\\\\n        }\\\\n      ]\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set(\\\\'request_flow\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'request_flow\\\\',\\\\n      steps: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          step: 1,\\\\n          intent: \\\\'request\\\\',\\\\n          requiredSlots: [\\\\'action\\\\', \\\\'target\\\\'],\\\\n          prompts: [\\\\'请问您想执行什么操作？\\\\', \\\\'请提供操作的具体信息。\\\\']\\\\n        },\\\\n        {\\\\n          step: 2,\\\\n          intent: \\\\'request\\\\',\\\\n          requiredSlots: [\\\\'parameters\\\\'],\\\\n          prompts: [\\\\'请提供必要的参数信息。\\\\']\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      completionActions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          type: \\\\'update\\\\',\\\\n          target: \\\\'system\\\\',\\\\n          parameters: {},\\\\n          priority: \\\\'high\\\\'\\\\n        }\\\\n      ]\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set(\\\\'complaint_flow\\\\', {\\\\n      name: \\\\'complaint_flow\\\\',\\\\n      steps: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          step: 1,\\\\n          intent: \\\\'complaint\\\\',\\\\n          requiredSlots: [\\\\'issue\\\\'],\\\\n          prompts: [\\\\'请问您遇到了什么问题？\\\\', \\\\'请详细描述您遇到的问题。\\\\']\\\\n        },\\\\n        {\\\\n          step: 2,\\\\n          intent: \\\\'complaint\\\\',\\\\n          requiredSlots: [\\\\'severity\\\\', \\\\'urgency\\\\'],\\\\n          prompts: [\\\\'请问问题的严重程度如何？是否紧急？\\\\']\\\\n        }\\\\n      ],\\\\n      completionActions: [\\\\n        {\\\\n          type: \\\\'notify\\\\',\\\\n          target: \\\\'support_team\\\\',\\\\n          parameters: {},\\\\n          priority: \\\\'high\\\\'\\\\n        }\\\\n      ]\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async processDialogue(\\\\n    userId: string,\\\\n    sessionId: string,\\\\n    input: string,\\\\n    context?: Record<string, any>\\\\n  ): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\\\n    const startTime = Date.now();\\\\n\\\\n    try {\\\\n      const analysis = await this.semanticEngine.analyze({\\\\n        text: input,\\\\n        context,\\\\n        userId,\\\\n        sessionId\\\\n      });\\\\n\\\\n      const dialogueContext = this.getOrCreateContext(userId, sessionId, context);\\\\n      \\\\n      const response = await this.generateResponse(analysis, dialogueContext);\\\\n      \\\\n      const turn: DialogueTurn = {\\\\n        id: `turn-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`,\\\\n        userId,\\\\n        sessionId,\\\\n        input,\\\\n        analysis,\\\\n        response: response.text,\\\\n        timestamp: Date.now(),\\\\n        context: dialogueContext.slots\\\\n      };\\\\n\\\\n      dialogueContext.turns.push(turn);\\\\n      dialogueContext.lastActivity = Date.now();\\\\n      dialogueContext.currentIntent = analysis.intent;\\\\n\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_processed\\\\', {\\\\n        userId,\\\\n        sessionId,\\\\n        turn,\\\\n        response,\\\\n        processingTime: Date.now() - startTime\\\\n      });\\\\n\\\\n      return response;\\\\n    } catch (error) {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_error\\\\', { userId, sessionId, input, error });\\\\n      throw error;\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private getOrCreateContext(\\\\n    userId: string,\\\\n    sessionId: string,\\\\n    context?: Record<string, any>\\\\n  ): DialogueContext {\\\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\\\n    let dialogueContext = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\\\n\\\\n    if (!dialogueContext) {\\\\n      dialogueContext = {\\\\n        userId,\\\\n        sessionId,\\\\n        turns: [],\\\\n        currentIntent: \\\\'\\\\',\\\\n        slots: context || {},\\\\n        state: \\\\'active\\\\',\\\\n        startTime: Date.now(),\\\\n        lastActivity: Date.now(),\\\\n        metadata: {}\\\\n      };\\\\n      this.contexts.set(contextKey, dialogueContext);\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'context_created\\\\', dialogueContext);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return dialogueContext;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private async generateResponse(\\\\n    analysis: SemanticAnalysis,\\\\n    context: DialogueContext\\\\n  ): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\\\n    const intent = analysis.intent;\\\\n    const templates = this.responseTemplates.get(intent) || this.responseTemplates.get(\\\\'unknown\\\\')!;\\\\n    \\\\n    const responseText = templates[Math.floor(Math.random() * templates.length)];\\\\n    \\\\n    const response: DialogueResponse = {\\\\n      text: responseText,\\\\n      actions: this.generateActions(analysis, context),\\\\n      followUpQuestions: this.generateFollowUpQuestions(analysis, context),\\\\n      confidence: analysis.confidence,\\\\n      requiresConfirmation: this.requiresConfirmation(intent, analysis.urgency)\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    return response;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private generateActions(analysis: SemanticAnalysis, context: DialogueContext): DialogueAction[] {\\\\n    const actions: DialogueAction[] = [];\\\\n\\\\n    if (analysis.intent === \\\\'query\\\\') {\\\\n      actions.push({\\\\n        type: \\\\'query\\\\',\\\\n        target: analysis.entities.find(e => e.type === \\\\'product\\\\')?.text || \\\\'system\\\\',\\\\n        parameters: {\\\\n          query_type: analysis.keywords.join(\\\\' \\\\'),\\\\n          time_range: analysis.entities.find(e => e.type === \\\\'time\\\\')?.text || \\\\'all\\\\'\\\\n        },\\\\n        priority: analysis.urgency === \\\\'high\\\\' ? \\\\'high\\\\' : \\\\'medium\\\\'\\\\n      });\\\\n    } else if (analysis.intent === \\\\'request\\\\') {\\\\n      actions.push({\\\\n        type: \\\\'update\\\\',\\\\n        target: analysis.entities.find(e => e.type === \\\\'product\\\\')?.text || \\\\'system\\\\',\\\\n        parameters: {\\\\n          action: analysis.keywords.find(k => [\\\\'创建\\\\', \\\\'删除\\\\', \\\\'更新\\\\', \\\\'修改\\\\'].includes(k)) || \\\\'update\\\\',\\\\n          details: analysis.keywords\\\\n        },\\\\n        priority: analysis.urgency === \\\\'high\\\\' ? \\\\'high\\\\' : \\\\'medium\\\\'\\\\n      });\\\\n    } else if (analysis.intent === \\\\'complaint\\\\') {\\\\n      actions.push({\\\\n        type: \\\\'notify\\\\',\\\\n        target: \\\\'support_team\\\\',\\\\n        parameters: {\\\\n          issue: analysis.keywords.join(\\\\' \\\\'),\\\\n          severity: analysis.urgency,\\\\n          sentiment: analysis.sentiment\\\\n        },\\\\n        priority: \\\\'high\\\\'\\\\n      });\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return actions;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private generateFollowUpQuestions(\\\\n    analysis: SemanticAnalysis,\\\\n    context: DialogueContext\\\\n  ): string[] | undefined {\\\\n    const flow = this.dialogueFlows.get(`${analysis.intent}_flow`);\\\\n    if (!flow) {\\\\n      return undefined;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const currentStep = context.turns.length + 1;\\\\n    const stepConfig = flow.steps.find(s => s.step === currentStep);\\\\n\\\\n    if (!stepConfig) {\\\\n      return undefined;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const missingSlots = stepConfig.requiredSlots.filter(\\\\n      slot => !context.slots[slot]\\\\n    );\\\\n\\\\n    if (missingSlots.length === 0) {\\\\n      return undefined;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return stepConfig.prompts;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private requiresConfirmation(intent: string, urgency: string): boolean {\\\\n    const confirmationRequired = [\\\\'request\\\\', \\\\'delete\\\\'];\\\\n    return confirmationRequired.includes(intent) || urgency === \\\\'high\\\\';\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async confirmAction(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\\\n    const context = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\\\n\\\\n    if (!context) {\\\\n      throw new Error(\\\\'Dialogue context not found\\\\');\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    const successTemplates = this.responseTemplates.get(\\\\'success\\\\')!;\\\\n    const responseText = successTemplates[Math.floor(Math.random() * successTemplates.length)];\\\\n\\\\n    context.state = \\\\'completed\\\\';\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_completed\\\\', context);\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      text: responseText,\\\\n      actions: [],\\\\n      confidence: 1.0\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async cancelDialogue(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\\\n    const context = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\\\n\\\\n    if (context) {\\\\n      context.state = \\\\'abandoned\\\\';\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_cancelled\\\\', context);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): DialogueContext | undefined {\\\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\\\n    return this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAllContexts(userId?: string): DialogueContext[] {\\\\n    let contexts = Array.from(this.contexts.values());\\\\n\\\\n    if (userId) {\\\\n      contexts = contexts.filter(c => c.userId === userId);\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return contexts.sort((a, b) => b.lastActivity - a.lastActivity);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async clearContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\\\n    const context = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\\\n\\\\n    if (context) {\\\\n      this.contexts.delete(contextKey);\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'context_cleared\\\\', context);\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addResponseTemplate(intent: string, templates: string[]): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(intent, templates);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'template_added\\\\', { intent, templates });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addDialogueFlow(flow: DialogueFlow): Promise<void> {\\\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set(flow.name, flow);\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'flow_added\\\\', flow);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private startContextCleanup(): void {\\\\n    setInterval(() => {\\\\n      const now = Date.now();\\\\n      const expiredContexts: string[] = [];\\\\n\\\\n      for (const [key, context] of this.contexts.entries()) {\\\\n        if (now - context.lastActivity > this.CONTEXT_TIMEOUT) {\\\\n          expiredContexts.push(key);\\\\n        }\\\\n      }\\\\n\\\\n      for (const key of expiredContexts) {\\\\n        const context = this.contexts.get(key);\\\\n        if (context) {\\\\n          this.contexts.delete(key);\\\\n          this.emit(\\\\'context_expired\\\\', context);\\\\n        }\\\\n      }\\\\n    }, 60000); // Check every minute\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getDialogueStatistics(): {\\\\n    totalContexts: number;\\\\n    activeContexts: number;\\\\n    completedContexts: number;\\\\n    abandonedContexts: number;\\\\n    totalTurns: number;\\\\n    averageTurnsPerSession: number;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    const contexts = Array.from(this.contexts.values());\\\\n\\\\n    return {\\\\n      totalContexts: contexts.length,\\\\n      activeContexts: contexts.filter(c => c.state === \\\\'active\\\\').length,\\\\n      completedContexts: contexts.filter(c => c.state === \\\\'completed\\\\').length,\\\\n      abandonedContexts: contexts.filter(c => c.state === \\\\'abandoned\\\\').length,\\\\n      totalTurns: contexts.reduce((sum, c) => sum + c.turns.length, 0),\\\\n      averageTurnsPerSession: contexts.length > 0\\\\n        ? contexts.reduce((sum, c) => sum + c.turns.length, 0) / contexts.length\\\\n        : 0\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DialogueFlow {\\\\n  name: string;\\\\n  steps: DialogueFlowStep[];\\\\n  completionActions: DialogueAction[];\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport interface DialogueFlowStep {\\\\n  step: number;\\\\n  intent: string;\\\\n  requiredSlots: string[];\\\\n  prompts: string[];\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\nimport { SemanticUnderstandingEngine, SemanticAnalysis } from './SemanticUnderstandingEngine';\\n\\nexport interface DialogueTurn {\\n  id: string;\\n  userId: string;\\n  sessionId: string;\\n  input: string;\\n  analysis: SemanticAnalysis;\\n  response: string;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  context: Record<string, any>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DialogueContext {\\n  userId: string;\\n  sessionId: string;\\n  turns: DialogueTurn[];\\n  currentIntent: string;\\n  slots: Record<string, any>;\\n  state: 'active' | 'completed' | 'abandoned';\\n  startTime: number;\\n  lastActivity: number;\\n  metadata: Record<string, any>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DialogueResponse {\\n  text: string;\\n  actions: DialogueAction[];\\n  followUpQuestions?: string[];\\n  confidence: number;\\n  requiresConfirmation?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DialogueAction {\\n  type: 'query' | 'update' | 'create' | 'delete' | 'notify' | 'custom';\\n  target: string;\\n  parameters: Record<string, any>;\\n  priority: 'low' | 'medium' | 'high';\\n}\\n\\nexport class DialogueManager extends EventEmitter {\\n  private semanticEngine: SemanticUnderstandingEngine;\\n  private contexts: Map<string, DialogueContext> = new Map();\\n  private responseTemplates: Map<string, string[]> = new Map();\\n  private dialogueFlows: Map<string, DialogueFlow> = new Map();\\n  private readonly CONTEXT_TIMEOUT = 1800000; // 30 minutes\\n  private readonly MAX_TURNS_PER_SESSION = 20;\\n\\n  constructor(semanticEngine: SemanticUnderstandingEngine) {\\n    super();\\n    this.semanticEngine = semanticEngine;\\n    this.initializeResponseTemplates();\\n    this.initializeDialogueFlows();\\n    this.startContextCleanup();\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeResponseTemplates(): void {\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('greeting', [\\n      '您好！有什么可以帮助您的吗？',\\n      '您好！请问有什么可以为您服务的？',\\n      '您好！很高兴为您服务，请问有什么需求？'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('query', [\\n      '好的，我来帮您查询相关信息。',\\n      '没问题，让我为您查询一下。',\\n      '收到，正在为您查询...'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('request', [\\n      '好的，我来帮您处理这个请求。',\\n      '收到，正在为您处理...',\\n      '好的，让我来帮您完成这个操作。'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('complaint', [\\n      '非常抱歉给您带来不便，我们立即处理这个问题。',\\n      '感谢您的反馈，我们会尽快解决这个问题。',\\n      '很抱歉听到这个消息，我们会立即跟进处理。'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('feedback', [\\n      '感谢您的反馈，我们会认真考虑您的建议。',\\n      '谢谢您的评价，我们会持续改进。',\\n      '感谢您的宝贵意见！'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('support', [\\n      '好的，我来帮您解决这个问题。',\\n      '别担心，让我来帮您分析一下。',\\n      '收到，我们一起来解决这个问题。'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('unknown', [\\n      '抱歉，我没有完全理解您的意思，能否请您再详细说明一下？',\\n      '不好意思，我不太明白您的需求，能否提供更多信息？',\\n      '抱歉，我需要更多信息才能帮助您，请您详细描述一下。'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('confirmation', [\\n      '请确认是否继续执行此操作？',\\n      '您确定要执行此操作吗？',\\n      '请确认是否继续？'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('success', [\\n      '操作已成功完成！',\\n      '处理完成，感谢您的使用！',\\n      '操作成功！'\\n    ]);\\n\\n    this.responseTemplates.set('error', [\\n      '抱歉，操作过程中出现了错误，请稍后再试。',\\n      '处理失败，请检查您的输入后重试。',\\n      '抱歉，系统出现错误，请联系客服。'\\n    ]);\\n  }\\n\\n  private initializeDialogueFlows(): void {\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set('query_flow', {\\n      name: 'query_flow',\\n      steps: [\\n        {\\n          step: 1,\\n          intent: 'query',\\n          requiredSlots: ['query_type', 'subject'],\\n          prompts: ['请问您想查询什么？', '请提供查询的具体信息。']\\n        },\\n        {\\n          step: 2,\\n          intent: 'query',\\n          requiredSlots: ['time_range'],\\n          prompts: ['请问您想查询哪个时间段的数据？']\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      completionActions: [\\n        {\\n          type: 'query',\\n          target: 'database',\\n          parameters: {},\\n          priority: 'medium'\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    });\\n\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set('request_flow', {\\n      name: 'request_flow',\\n      steps: [\\n        {\\n          step: 1,\\n          intent: 'request',\\n          requiredSlots: ['action', 'target'],\\n          prompts: ['请问您想执行什么操作？', '请提供操作的具体信息。']\\n        },\\n        {\\n          step: 2,\\n          intent: 'request',\\n          requiredSlots: ['parameters'],\\n          prompts: ['请提供必要的参数信息。']\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      completionActions: [\\n        {\\n          type: 'update',\\n          target: 'system',\\n          parameters: {},\\n          priority: 'high'\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    });\\n\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set('complaint_flow', {\\n      name: 'complaint_flow',\\n      steps: [\\n        {\\n          step: 1,\\n          intent: 'complaint',\\n          requiredSlots: ['issue'],\\n          prompts: ['请问您遇到了什么问题？', '请详细描述您遇到的问题。']\\n        },\\n        {\\n          step: 2,\\n          intent: 'complaint',\\n          requiredSlots: ['severity', 'urgency'],\\n          prompts: ['请问问题的严重程度如何？是否紧急？']\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      completionActions: [\\n        {\\n          type: 'notify',\\n          target: 'support_team',\\n          parameters: {},\\n          priority: 'high'\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async processDialogue(\\n    userId: string,\\n    sessionId: string,\\n    input: string,\\n    context?: Record<string, any>\\n  ): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\n    const startTime = Date.now();\\n\\n    try {\\n      const analysis = await this.semanticEngine.analyze({\\n        text: input,\\n        context,\\n        userId,\\n        sessionId\\n      });\\n\\n      const dialogueContext = this.getOrCreateContext(userId, sessionId, context);\\n      \\n      const response = await this.generateResponse(analysis, dialogueContext);\\n      \\n      const turn: DialogueTurn = {\\n        id: `turn-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`,\\n        userId,\\n        sessionId,\\n        input,\\n        analysis,\\n        response: response.text,\\n        timestamp: Date.now(),\\n        context: dialogueContext.slots\\n      };\\n\\n      dialogueContext.turns.push(turn);\\n      dialogueContext.lastActivity = Date.now();\\n      dialogueContext.currentIntent = analysis.intent;\\n\\n      this.emit('dialogue_processed', {\\n        userId,\\n        sessionId,\\n        turn,\\n        response,\\n        processingTime: Date.now() - startTime\\n      });\\n\\n      return response;\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      this.emit('dialogue_error', { userId, sessionId, input, error });\\n      throw error;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private getOrCreateContext(\\n    userId: string,\\n    sessionId: string,\\n    context?: Record<string, any>\\n  ): DialogueContext {\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\n    let dialogueContext = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\n\\n    if (!dialogueContext) {\\n      dialogueContext = {\\n        userId,\\n        sessionId,\\n        turns: [],\\n        currentIntent: '',\\n        slots: context || {},\\n        state: 'active',\\n        startTime: Date.now(),\\n        lastActivity: Date.now(),\\n        metadata: {}\\n      };\\n      this.contexts.set(contextKey, dialogueContext);\\n      this.emit('context_created', dialogueContext);\\n    }\\n\\n    return dialogueContext;\\n  }\\n\\n  private async generateResponse(\\n    analysis: SemanticAnalysis,\\n    context: DialogueContext\\n  ): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\n    const intent = analysis.intent;\\n    const templates = this.responseTemplates.get(intent) || this.responseTemplates.get('unknown')!;\\n    \\n    const responseText = templates[Math.floor(Math.random() * templates.length)];\\n    \\n    const response: DialogueResponse = {\\n      text: responseText,\\n      actions: this.generateActions(analysis, context),\\n      followUpQuestions: this.generateFollowUpQuestions(analysis, context),\\n      confidence: analysis.confidence,\\n      requiresConfirmation: this.requiresConfirmation(intent, analysis.urgency)\\n    };\\n\\n    return response;\\n  }\\n\\n  private generateActions(analysis: SemanticAnalysis, context: DialogueContext): DialogueAction[] {\\n    const actions: DialogueAction[] = [];\\n\\n    if (analysis.intent === 'query') {\\n      actions.push({\\n        type: 'query',\\n        target: analysis.entities.find(e => e.type === 'product')?.text || 'system',\\n        parameters: {\\n          query_type: analysis.keywords.join(' '),\\n          time_range: analysis.entities.find(e => e.type === 'time')?.text || 'all'\\n        },\\n        priority: analysis.urgency === 'high' ? 'high' : 'medium'\\n      });\\n    } else if (analysis.intent === 'request') {\\n      actions.push({\\n        type: 'update',\\n        target: analysis.entities.find(e => e.type === 'product')?.text || 'system',\\n        parameters: {\\n          action: analysis.keywords.find(k => ['创建', '删除', '更新', '修改'].includes(k)) || 'update',\\n          details: analysis.keywords\\n        },\\n        priority: analysis.urgency === 'high' ? 'high' : 'medium'\\n      });\\n    } else if (analysis.intent === 'complaint') {\\n      actions.push({\\n        type: 'notify',\\n        target: 'support_team',\\n        parameters: {\\n          issue: analysis.keywords.join(' '),\\n          severity: analysis.urgency,\\n          sentiment: analysis.sentiment\\n        },\\n        priority: 'high'\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    return actions;\\n  }\\n\\n  private generateFollowUpQuestions(\\n    analysis: SemanticAnalysis,\\n    context: DialogueContext\\n  ): string[] | undefined {\\n    const flow = this.dialogueFlows.get(`${analysis.intent}_flow`);\\n    if (!flow) {\\n      return undefined;\\n    }\\n\\n    const currentStep = context.turns.length + 1;\\n    const stepConfig = flow.steps.find(s => s.step === currentStep);\\n\\n    if (!stepConfig) {\\n      return undefined;\\n    }\\n\\n    const missingSlots = stepConfig.requiredSlots.filter(\\n      slot => !context.slots[slot]\\n    );\\n\\n    if (missingSlots.length === 0) {\\n      return undefined;\\n    }\\n\\n    return stepConfig.prompts;\\n  }\\n\\n  private requiresConfirmation(intent: string, urgency: string): boolean {\\n    const confirmationRequired = ['request', 'delete'];\\n    return confirmationRequired.includes(intent) || urgency === 'high';\\n  }\\n\\n  async confirmAction(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\n    const context = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\n\\n    if (!context) {\\n      throw new Error('Dialogue context not found');\\n    }\\n\\n    const successTemplates = this.responseTemplates.get('success')!;\\n    const responseText = successTemplates[Math.floor(Math.random() * successTemplates.length)];\\n\\n    context.state = 'completed';\\n    this.emit('dialogue_completed', context);\\n\\n    return {\\n      text: responseText,\\n      actions: [],\\n      confidence: 1.0\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  async cancelDialogue(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\n    const context = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\n\\n    if (context) {\\n      context.state = 'abandoned';\\n      this.emit('dialogue_cancelled', context);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  getContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): DialogueContext | undefined {\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\n    return this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\n  }\\n\\n  getAllContexts(userId?: string): DialogueContext[] {\\n    let contexts = Array.from(this.contexts.values());\\n\\n    if (userId) {\\n      contexts = contexts.filter(c => c.userId === userId);\\n    }\\n\\n    return contexts.sort((a, b) => b.lastActivity - a.lastActivity);\\n  }\\n\\n  async clearContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    const contextKey = `${userId}:${sessionId}`;\\n    const context = this.contexts.get(contextKey);\\n\\n    if (context) {\\n      this.contexts.delete(contextKey);\\n      this.emit('context_cleared', context);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async addResponseTemplate(intent: string, templates: string[]): Promise<void> {\\n    this.responseTemplates.set(intent, templates);\\n    this.emit('template_added', { intent, templates });\\n  }\\n\\n  async addDialogueFlow(flow: DialogueFlow): Promise<void> {\\n    this.dialogueFlows.set(flow.name, flow);\\n    this.emit('flow_added', flow);\\n  }\\n\\n  private startContextCleanup(): void {\\n    setInterval(() => {\\n      const now = Date.now();\\n      const expiredContexts: string[] = [];\\n\\n      for (const [key, context] of this.contexts.entries()) {\\n        if (now - context.lastActivity > this.CONTEXT_TIMEOUT) {\\n          expiredContexts.push(key);\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      for (const key of expiredContexts) {\\n        const context = this.contexts.get(key);\\n        if (context) {\\n          this.contexts.delete(key);\\n          this.emit('context_expired', context);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }, 60000); // Check every minute\\n  }\\n\\n  getDialogueStatistics(): {\\n    totalContexts: number;\\n    activeContexts: number;\\n    completedContexts: number;\\n    abandonedContexts: number;\\n    totalTurns: number;\\n    averageTurnsPerSession: number;\\n  } {\\n    const contexts = Array.from(this.contexts.values());\\n\\n    return {\\n      totalContexts: contexts.length,\\n      activeContexts: contexts.filter(c => c.state === 'active').length,\\n      completedContexts: contexts.filter(c => c.state === 'completed').length,\\n      abandonedContexts: contexts.filter(c => c.state === 'abandoned').length,\\n      totalTurns: contexts.reduce((sum, c) => sum + c.turns.length, 0),\\n      averageTurnsPerSession: contexts.length > 0\\n        ? contexts.reduce((sum, c) => sum + c.turns.length, 0) / contexts.length\\n        : 0\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DialogueFlow {\\n  name: string;\\n  steps: DialogueFlowStep[];\\n  completionActions: DialogueAction[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DialogueFlowStep {\\n  step: number;\\n  intent: string;\\n  requiredSlots: string[];\\n  prompts: string[];\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":13143,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647818424}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/yyc3-Mobile-Intelligent-AI-System/core/nlp/NLPSystem.ts": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":157,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":157,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from \\\\'events\\\\';\\\\nimport { SemanticUnderstandingEngine, SemanticAnalysis } from \\\\'./semantic-understanding/SemanticUnderstandingEngine\\\\';\\\\nimport { DialogueManager, DialogueResponse } from \\\\'./dialogue/DialogueManager\\\\';\\\\n\\\\nexport interface NLPSConfig {\\\\n  enableSemanticAnalysis?: boolean;\\\\n  enableDialogueManagement?: boolean;\\\\n  defaultLanguage?: string;\\\\n  confidenceThreshold?: number;\\\\n  maxDialogueTurns?: number;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport class NLPSystem extends EventEmitter {\\\\n  private semanticEngine: SemanticUnderstandingEngine;\\\\n  private dialogueManager: DialogueManager;\\\\n  private config: NLPSConfig;\\\\n  private isRunning: boolean = false;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(config: NLPSConfig = {}) {\\\\n    super();\\\\n    this.config = {\\\\n      enableSemanticAnalysis: true,\\\\n      enableDialogueManagement: true,\\\\n      defaultLanguage: \\\\'zh\\\\',\\\\n      confidenceThreshold: 0.6,\\\\n      maxDialogueTurns: 20,\\\\n      ...config\\\\n    };\\\\n\\\\n    this.semanticEngine = new SemanticUnderstandingEngine();\\\\n    this.dialogueManager = new DialogueManager(this.semanticEngine);\\\\n\\\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\\\n    this.semanticEngine.on(\\\\'analysis_completed\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'semantic_analysis_completed\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.semanticEngine.on(\\\\'analysis_error\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'semantic_analysis_error\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.dialogueManager.on(\\\\'dialogue_processed\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_processed\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.dialogueManager.on(\\\\'dialogue_completed\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_completed\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n\\\\n    this.dialogueManager.on(\\\\'dialogue_error\\\\', (data) => {\\\\n      this.emit(\\\\'dialogue_error\\\\', data);\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async start(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (this.isRunning) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.isRunning = true;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'system_started\\\\', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async stop(): Promise<void> {\\\\n    if (!this.isRunning) {\\\\n      return;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    this.isRunning = false;\\\\n    this.emit(\\\\'system_stopped\\\\', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async analyzeText(text: string, options?: {\\\\n    language?: string;\\\\n    context?: Record<string, any>;\\\\n    userId?: string;\\\\n    sessionId?: string;\\\\n  }): Promise<SemanticAnalysis> {\\\\n    if (!this.config.enableSemanticAnalysis) {\\\\n      throw new Error(\\\\'Semantic analysis is disabled\\\\');\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return await this.semanticEngine.analyze({\\\\n      text,\\\\n      language: options?.language || this.config.defaultLanguage,\\\\n      context: options?.context,\\\\n      userId: options?.userId,\\\\n      sessionId: options?.sessionId\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async processDialogue(\\\\n    userId: string,\\\\n    sessionId: string,\\\\n    input: string,\\\\n    context?: Record<string, any>\\\\n  ): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\\\n    if (!this.config.enableDialogueManagement) {\\\\n      throw new Error(\\\\'Dialogue management is disabled\\\\');\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    return await this.dialogueManager.processDialogue(userId, sessionId, input, context);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async confirmDialogueAction(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\\\n    return await this.dialogueManager.confirmAction(userId, sessionId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async cancelDialogue(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.dialogueManager.cancelDialogue(userId, sessionId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getDialogueContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): any {\\\\n    return this.dialogueManager.getContext(userId, sessionId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getAllDialogueContexts(userId?: string): any[] {\\\\n    return this.dialogueManager.getAllContexts(userId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async clearDialogueContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.dialogueManager.clearContext(userId, sessionId);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSemanticModel(modelName: string): any {\\\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getModel(modelName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSemanticModels(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getModels();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getIntent(intentName: string): any {\\\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getIntent(intentName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getIntents(): any[] {\\\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getIntents();\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addCustomIntent(intent: any): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.semanticEngine.addCustomIntent(intent);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async removeIntent(intentName: string): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.semanticEngine.removeIntent(intentName);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addEntityType(type: string, patterns: string[]): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.semanticEngine.addEntityType(type, patterns);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addSentimentWord(word: string, score: number): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.semanticEngine.addSentimentWord(word, score);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addResponseTemplate(intent: string, templates: string[]): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.dialogueManager.addResponseTemplate(intent, templates);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async addDialogueFlow(flow: any): Promise<void> {\\\\n    await this.dialogueManager.addDialogueFlow(flow);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\\\n    isRunning: boolean;\\\\n    config: NLPSConfig;\\\\n    semanticModels: number;\\\\n    intents: number;\\\\n    dialogueContexts: number;\\\\n    dialogueStatistics: any;\\\\n  } {\\\\n    return {\\\\n      isRunning: this.isRunning,\\\\n      config: this.config,\\\\n      semanticModels: this.semanticEngine.getModels().length,\\\\n      intents: this.semanticEngine.getIntents().length,\\\\n      dialogueContexts: this.dialogueManager.getAllContexts().length,\\\\n      dialogueStatistics: this.dialogueManager.getDialogueStatistics()\\\\n    };\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getSemanticEngine(): SemanticUnderstandingEngine {\\\\n    return this.semanticEngine;\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  getDialogueManager(): DialogueManager {\\\\n    return this.dialogueManager;\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"import { EventEmitter } from 'events';\\nimport { SemanticUnderstandingEngine, SemanticAnalysis } from './semantic-understanding/SemanticUnderstandingEngine';\\nimport { DialogueManager, DialogueResponse } from './dialogue/DialogueManager';\\n\\nexport interface NLPSConfig {\\n  enableSemanticAnalysis?: boolean;\\n  enableDialogueManagement?: boolean;\\n  defaultLanguage?: string;\\n  confidenceThreshold?: number;\\n  maxDialogueTurns?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport class NLPSystem extends EventEmitter {\\n  private semanticEngine: SemanticUnderstandingEngine;\\n  private dialogueManager: DialogueManager;\\n  private config: NLPSConfig;\\n  private isRunning: boolean = false;\\n\\n  constructor(config: NLPSConfig = {}) {\\n    super();\\n    this.config = {\\n      enableSemanticAnalysis: true,\\n      enableDialogueManagement: true,\\n      defaultLanguage: 'zh',\\n      confidenceThreshold: 0.6,\\n      maxDialogueTurns: 20,\\n      ...config\\n    };\\n\\n    this.semanticEngine = new SemanticUnderstandingEngine();\\n    this.dialogueManager = new DialogueManager(this.semanticEngine);\\n\\n    this.setupEventListeners();\\n  }\\n\\n  private setupEventListeners(): void {\\n    this.semanticEngine.on('analysis_completed', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('semantic_analysis_completed', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.semanticEngine.on('analysis_error', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('semantic_analysis_error', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.dialogueManager.on('dialogue_processed', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('dialogue_processed', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.dialogueManager.on('dialogue_completed', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('dialogue_completed', data);\\n    });\\n\\n    this.dialogueManager.on('dialogue_error', (data) => {\\n      this.emit('dialogue_error', data);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async start(): Promise<void> {\\n    if (this.isRunning) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    this.isRunning = true;\\n    this.emit('system_started', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  async stop(): Promise<void> {\\n    if (!this.isRunning) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    this.isRunning = false;\\n    this.emit('system_stopped', { timestamp: Date.now() });\\n  }\\n\\n  async analyzeText(text: string, options?: {\\n    language?: string;\\n    context?: Record<string, any>;\\n    userId?: string;\\n    sessionId?: string;\\n  }): Promise<SemanticAnalysis> {\\n    if (!this.config.enableSemanticAnalysis) {\\n      throw new Error('Semantic analysis is disabled');\\n    }\\n\\n    return await this.semanticEngine.analyze({\\n      text,\\n      language: options?.language || this.config.defaultLanguage,\\n      context: options?.context,\\n      userId: options?.userId,\\n      sessionId: options?.sessionId\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  async processDialogue(\\n    userId: string,\\n    sessionId: string,\\n    input: string,\\n    context?: Record<string, any>\\n  ): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\n    if (!this.config.enableDialogueManagement) {\\n      throw new Error('Dialogue management is disabled');\\n    }\\n\\n    return await this.dialogueManager.processDialogue(userId, sessionId, input, context);\\n  }\\n\\n  async confirmDialogueAction(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<DialogueResponse> {\\n    return await this.dialogueManager.confirmAction(userId, sessionId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async cancelDialogue(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.dialogueManager.cancelDialogue(userId, sessionId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getDialogueContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): any {\\n    return this.dialogueManager.getContext(userId, sessionId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getAllDialogueContexts(userId?: string): any[] {\\n    return this.dialogueManager.getAllContexts(userId);\\n  }\\n\\n  async clearDialogueContext(userId: string, sessionId: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.dialogueManager.clearContext(userId, sessionId);\\n  }\\n\\n  getSemanticModel(modelName: string): any {\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getModel(modelName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getSemanticModels(): any[] {\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getModels();\\n  }\\n\\n  getIntent(intentName: string): any {\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getIntent(intentName);\\n  }\\n\\n  getIntents(): any[] {\\n    return this.semanticEngine.getIntents();\\n  }\\n\\n  async addCustomIntent(intent: any): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.semanticEngine.addCustomIntent(intent);\\n  }\\n\\n  async removeIntent(intentName: string): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.semanticEngine.removeIntent(intentName);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addEntityType(type: string, patterns: string[]): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.semanticEngine.addEntityType(type, patterns);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addSentimentWord(word: string, score: number): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.semanticEngine.addSentimentWord(word, score);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addResponseTemplate(intent: string, templates: string[]): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.dialogueManager.addResponseTemplate(intent, templates);\\n  }\\n\\n  async addDialogueFlow(flow: any): Promise<void> {\\n    await this.dialogueManager.addDialogueFlow(flow);\\n  }\\n\\n  getSystemStatus(): {\\n    isRunning: boolean;\\n    config: NLPSConfig;\\n    semanticModels: number;\\n    intents: number;\\n    dialogueContexts: number;\\n    dialogueStatistics: any;\\n  } {\\n    return {\\n      isRunning: this.isRunning,\\n      config: this.config,\\n      semanticModels: this.semanticEngine.getModels().length,\\n      intents: this.semanticEngine.getIntents().length,\\n      dialogueContexts: this.dialogueManager.getAllContexts().length,\\n      dialogueStatistics: this.dialogueManager.getDialogueStatistics()\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  getSemanticEngine(): SemanticUnderstandingEngine {\\n    return this.semanticEngine;\\n  }\\n\\n  getDialogueManager(): DialogueManager {\\n    return this.dialogueManager;\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"originTextLength\":5482,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767647834480}]",
