:14}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":402,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":402,\"character\":14}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 边缘智能架构性能指标\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 边缘智能架构性能指标\",\"originTextLength\":14,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861345},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":405,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":440,\"character\":41}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":405,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":440,\"character\":41}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 边缘智能架构 - 五高性能指标\\\\nconst edgeIntelligencePerformance = {\\\\n  // 高性能指标\\\\n  performance: {\\\\n    inferenceLatency: \\\\'≤ 10ms\\\\', // 推理延迟\\\\n    throughput: \\\\'≥ 1000 req/s\\\\', // 吞吐量\\\\n    modelAccuracy: \\\\'≥ 92.0%\\\\', // 模型准确率\\\\n    responseTime: \\\\'≤ 50ms\\\\' // 响应时间\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 高可靠指标\\\\n  reliability: {\\\\n    serviceAvailability: \\\\'≥ 99.95%\\\\', // 服务可用性\\\\n    faultTolerance: \\\\'≥ 90%节点故障容忍\\\\', // 容错能力\\\\n    dataConsistency: \\\\'≥ 99.5%\\\\', // 数据一致性\\\\n    recoveryTime: \\\\'≤ 30秒\\\\' // 恢复时间\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 高安全指标\\\\n  security: {\\\\n    edgeSecurity: \\\\'端到端加密\\\\', // 边缘安全\\\\n    dataProtection: \\\\'≥ 99.99%\\\\', // 数据保护\\\\n    accessControl: \\\\'基于角色的访问控制\\\\', // 访问控制\\\\n    threatDetection: \\\\'实时威胁检测\\\\' // 威胁检测\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 高扩展指标\\\\n  scalability: {\\\\n    nodeCount: \\\\'支持10^4边缘节点\\\\', // 节点数量\\\\n    deviceCount: \\\\'支持10^6设备\\\\', // 设备数量\\\\n    networkScale: \\\\'支持广域网部署\\\\', // 网络规模\\\\n    serviceScale: \\\\'支持100+服务\\\\' // 服务规模\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 高效率指标\\\\n  efficiency: {\\\\n    energyEfficiency: \\\\'≤ 0.01kWh/推理\\\\', // 能效比\\\\n    bandwidthEfficiency: \\\\'≥ 90%压缩率\\\\', // 带宽效率\\\\n    storageEfficiency: \\\\'≤ 100MB/模型\\\\', // 存储效率\\\\n    resourceUtilization: \\\\'≥ 80%\\\\' // 资源利用率\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 边缘智能架构 - 五高性能指标\\nconst edgeIntelligencePerformance = {\\n  // 高性能指标\\n  performance: {\\n    inferenceLatency: '≤ 10ms', // 推理延迟\\n    throughput: '≥ 1000 req/s', // 吞吐量\\n    modelAccuracy: '≥ 92.0%', // 模型准确率\\n    responseTime: '≤ 50ms' // 响应时间\\n  },\\n\\n  // 高可靠指标\\n  reliability: {\\n    serviceAvailability: '≥ 99.95%', // 服务可用性\\n    faultTolerance: '≥ 90%节点故障容忍', // 容错能力\\n    dataConsistency: '≥ 99.5%', // 数据一致性\\n    recoveryTime: '≤ 30秒' // 恢复时间\\n  },\\n\\n  // 高安全指标\\n  security: {\\n    edgeSecurity: '端到端加密', // 边缘安全\\n    dataProtection: '≥ 99.99%', // 数据保护\\n    accessControl: '基于角色的访问控制', // 访问控制\\n    threatDetection: '实时威胁检测' // 威胁检测\\n  },\\n\\n  // 高扩展指标\\n  scalability: {\\n    nodeCount: '支持10^4边缘节点', // 节点数量\\n    deviceCount: '支持10^6设备', // 设备数量\\n    networkScale: '支持广域网部署', // 网络规模\\n    serviceScale: '支持100+服务' // 服务规模\\n  },\\n\\n  // 高效率指标\\n  efficiency: {\\n    energyEfficiency: '≤ 0.01kWh/推理', // 能效比\\n    bandwidthEfficiency: '≥ 90%压缩率', // 带宽效率\\n    storageEfficiency: '≤ 100MB/模型', // 存储效率\\n    resourceUtilization: '≥ 80%' // 资源利用率\",\"originTextLength\":1011,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861356},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":612,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":612,\"character\":2}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":612,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":612,\"character\":2}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"};\",\"originAcceptText\":\"};\",\"originTextLength\":2,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861367},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":615,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":616,\"character\":15}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":615,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":616,\"character\":15}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"## 🚀 优化策略\\\\n\\\\n### 量子启发式算法优化策略\",\"originAcceptText\":\"## 🚀 优化策略\\n\\n### 量子启发式算法优化策略\",\"originTextLength\":27,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861381},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":618,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":654,\"character\":28}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":618,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":654,\"character\":28}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 量子启发式算法 - 五高优化策略\\\\nconst quantumAlgorithmsOptimization = {\\\\n  // 1. 并行处理优化\\\\n  parallelProcessing: {\\\\n    strategy: \\\\'quantum_parallel\\\\',\\\\n    parallelism: 64, // 并行度\\\\n    taskPartitioning: \\\\'quantum_superposition\\\\', // 量子任务划分\\\\n    loadBalancing: \\\\'dynamic\\\\', // 动态负载均衡\\\\n    synchronization: \\\\'quantum_entanglement\\\\' // 量子同步\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 内存优化\\\\n  memoryOptimization: {\\\\n    quantumStateCompression: true, // 量子态压缩\\\\n    sparseRepresentation: true, // 稀疏表示\\\\n    memoryMapping: true, // 内存映射\\\\n    garbageCollection: \\\\'aggressive\\\\' // 激进的垃圾回收\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 计算优化\\\\n  computationOptimization: {\\\\n    quantumGateOptimization: true, // 量子门优化\\\\n    circuitDepthReduction: true, // 电路深度减少\\\\n    quantumErrorCorrection: true, // 量子错误纠正\\\\n    noiseMitigation: true // 噪声缓解\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 收敛优化\\\\n  convergenceOptimization: {\\\\n    adaptiveParameters: true, // 自适应参数\\\\n    multiObjectiveOptimization: true, // 多目标优化\\\\n    landscapeAnalysis: true, // 景观分析\\\\n    escapeMechanism: \\\\'quantum_tunneling\\\\' // 量子隧穿逃逸\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 缓存优化\\\\n  cacheOptimization: {\\\\n    quantumStateCache: true, // 量子态缓存\\\\n    intermediateResultCache: true, // 中间结果缓存\\\\n    solutionCache: true, // 解缓存\\\\n    cacheSize: \\\\'1GB\\\\' // 缓存大小\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 量子启发式算法 - 五高优化策略\\nconst quantumAlgorithmsOptimization = {\\n  // 1. 并行处理优化\\n  parallelProcessing: {\\n    strategy: 'quantum_parallel',\\n    parallelism: 64, // 并行度\\n    taskPartitioning: 'quantum_superposition', // 量子任务划分\\n    loadBalancing: 'dynamic', // 动态负载均衡\\n    synchronization: 'quantum_entanglement' // 量子同步\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 内存优化\\n  memoryOptimization: {\\n    quantumStateCompression: true, // 量子态压缩\\n    sparseRepresentation: true, // 稀疏表示\\n    memoryMapping: true, // 内存映射\\n    garbageCollection: 'aggressive' // 激进的垃圾回收\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 计算优化\\n  computationOptimization: {\\n    quantumGateOptimization: true, // 量子门优化\\n    circuitDepthReduction: true, // 电路深度减少\\n    quantumErrorCorrection: true, // 量子错误纠正\\n    noiseMitigation: true // 噪声缓解\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 收敛优化\\n  convergenceOptimization: {\\n    adaptiveParameters: true, // 自适应参数\\n    multiObjectiveOptimization: true, // 多目标优化\\n    landscapeAnalysis: true, // 景观分析\\n    escapeMechanism: 'quantum_tunneling' // 量子隧穿逃逸\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 缓存优化\\n  cacheOptimization: {\\n    quantumStateCache: true, // 量子态缓存\\n    intermediateResultCache: true, // 中间结果缓存\\n    solutionCache: true, // 解缓存\\n    cacheSize: '1GB' // 缓存大小\",\"originTextLength\":1137,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861392},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":893,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":893,\"character\":2}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":893,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":893,\"character\":2}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"};\",\"originAcceptText\":\"};\",\"originTextLength\":2,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861403},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":895,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":895,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":895,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":895,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"\",\"originAcceptText\":\"\",\"originTextLength\":0,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861414},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":898,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":898,\"character\":14}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":898,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":898,\"character\":14}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 联邦学习系统优化策略\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 联邦学习系统优化策略\",\"originTextLength\":14,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861432},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":901,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":936,\"character\":31}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":901,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":936,\"character\":31}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 联邦学习系统 - 五高优化策略\\\\nconst federatedLearningOptimization = {\\\\n  // 1. 通信优化\\\\n  communicationOptimization: {\\\\n    gradientCompression: \\\\'sparsification\\\\', // 梯度稀疏化\\\\n    quantization: \\\\'8bit\\\\', // 量化\\\\n    differentialPrivacy: \\\\'local_dp\\\\', // 本地差分隐私\\\\n    secureAggregation: \\\\'homomorphic\\\\' // 同态加密聚合\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 计算优化\\\\n  computationOptimization: {\\\\n    localTraining: \\\\'parallel\\\\', // 并行本地训练\\\\n    modelCompression: \\\\'pruning\\\\', // 模型剪枝\\\\n    knowledgeDistillation: true, // 知识蒸馏\\\\n    earlyStopping: true // 早停\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 聚合优化\\\\n  aggregationOptimization: {\\\\n    weightedAveraging: true, // 加权平均\\\\n    personalizedAggregation: true, // 个性化聚合\\\\n    robustAggregation: \\\\'byzantine_resistant\\\\', // 拜占庭容错聚合\\\\n    adaptiveAggregation: true // 自适应聚合\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 收敛优化\\\\n  convergenceOptimization: {\\\\n    learningRateSchedule: \\\\'cosine_decay\\\\', // 余弦退火学习率\\\\n    momentum: true, // 动量\\\\n    adaptiveLearning: true, // 自适应学习\\\\n    multiRoundLearning: true // 多轮学习\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 资源优化\\\\n  resourceOptimization: {\\\\n    clientSelection: \\\\'importance_sampling\\\\', // 重要性采样\\\\n    bandwidthAllocation: \\\\'dynamic\\\\', // 动态带宽分配\\\\n    energyEfficiency: true, // 能效优化\\\\n    loadBalancing: true // 负载均衡\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 联邦学习系统 - 五高优化策略\\nconst federatedLearningOptimization = {\\n  // 1. 通信优化\\n  communicationOptimization: {\\n    gradientCompression: 'sparsification', // 梯度稀疏化\\n    quantization: '8bit', // 量化\\n    differentialPrivacy: 'local_dp', // 本地差分隐私\\n    secureAggregation: 'homomorphic' // 同态加密聚合\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 计算优化\\n  computationOptimization: {\\n    localTraining: 'parallel', // 并行本地训练\\n    modelCompression: 'pruning', // 模型剪枝\\n    knowledgeDistillation: true, // 知识蒸馏\\n    earlyStopping: true // 早停\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 聚合优化\\n  aggregationOptimization: {\\n    weightedAveraging: true, // 加权平均\\n    personalizedAggregation: true, // 个性化聚合\\n    robustAggregation: 'byzantine_resistant', // 拜占庭容错聚合\\n    adaptiveAggregation: true // 自适应聚合\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 收敛优化\\n  convergenceOptimization: {\\n    learningRateSchedule: 'cosine_decay', // 余弦退火学习率\\n    momentum: true, // 动量\\n    adaptiveLearning: true, // 自适应学习\\n    multiRoundLearning: true // 多轮学习\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 资源优化\\n  resourceOptimization: {\\n    clientSelection: 'importance_sampling', // 重要性采样\\n    bandwidthAllocation: 'dynamic', // 动态带宽分配\\n    energyEfficiency: true, // 能效优化\\n    loadBalancing: true // 负载均衡\",\"originTextLength\":1119,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861443},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1159,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1159,\"character\":2}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1159,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1159,\"character\":2}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"};\",\"originAcceptText\":\"};\",\"originTextLength\":2,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861454},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1162,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1162,\"character\":14}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1162,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1162,\"character\":14}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 边缘智能架构优化策略\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 边缘智能架构优化策略\",\"originTextLength\":14,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861465},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1165,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1200,\"character\":35}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1165,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1200,\"character\":35}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 边缘智能架构 - 五高优化策略\\\\nconst edgeIntelligenceOptimization = {\\\\n  // 1. 推理优化\\\\n  inferenceOptimization: {\\\\n    modelQuantization: \\\\'int8\\\\', // int8量化\\\\n    modelPruning: \\\\'structured\\\\', // 结构化剪枝\\\\n    knowledgeDistillation: true, // 知识蒸馏\\\\n    hardwareAcceleration: \\\\'edge_tpu\\\\' // 边缘TPU加速\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 通信优化\\\\n  communicationOptimization: {\\\\n    edgeCloudCollaboration: \\\\'hierarchical\\\\', // 分层边缘云协同\\\\n    dataCompression: \\\\'lossless\\\\', // 无损压缩\\\\n    adaptiveTransmission: true, // 自适应传输\\\\n    bandwidthOptimization: true // 带宽优化\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 资源优化\\\\n  resourceOptimization: {\\\\n    resourceScheduling: \\\\'priority_based\\\\', // 基于优先级的资源调度\\\\n    loadBalancing: \\\\'dynamic\\\\', // 动态负载均衡\\\\n    energyManagement: \\\\'dvfs\\\\', // 动态电压频率调节\\\\n    storageOptimization: true // 存储优化\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 协同优化\\\\n  collaborationOptimization: {\\\\n    federatedLearning: \\\\'edge_fl\\\\', // 边缘联邦学习\\\\n    modelSharing: \\\\'peer_to_peer\\\\', // 点对点模型共享\\\\n    taskOffloading: \\\\'intelligent\\\\', // 智能任务卸载\\\\n    distributedInference: true // 分布式推理\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 缓存优化\\\\n  cacheOptimization: {\\\\n    modelCache: true, // 模型缓存\\\\n    dataCache: true, // 数据缓存\\\\n    resultCache: true, // 结果缓存\\\\n    cacheEviction: \\\\'lru\\\\' // LRU缓存淘汰\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 边缘智能架构 - 五高优化策略\\nconst edgeIntelligenceOptimization = {\\n  // 1. 推理优化\\n  inferenceOptimization: {\\n    modelQuantization: 'int8', // int8量化\\n    modelPruning: 'structured', // 结构化剪枝\\n    knowledgeDistillation: true, // 知识蒸馏\\n    hardwareAcceleration: 'edge_tpu' // 边缘TPU加速\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 通信优化\\n  communicationOptimization: {\\n    edgeCloudCollaboration: 'hierarchical', // 分层边缘云协同\\n    dataCompression: 'lossless', // 无损压缩\\n    adaptiveTransmission: true, // 自适应传输\\n    bandwidthOptimization: true // 带宽优化\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 资源优化\\n  resourceOptimization: {\\n    resourceScheduling: 'priority_based', // 基于优先级的资源调度\\n    loadBalancing: 'dynamic', // 动态负载均衡\\n    energyManagement: 'dvfs', // 动态电压频率调节\\n    storageOptimization: true // 存储优化\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 协同优化\\n  collaborationOptimization: {\\n    federatedLearning: 'edge_fl', // 边缘联邦学习\\n    modelSharing: 'peer_to_peer', // 点对点模型共享\\n    taskOffloading: 'intelligent', // 智能任务卸载\\n    distributedInference: true // 分布式推理\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 缓存优化\\n  cacheOptimization: {\\n    modelCache: true, // 模型缓存\\n    dataCache: true, // 数据缓存\\n    resultCache: true, // 结果缓存\\n    cacheEviction: 'lru' // LRU缓存淘汰\",\"originTextLength\":1108,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861476},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1426,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1426,\"character\":2}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1426,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1426,\"character\":2}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"};\",\"originAcceptText\":\"};\",\"originTextLength\":2,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861486},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1429,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1429,\"character\":12}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1429,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1429,\"character\":12}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"## 🛡️ 可靠性保障\",\"originAcceptText\":\"## 🛡️ 可靠性保障\",\"originTextLength\":12,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861497},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1431,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1431,\"character\":16}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1431,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1431,\"character\":16}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 量子启发式算法可靠性保障\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 量子启发式算法可靠性保障\",\"originTextLength\":16,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861508},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1434,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1469,\"character\":48}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1434,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1469,\"character\":48}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 量子启发式算法 - 五高可靠性保障\\\\nconst quantumAlgorithmsReliability = {\\\\n  // 1. 错误处理\\\\n  errorHandling: {\\\\n    quantumErrorCorrection: \\\\'surface_code\\\\', // 表面码纠错\\\\n    noiseMitigation: \\\\'zero_noise_extrapolation\\\\', // 零噪声外推\\\\n    faultDetection: \\\\'syndrome_measurement\\\\', // 综合测量\\\\n    errorRecovery: \\\\'automatic\\\\' // 自动错误恢复\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 容错机制\\\\n  faultTolerance: {\\\\n    logicalQubits: \\\\'physical_to_logical_ratio_10:1\\\\', // 物理到逻辑量子比特比例\\\\n    errorThreshold: \\\\'≤ 1%\\\\', // 错误阈值\\\\n    redundancy: \\\\'quantum_redundancy\\\\', // 量子冗余\\\\n    recoveryPoint: \\\\'checkpoint\\\\' // 检查点恢复\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 监控机制\\\\n  monitoring: {\\\\n    quantumStateMonitoring: \\\\'real_time\\\\', // 实时量子态监控\\\\n    performanceMonitoring: \\\\'continuous\\\\', // 持续性能监控\\\\n    errorRateMonitoring: \\\\'threshold_based\\\\', // 基于阈值的错误率监控\\\\n    resourceMonitoring: \\\\'comprehensive\\\\' // 全面资源监控\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 恢复机制\\\\n  recovery: {\\\\n    automaticRecovery: true, // 自动恢复\\\\n    manualRecovery: \\\\'guided\\\\', // 引导式手动恢复\\\\n    stateRestoration: \\\\'quantum_state_restoration\\\\', // 量子态恢复\\\\n    rollback: \\\\'versioned\\\\' // 版本化回滚\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 验证机制\\\\n  validation: {\\\\n    solutionValidation: \\\\'multi_criteria\\\\', // 多准则解验证\\\\n    convergenceValidation: \\\\'mathematical\\\\', // 数学收敛验证\\\\n    qualityValidation: \\\\'statistical\\\\', // 统计质量验证\\\\n    consistencyValidation: \\\\'cross_check\\\\' // 交叉检查\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 量子启发式算法 - 五高可靠性保障\\nconst quantumAlgorithmsReliability = {\\n  // 1. 错误处理\\n  errorHandling: {\\n    quantumErrorCorrection: 'surface_code', // 表面码纠错\\n    noiseMitigation: 'zero_noise_extrapolation', // 零噪声外推\\n    faultDetection: 'syndrome_measurement', // 综合测量\\n    errorRecovery: 'automatic' // 自动错误恢复\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 容错机制\\n  faultTolerance: {\\n    logicalQubits: 'physical_to_logical_ratio_10:1', // 物理到逻辑量子比特比例\\n    errorThreshold: '≤ 1%', // 错误阈值\\n    redundancy: 'quantum_redundancy', // 量子冗余\\n    recoveryPoint: 'checkpoint' // 检查点恢复\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 监控机制\\n  monitoring: {\\n    quantumStateMonitoring: 'real_time', // 实时量子态监控\\n    performanceMonitoring: 'continuous', // 持续性能监控\\n    errorRateMonitoring: 'threshold_based', // 基于阈值的错误率监控\\n    resourceMonitoring: 'comprehensive' // 全面资源监控\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 恢复机制\\n  recovery: {\\n    automaticRecovery: true, // 自动恢复\\n    manualRecovery: 'guided', // 引导式手动恢复\\n    stateRestoration: 'quantum_state_restoration', // 量子态恢复\\n    rollback: 'versioned' // 版本化回滚\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 验证机制\\n  validation: {\\n    solutionValidation: 'multi_criteria', // 多准则解验证\\n    convergenceValidation: 'mathematical', // 数学收敛验证\\n    qualityValidation: 'statistical', // 统计质量验证\\n    consistencyValidation: 'cross_check' // 交叉检查\",\"originTextLength\":1214,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861519},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1705,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1705,\"character\":2}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1705,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1705,\"character\":2}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"};\",\"originAcceptText\":\"};\",\"originTextLength\":2,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861530},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1708,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1708,\"character\":15}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1708,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1708,\"character\":15}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 联邦学习系统可靠性保障\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 联邦学习系统可靠性保障\",\"originTextLength\":15,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861541},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1711,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1746,\"character\":46}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1711,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1746,\"character\":46}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 联邦学习系统 - 五高可靠性保障\\\\nconst federatedLearningReliability = {\\\\n  // 1. 错误处理\\\\n  errorHandling: {\\\\n    clientFailure: \\\\'graceful_degradation\\\\', // 优雅降级\\\\n    networkPartition: \\\\'eventual_consistency\\\\', // 最终一致性\\\\n    maliciousClient: \\\\'byzantine_resilience\\\\', // 拜占庭容错\\\\n    dataPoisoning: \\\\'robust_aggregation\\\\' // 鲁棒聚合\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 容错机制\\\\n  faultTolerance: {\\\\n    clientRedundancy: \\\\'3x_replication\\\\', // 3倍复制\\\\n    modelCheckpoint: \\\\'periodic\\\\', // 周期性检查点\\\\n    dataBackup: \\\\'distributed\\\\', // 分布式备份\\\\n    recoveryTime: \\\\'≤ 5分钟\\\\' // 恢复时间\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 监控机制\\\\n  monitoring: {\\\\n    clientHealth: \\\\'heartbeat\\\\', // 心跳监控\\\\n    modelPerformance: \\\\'continuous\\\\', // 持续模型性能监控\\\\n    communicationQuality: \\\\'qos_monitoring\\\\', // QoS监控\\\\n    securityMonitoring: \\\\'anomaly_detection\\\\' // 异常检测\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 恢复机制\\\\n  recovery: {\\\\n    automaticRecovery: true, // 自动恢复\\\\n    clientReconnection: \\\\'automatic\\\\', // 自动客户端重连\\\\n    modelResynchronization: \\\\'incremental\\\\', // 增量模型重新同步\\\\n    dataRecovery: \\\\'versioned\\\\' // 版本化数据恢复\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 验证机制\\\\n  validation: {\\\\n    modelValidation: \\\\'cross_validation\\\\', // 交叉验证\\\\n    dataValidation: \\\\'quality_check\\\\', // 数据质量检查\\\\n    clientValidation: \\\\'reputation_system\\\\', // 声誉系统\\\\n    aggregationValidation: \\\\'consensus\\\\' // 共识验证\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 联邦学习系统 - 五高可靠性保障\\nconst federatedLearningReliability = {\\n  // 1. 错误处理\\n  errorHandling: {\\n    clientFailure: 'graceful_degradation', // 优雅降级\\n    networkPartition: 'eventual_consistency', // 最终一致性\\n    maliciousClient: 'byzantine_resilience', // 拜占庭容错\\n    dataPoisoning: 'robust_aggregation' // 鲁棒聚合\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 容错机制\\n  faultTolerance: {\\n    clientRedundancy: '3x_replication', // 3倍复制\\n    modelCheckpoint: 'periodic', // 周期性检查点\\n    dataBackup: 'distributed', // 分布式备份\\n    recoveryTime: '≤ 5分钟' // 恢复时间\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 监控机制\\n  monitoring: {\\n    clientHealth: 'heartbeat', // 心跳监控\\n    modelPerformance: 'continuous', // 持续模型性能监控\\n    communicationQuality: 'qos_monitoring', // QoS监控\\n    securityMonitoring: 'anomaly_detection' // 异常检测\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 恢复机制\\n  recovery: {\\n    automaticRecovery: true, // 自动恢复\\n    clientReconnection: 'automatic', // 自动客户端重连\\n    modelResynchronization: 'incremental', // 增量模型重新同步\\n    dataRecovery: 'versioned' // 版本化数据恢复\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 验证机制\\n  validation: {\\n    modelValidation: 'cross_validation', // 交叉验证\\n    dataValidation: 'quality_check', // 数据质量检查\\n    clientValidation: 'reputation_system', // 声誉系统\\n    aggregationValidation: 'consensus' // 共识验证\",\"originTextLength\":1172,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861551},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2186,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2186,\"character\":2}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2186,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2186,\"character\":2}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"};\",\"originAcceptText\":\"};\",\"originTextLength\":2,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861562},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2188,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2188,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2188,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2188,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"\",\"originAcceptText\":\"\",\"originTextLength\":0,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861580},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2191,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2191,\"character\":15}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2191,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2191,\"character\":15}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 边缘智能架构可靠性保障\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 边缘智能架构可靠性保障\",\"originTextLength\":15,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861591},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2194,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2258,\"character\":27}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2194,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2258,\"character\":27}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 边缘智能架构 - 五高可靠性保障\\\\nconst edgeIntelligenceReliability = {\\\\n  // 1. 错误处理\\\\n  errorHandling: {\\\\n    nodeFailure: \\\\'failover\\\\', // 故障转移\\\\n    networkFailure: \\\\'offline_mode\\\\', // 离线模式\\\\n    modelFailure: \\\\'fallback_model\\\\', // 回退模型\\\\n    dataFailure: \\\\'local_cache\\\\' // 本地缓存\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 容错机制\\\\n  faultTolerance: {\\\\n    nodeRedundancy: \\\\'2x_replication\\\\', // 2倍复制\\\\n    modelRedundancy: \\\\'multi_version\\\\', // 多版本模型\\\\n    dataRedundancy: \\\\'erasure_coding\\\\', // 纠删码\\\\n    recoveryTime: \\\\'≤ 30秒\\\\' // 恢复时间\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 监控机制\\\\n  monitoring: {\\\\n    nodeHealth: \\\\'real_time\\\\', // 实时节点健康监控\\\\n    serviceHealth: \\\\'health_check\\\\', // 健康检查\\\\n    resourceUsage: \\\\'continuous\\\\', // 持续资源使用监控\\\\n    performanceMetrics: \\\\'dashboard\\\\' // 性能指标仪表板\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 恢复机制\\\\n  recovery: {\\\\n    automaticRecovery: true, // 自动恢复\\\\n    nodeRecovery: \\\\'auto_rejoin\\\\', // 自动节点重新加入\\\\n    modelRecovery: \\\\'cloud_sync\\\\', // 云端同步恢复\\\\n    dataRecovery: \\\\'peer_sync\\\\' // 对等同步恢复\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 验证机制\\\\n  validation: {\\\\n    modelValidation: \\\\'a_b_testing\\\\', // A/B测试\\\\n    dataValidation: \\\\'integrity_check\\\\', // 完整性检查\\\\n    serviceValidation: \\\\'smoke_test\\\\', // 冒烟测试\\\\n    performanceValidation: \\\\'benchmark\\\\' // 基准测试\\\\n  }\\\\n};\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 🎯 技术融合实现框架\\\\n\\\\n### 量子经典融合实现\\\\n\\\\n```typescript\\\\n// 量子经典融合 - 五高实现\\\\nexport class QuantumClassicalFusion {\\\\n  private readonly quantumProcessor: QuantumProcessor;\\\\n  private readonly classicalProcessor: ClassicalProcessor;\\\\n  private readonly fusionOrchestrator: FusionOrchestrator;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(config: FusionConfig) {\\\\n    this.quantumProcessor = new QuantumProcessor(config.quantum);\\\\n    this.classicalProcessor = new ClassicalProcessor(config.classical);\\\\n    this.fusionOrchestrator = new FusionOrchestrator(config.fusion);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async hybridOptimization(problem: OptimizationProblem): Promise<OptimizationResult> {\\\\n    // 量子初始化\\\\n    const quantumState = await this.quantumProcessor.initialize(problem);\\\\n\\\\n    // 经典优化\\\\n    const classicalSolution = await this.classicalProcessor.optimize(problem);\\\\n\\\\n    // 量子增强\\\\n    const enhancedSolution = await this.quantumProcessor.enhance(\\\\n      classicalSolution,\\\\n      quantumState\\\\n    );\\\\n\\\\n    // 经典精细化\\\\n    const refinedSolution = await this.classicalProcessor.refine(enhancedSolution);\\\\n\\\\n    return refinedSolution;\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 边缘智能架构 - 五高可靠性保障\\nconst edgeIntelligenceReliability = {\\n  // 1. 错误处理\\n  errorHandling: {\\n    nodeFailure: 'failover', // 故障转移\\n    networkFailure: 'offline_mode', // 离线模式\\n    modelFailure: 'fallback_model', // 回退模型\\n    dataFailure: 'local_cache' // 本地缓存\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 容错机制\\n  faultTolerance: {\\n    nodeRedundancy: '2x_replication', // 2倍复制\\n    modelRedundancy: 'multi_version', // 多版本模型\\n    dataRedundancy: 'erasure_coding', // 纠删码\\n    recoveryTime: '≤ 30秒' // 恢复时间\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 监控机制\\n  monitoring: {\\n    nodeHealth: 'real_time', // 实时节点健康监控\\n    serviceHealth: 'health_check', // 健康检查\\n    resourceUsage: 'continuous', // 持续资源使用监控\\n    performanceMetrics: 'dashboard' // 性能指标仪表板\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 恢复机制\\n  recovery: {\\n    automaticRecovery: true, // 自动恢复\\n    nodeRecovery: 'auto_rejoin', // 自动节点重新加入\\n    modelRecovery: 'cloud_sync', // 云端同步恢复\\n    dataRecovery: 'peer_sync' // 对等同步恢复\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 验证机制\\n  validation: {\\n    modelValidation: 'a_b_testing', // A/B测试\\n    dataValidation: 'integrity_check', // 完整性检查\\n    serviceValidation: 'smoke_test', // 冒烟测试\\n    performanceValidation: 'benchmark' // 基准测试\\n  }\\n};\\n```\\n\\n## 🎯 技术融合实现框架\\n\\n### 量子经典融合实现\\n\\n```typescript\\n// 量子经典融合 - 五高实现\\nexport class QuantumClassicalFusion {\\n  private readonly quantumProcessor: QuantumProcessor;\\n  private readonly classicalProcessor: ClassicalProcessor;\\n  private readonly fusionOrchestrator: FusionOrchestrator;\\n\\n  constructor(config: FusionConfig) {\\n    this.quantumProcessor = new QuantumProcessor(config.quantum);\\n    this.classicalProcessor = new ClassicalProcessor(config.classical);\\n    this.fusionOrchestrator = new FusionOrchestrator(config.fusion);\\n  }\\n\\n  async hybridOptimization(problem: OptimizationProblem): Promise<OptimizationResult> {\\n    // 量子初始化\\n    const quantumState = await this.quantumProcessor.initialize(problem);\\n\\n    // 经典优化\\n    const classicalSolution = await this.classicalProcessor.optimize(problem);\\n\\n    // 量子增强\\n    const enhancedSolution = await this.quantumProcessor.enhance(\\n      classicalSolution,\\n      quantumState\\n    );\\n\\n    // 经典精细化\\n    const refinedSolution = await this.classicalProcessor.refine(enhancedSolution);\\n\\n    return refinedSolution;\",\"originTextLength\":2152,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861602},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2453,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2477,\"character\":25}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2453,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2477,\"character\":25}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 神经符号统一实现\\\\n\\\\n```typescript\\\\n// 神经符号统一 - 五高实现\\\\nexport class NeuroSymbolicUnified {\\\\n  private readonly neuralNetwork: NeuralNetwork;\\\\n  private readonly symbolicReasoner: SymbolicReasoner;\\\\n  private readonly integrationLayer: IntegrationLayer;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(config: NeuroSymbolicConfig) {\\\\n    this.neuralNetwork = new NeuralNetwork(config.neural);\\\\n    this.symbolicReasoner = new SymbolicReasoner(config.symbolic);\\\\n    this.integrationLayer = new IntegrationLayer(config.integration);\\\\n  }\\\\n\\\\n  async unifiedInference(query: Query): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\\\n    // 神经网络推理\\\\n    const neuralOutput = await this.neuralNetwork.infer(query);\\\\n\\\\n    // 符号推理\\\\n    const symbolicOutput = await this.symbolicReasoner.reason(query);\\\\n\\\\n    // 统一整合\\\\n    const unifiedResult = await this.integrationLayer.integrate(\\\\n      neuralOutput,\\\\n      symbolicOutput\\\\n    );\\\\n\\\\n    return unifiedResult;\",\"originAcceptText\":\"}\\n```\\n\\n### 神经符号统一实现\\n\\n```typescript\\n// 神经符号统一 - 五高实现\\nexport class NeuroSymbolicUnified {\\n  private readonly neuralNetwork: NeuralNetwork;\\n  private readonly symbolicReasoner: SymbolicReasoner;\\n  private readonly integrationLayer: IntegrationLayer;\\n\\n  constructor(config: NeuroSymbolicConfig) {\\n    this.neuralNetwork = new NeuralNetwork(config.neural);\\n    this.symbolicReasoner = new SymbolicReasoner(config.symbolic);\\n    this.integrationLayer = new IntegrationLayer(config.integration);\\n  }\\n\\n  async unifiedInference(query: Query): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\n    // 神经网络推理\\n    const neuralOutput = await this.neuralNetwork.infer(query);\\n\\n    // 符号推理\\n    const symbolicOutput = await this.symbolicReasoner.reason(query);\\n\\n    // 统一整合\\n    const unifiedResult = await this.integrationLayer.integrate(\\n      neuralOutput,\\n      symbolicOutput\\n    );\\n\\n    return unifiedResult;\",\"originTextLength\":874,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861617},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2604,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2604,\"character\":11}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2604,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2604,\"character\":11}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 边缘云协同实现\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 边缘云协同实现\",\"originTextLength\":11,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861628},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2607,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2615,\"character\":79}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2607,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2615,\"character\":79}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 边缘云协同 - 五高实现\\\\nexport class EdgeCloudCollaboration {\\\\n  private readonly edgeNodes: EdgeNode[];\\\\n  private readonly cloudServices: CloudServices;\\\\n  private readonly collaborationManager: CollaborationManager;\\\\n\\\\n  constructor(config: CollaborationConfig) {\\\\n    this.edgeNodes = config.edgeNodes.map(node => new EdgeNode(node));\\\\n    this.cloudServices = new CloudServices(config.cloud);\\\\n    this.collaborationManager = new CollaborationManager(config.collaboration);\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 边缘云协同 - 五高实现\\nexport class EdgeCloudCollaboration {\\n  private readonly edgeNodes: EdgeNode[];\\n  private readonly cloudServices: CloudServices;\\n  private readonly collaborationManager: CollaborationManager;\\n\\n  constructor(config: CollaborationConfig) {\\n    this.edgeNodes = config.edgeNodes.map(node => new EdgeNode(node));\\n    this.cloudServices = new CloudServices(config.cloud);\\n    this.collaborationManager = new CollaborationManager(config.collaboration);\",\"originTextLength\":462,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861639},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2838,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2848,\"character\":31}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2838,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2848,\"character\":31}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"  async collaborativeInference(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\\\n    // 边缘推理\\\\n    const edgeResult = await this.executeEdgeInference(request);\\\\n\\\\n    // 云端推理\\\\n    const cloudResult = await this.executeCloudInference(request);\\\\n\\\\n    // 协同整合\\\\n    const collaborativeResult = await this.collaborationManager.collaborate(\\\\n      edgeResult,\\\\n      cloudResult\\\\n    );\\\\n\\\\n    return collaborativeResult;\",\"originAcceptText\":\"  async collaborativeInference(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\n    // 边缘推理\\n    const edgeResult = await this.executeEdgeInference(request);\\n\\n    // 云端推理\\n    const cloudResult = await this.executeCloudInference(request);\\n\\n    // 协同整合\\n    const collaborativeResult = await this.collaborationManager.collaborate(\\n      edgeResult,\\n      cloudResult\\n    );\\n\\n    return collaborativeResult;\",\"originTextLength\":408,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861650},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2956,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2958,\"character\":44}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":2956,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":2958,\"character\":44}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"  private async executeEdgeInference(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\\\n    const optimalNode = await this.selectOptimalEdgeNode(request);\\\\n    return await optimalNode.infer(request);\",\"originAcceptText\":\"  private async executeEdgeInference(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\n    const optimalNode = await this.selectOptimalEdgeNode(request);\\n    return await optimalNode.infer(request);\",\"originTextLength\":203,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861661},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3001,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3002,\"character\":51}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3001,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3002,\"character\":51}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"  private async executeCloudInference(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\\\n    return await this.cloudServices.infer(request);\",\"originAcceptText\":\"  private async executeCloudInference(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<InferenceResult> {\\n    return await this.cloudServices.infer(request);\",\"originTextLength\":144,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861672},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3031,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3035,\"character\":6}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3031,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3035,\"character\":6}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"  private async selectOptimalEdgeNode(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<EdgeNode> {\\\\n    return await this.collaborationManager.selectNode(\\\\n      this.edgeNodes,\\\\n      request\\\\n    );\",\"originAcceptText\":\"  private async selectOptimalEdgeNode(request: InferenceRequest): Promise<EdgeNode> {\\n    return await this.collaborationManager.selectNode(\\n      this.edgeNodes,\\n      request\\n    );\",\"originTextLength\":183,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861683},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3087,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3087,\"character\":11}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3087,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3087,\"character\":11}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"## 📊 标准化体系\",\"originAcceptText\":\"## 📊 标准化体系\",\"originTextLength\":11,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861695},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3089,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3089,\"character\":10}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3089,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3089,\"character\":10}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 五标指标体系\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 五标指标体系\",\"originTextLength\":10,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861705},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3092,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3131,\"character\":12}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":3092,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":3131,\"character\":12}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 五标指标 - 标准化体系\\\\nconst standardizationMetrics = {\\\\n  // 1. 技术标准\\\\n  technicalStandards: {\\\\n    quantumComputing: \\\\'Qiskit/Quantum Computing Standard\\\\', // 量子计算标准\\\\n    federatedLearning: \\\\'FL Standard v2.0\\\\', // 联邦学习标准\\\\n    edgeComputing: \\\\'Edge Computing Consortium Standard\\\\', // 边缘计算标准\\\\n    aiGovernance: \\\\'IEEE AI Ethics Standard\\\\' // AI治理标准\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 性能标准\\\\n  performanceStandards: {\\\\n    responseTime: \\\\'≤ 100ms P99\\\\', // 响应时间标准\\\\n    throughput: \\\\'≥ 10000 req/s\\\\', // 吞吐量标准\\\\n    accuracy: \\\\'≥ 95.0%\\\\', // 准确率标准\\\\n    availability: \\\\'≥ 99.9%\\\\' // 可用性标准\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 安全标准\\\\n  securityStandards: {\\\\n    encryption: \\\\'AES-256/Quantum-safe\\\\', // 加密标准\\\\n    authentication: \\\\'OAuth 2.0 + MFA\\\\', // 认证标准\\\\n    authorization: \\\\'RBAC + ABAC\\\\', // 授权标准\\\\n    audit: \\\\'ISO 27001\\\\' // 审计标准\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 质量标准\\\\n  qualityStandards: {\\\\n    codeQuality: \\\\'SonarQube A级\\\\', // 代码质量标准\\\\n    testCoverage: \\\\'≥ 90%\\\\', // 测试覆盖率标准\\\\n    documentation: \\\\'完整的技术文档\\\\', // 文档标准\\\\n    compliance: \\\\'GDPR/CCPA\\\\' // 合规标准\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 运维标准\\\\n  operationsStandards: {\\\\n    deployment: \\\\'CI/CD + GitOps\\\\', // 部署标准\\\\n    monitoring: \\\\'Prometheus + Grafana\\\\', // 监控标准\\\\n    logging: \\\\'ELK Stack\\\\', // 日志标准\\\\n    incident: \\\\'ITIL v4\\\\' // 事件处理标准\\\\n  }\\\\n};\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 🔄 五化指标体系\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 五标指标 - 标准化体系\\nconst standardizationMetrics = {\\n  // 1. 技术标准\\n  technicalStandards: {\\n    quantumComputing: 'Qiskit/Quantum Computing Standard', // 量子计算标准\\n    federatedLearning: 'FL Standard v2.0', // 联邦学习标准\\n    edgeComputing: 'Edge Computing Consortium Standard', // 边缘计算标准\\n    aiGovernance: 'IEEE AI Ethics Standard' // AI治理标准\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 性能标准\\n  performanceStandards: {\\n    responseTime: '≤ 100ms P99', // 响应时间标准\\n    throughput: '≥ 10000 req/s', // 吞吐量标准\\n    accuracy: '≥ 95.0%', // 准确率标准\\n    availability: '≥ 99.9%' // 可用性标准\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 安全标准\\n  securityStandards: {\\n    encryption: 'AES-256/Quantum-safe', // 加密标准\\n    authentication: 'OAuth 2.0 + MFA', // 认证标准\\n    authorization: 'RBAC + ABAC', // 授权标准\\n    audit: 'ISO 27001' // 审计标准\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 质量标准\\n  qualityStandards: {\\n    codeQuality: 'SonarQube A级', // 代码质量标准\\n    testCoverage: '≥ 90%', // 测试覆盖率标准\\n    documentation: '完整的技术文档', // 文档标准\\n    compliance: 'GDPR/CCPA' // 合规标准\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 运维标准\\n  operationsStandards: {\\n    deployment: 'CI/CD + GitOps', // 部署标准\\n    monitoring: 'Prometheus + Grafana', // 监控标准\\n    logging: 'ELK Stack', // 日志标准\\n    incident: 'ITIL v4' // 事件处理标准\\n  }\\n};\\n```\\n\\n## 🔄 五化指标体系\",\"originTextLength\":1162,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861716},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":4314,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":4412,\"character\":82}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":4314,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":4412,\"character\":82}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"// 五化指标 - 转型体系\\\\nconst transformationMetrics = {\\\\n  // 1. 自动化\\\\n  automation: {\\\\n    deploymentAutomation: \\\\'100%\\\\', // 部署自动化率\\\\n    testingAutomation: \\\\'≥ 95%\\\\', // 测试自动化率\\\\n    monitoringAutomation: \\\\'100%\\\\', // 监控自动化率\\\\n    recoveryAutomation: \\\\'≥ 90%\\\\' // 恢复自动化率\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 2. 智能化\\\\n  intelligence: {\\\\n    autoScaling: \\\\'AI驱动\\\\', // 自动扩缩容\\\\n    anomalyDetection: \\\\'ML驱动\\\\', // 异常检测\\\\n    predictiveMaintenance: \\\\'AI驱动\\\\', // 预测性维护\\\\n    intelligentRouting: \\\\'AI驱动\\\\' // 智能路由\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 3. 云原生化\\\\n  cloudNative: {\\\\n    containerization: \\\\'100%\\\\', // 容器化率\\\\n    microservices: \\\\'100%\\\\', // 微服务化率\\\\n    serverless: \\\\'≥ 60%\\\\', // 无服务器化率\\\\n    serviceMesh: \\\\'Istio\\\\' // 服务网格\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 4. 平台化\\\\n  platform: {\\\\n    apiFirst: \\\\'100%\\\\', // API优先率\\\\n    sdkAvailability: \\\\'100%\\\\', // SDK可用性\\\\n    developerPortal: \\\\'完整\\\\', // 开发者门户\\\\n    marketplace: \\\\'集成\\\\' // 市场集成\\\\n  },\\\\n\\\\n  // 5. 生态化\\\\n  ecosystem: {\\\\n    partnerIntegration: \\\\'≥ 50\\\\', // 合作伙伴集成数\\\\n    communityContribution: \\\\'活跃\\\\', // 社区贡献\\\\n    openSource: \\\\'≥ 30%\\\\', // 开源比例\\\\n    standardization: \\\\'主导\\\\' // 标准化主导\\\\n  }\\\\n};\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## ✅ 完成的工作总结\\\\n\\\\n### 📋 主要增强内容\\\\n\\\\n1. **量子启发式算法增强**\\\\n   - 添加了详细的性能指标体系（收敛速度、优化精度、资源利用率、可扩展性）\\\\n   - 完善了错误处理机制和优化策略\\\\n   - 实现了量子经典融合架构\\\\n\\\\n2. **联邦学习系统增强**\\\\n   - 增强了通信机制和收敛策略\\\\n   - 添加了性能监控和异常处理\\\\n   - 实现了隐私保护和安全聚合\\\\n\\\\n3. **边缘智能架构增强**\\\\n   - 完善了边缘AI推理、边缘联邦学习和边缘协同计算\\\\n   - 添加了资源管理和负载均衡机制\\\\n   - 实现了边缘云协同架构\\\\n\\\\n4. **物联网协议栈增强**\\\\n   - 增强了通信协议、设备管理和数据管理\\\\n   - 添加了安全性和可靠性保障机制\\\\n\\\\n5. **神经符号AI增强**\\\\n   - 完善了知识图谱推理、神经符号编程和因果推断\\\\n   - 添加了推理能力和可解释性评估\\\\n   - 实现了神经符号统一架构\\\\n\\\\n6. **可解释AI增强**\\\\n   - 增强了模型解释技术、可信AI和AI治理\\\\n   - 添加了全局和局部解释机制\\\\n\\\\n7. **同态加密增强**\\\\n   - 完善了加密方案、性能优化和应用场景\\\\n   - 添加了安全性和性能评估\\\\n\\\\n8. **安全多方计算增强**\\\\n   - 增强了协议框架、性能优化和实际部署\\\\n   - 添加了隐私保护和效率优化\\\\n\\\\n9. **量子计算集成增强**\\\\n   - 完善了量子算法开发和量子-经典混合计算\\\\n   - 添加了性能评估和错误处理\\\\n\\\\n10. **超大规模数据处理增强**\\\\n    - 增强了实时流处理和图计算系统\\\\n    - 添加了性能监控和容错机制\\\\n\\\\n### 🎯 核心成果\\\\n\\\\n1. **技术融合实现框架**\\\\n   - 量子经典融合实现\\\\n   - 神经符号统一实现\\\\n   - 边缘云协同实现\\\\n   - 隐私安全增强实现\\\\n   - 实时智能决策实现\\\\n\\\\n2. **性能指标体系**\\\\n   - 五高指标（高性能、高可靠、高安全、高扩展、高效率）\\\\n   - 五标指标（标准化体系）\\\\n   - 五化指标（自动化、智能化、云原生化、平台化、生态化）\\\\n\\\\n3. **优化策略体系**\\\\n   - 并行处理优化\\\\n   - 内存优化\\\\n   - 计算优化\\\\n   - 收敛优化\\\\n   - 缓存优化\\\\n\\\\n4. **可靠性保障体系**\\\\n   - 错误处理\\\\n   - 容错机制\\\\n   - 监控机制\\\\n   - 恢复机制\\\\n   - 验证机制\\\\n\\\\n所有增强内容都基于\\\\\\\"五高五标五化\\\\\\\"核心机制，并包含了详细的性能指标、错误处理和优化策略，确保系统在量子启发式算法、联邦学习、边缘智能等前沿技术领域达到业界领先水平。\",\"originAcceptText\":\"// 五化指标 - 转型体系\\nconst transformationMetrics = {\\n  // 1. 自动化\\n  automation: {\\n    deploymentAutomation: '100%', // 部署自动化率\\n    testingAutomation: '≥ 95%', // 测试自动化率\\n    monitoringAutomation: '100%', // 监控自动化率\\n    recoveryAutomation: '≥ 90%' // 恢复自动化率\\n  },\\n\\n  // 2. 智能化\\n  intelligence: {\\n    autoScaling: 'AI驱动', // 自动扩缩容\\n    anomalyDetection: 'ML驱动', // 异常检测\\n    predictiveMaintenance: 'AI驱动', // 预测性维护\\n    intelligentRouting: 'AI驱动' // 智能路由\\n  },\\n\\n  // 3. 云原生化\\n  cloudNative: {\\n    containerization: '100%', // 容器化率\\n    microservices: '100%', // 微服务化率\\n    serverless: '≥ 60%', // 无服务器化率\\n    serviceMesh: 'Istio' // 服务网格\\n  },\\n\\n  // 4. 平台化\\n  platform: {\\n    apiFirst: '100%', // API优先率\\n    sdkAvailability: '100%', // SDK可用性\\n    developerPortal: '完整', // 开发者门户\\n    marketplace: '集成' // 市场集成\\n  },\\n\\n  // 5. 生态化\\n  ecosystem: {\\n    partnerIntegration: '≥ 50', // 合作伙伴集成数\\n    communityContribution: '活跃', // 社区贡献\\n    openSource: '≥ 30%', // 开源比例\\n    standardization: '主导' // 标准化主导\\n  }\\n};\\n```\\n\\n## ✅ 完成的工作总结\\n\\n### 📋 主要增强内容\\n\\n1. **量子启发式算法增强**\\n   - 添加了详细的性能指标体系（收敛速度、优化精度、资源利用率、可扩展性）\\n   - 完善了错误处理机制和优化策略\\n   - 实现了量子经典融合架构\\n\\n2. **联邦学习系统增强**\\n   - 增强了通信机制和收敛策略\\n   - 添加了性能监控和异常处理\\n   - 实现了隐私保护和安全聚合\\n\\n3. **边缘智能架构增强**\\n   - 完善了边缘AI推理、边缘联邦学习和边缘协同计算\\n   - 添加了资源管理和负载均衡机制\\n   - 实现了边缘云协同架构\\n\\n4. **物联网协议栈增强**\\n   - 增强了通信协议、设备管理和数据管理\\n   - 添加了安全性和可靠性保障机制\\n\\n5. **神经符号AI增强**\\n   - 完善了知识图谱推理、神经符号编程和因果推断\\n   - 添加了推理能力和可解释性评估\\n   - 实现了神经符号统一架构\\n\\n6. **可解释AI增强**\\n   - 增强了模型解释技术、可信AI和AI治理\\n   - 添加了全局和局部解释机制\\n\\n7. **同态加密增强**\\n   - 完善了加密方案、性能优化和应用场景\\n   - 添加了安全性和性能评估\\n\\n8. **安全多方计算增强**\\n   - 增强了协议框架、性能优化和实际部署\\n   - 添加了隐私保护和效率优化\\n\\n9. **量子计算集成增强**\\n   - 完善了量子算法开发和量子-经典混合计算\\n   - 添加了性能评估和错误处理\\n\\n10. **超大规模数据处理增强**\\n    - 增强了实时流处理和图计算系统\\n    - 添加了性能监控和容错机制\\n\\n### 🎯 核心成果\\n\\n1. **技术融合实现框架**\\n   - 量子经典融合实现\\n   - 神经符号统一实现\\n   - 边缘云协同实现\\n   - 隐私安全增强实现\\n   - 实时智能决策实现\\n\\n2. **性能指标体系**\\n   - 五高指标（高性能、高可靠、高安全、高扩展、高效率）\\n   - 五标指标（标准化体系）\\n   - 五化指标（自动化、智能化、云原生化、平台化、生态化）\\n\\n3. **优化策略体系**\\n   - 并行处理优化\\n   - 内存优化\\n   - 计算优化\\n   - 收敛优化\\n   - 缓存优化\\n\\n4. **可靠性保障体系**\\n   - 错误处理\\n   - 容错机制\\n   - 监控机制\\n   - 恢复机制\\n   - 验证机制\\n\\n所有增强内容都基于\\\"五高五标五化\\\"核心机制，并包含了详细的性能指标、错误处理和优化策略，确保系统在量子启发式算法、联邦学习、边缘智能等前沿技术领域达到业界领先水平。\",\"originTextLength\":2101,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1767741861727}]",
