.phone,\\n      reminderType: rule.reminderType,\\n      title: rule.name,\\n      content,\\n      channel: rule.channel,\\n      priority: rule.priority,\\n      scheduledAt: new Date(),\\n      sentAt: null,\\n      status: 'pending',\\n      result: null,\\n      createdAt: new Date()\\n    }\\n\\n    await this.reminderRepository.save(reminder)\\n    return reminder\\n  }\\n\\n  async sendReminder(reminderId: string): Promise<CareReminder> {\\n    const reminder = await this.reminderRepository.findById(reminderId)\\n\\n    if (!reminder) {\\n      throw new Error('提醒不存在')\\n    }\\n\\n    const result = await this.sendChannelMessage(reminder)\\n\\n    reminder.sentAt = new Date()\\n    reminder.status = 'sent'\\n    reminder.result = result\\n\\n    await this.reminderRepository.save(reminder)\\n    return reminder\\n  }\\n\\n  private async sendChannelMessage(reminder: CareReminder): Promise<any> {\\n    switch (reminder.channel) {\\n      case 'sms':\\n        return await this.smsService.send(reminder.customerPhone, reminder.content)\\n      case 'email':\\n        return await this.emailService.send(reminder.customerPhone, reminder.title, reminder.content)\\n      case 'push':\\n        return await this.pushService.send(reminder.customerId, reminder.title, reminder.content)\\n      default:\\n        throw new Error('不支持的发送渠道')\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async getReminderStatistics(startDate?: Date, endDate?: Date): Promise<CareReminderStatistics> {\\n    const reminders = await this.reminderRepository.findByDateRange(startDate, endDate)\\n\\n    const totalReminders = reminders.length\\n    const pendingCount = reminders.filter(r => r.status === 'pending').length\\n    const sentCount = reminders.filter(r => r.status === 'sent').length\\n    const failedCount = reminders.filter(r => r.status === 'failed').length\\n\\n    const highPriorityCount = reminders.filter(r => r.priority === 'high').length\\n    const mediumPriorityCount = reminders.filter(r => r.priority === 'medium').length\\n    const lowPriorityCount = reminders.filter(r => r.priority === 'low').length\\n\\n    const topUsedTypes = this.calculateTopUsedTypes(reminders)\\n\\n    return {\\n      totalReminders,\\n      pendingCount,\\n      sentCount,\\n      failedCount,\\n      highPriorityCount,\\n      mediumPriorityCount,\\n      lowPriorityCount,\\n      topUsedTypes\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private calculateTopUsedTypes(reminders: CareReminder[]): any[] {\\n    const typeMap = new Map<string, number>()\\n\\n    reminders.forEach(reminder => {\\n      const count = typeMap.get(reminder.reminderType) || 0\\n      typeMap.set(reminder.reminderType, count + 1)\\n    })\",\"originTextLength\":6234,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914454942},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1090,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1093,\"character\":19}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":1090,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":1093,\"character\":19}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"    return Array.from(typeMap.entries())\\\\n      .map(([type, count]) => ({ type, count }))\\\\n      .sort((a, b) => b.count - a.count)\\\\n      .slice(0, 10)\",\"originAcceptText\":\"    return Array.from(typeMap.entries())\\n      .map(([type, count]) => ({ type, count }))\\n      .sort((a, b) => b.count - a.count)\\n      .slice(0, 10)\",\"originTextLength\":150,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914454967}]",
  "range-cache-file:///Users/my/Downloads/yyc3-catering-platform/docs/YYC3-Cater-Platform-%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E9%97%AD%E7%8E%AF/YYC3-Cater-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3/%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86API%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.md": "[{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":21,\"character\":3}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":0,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":21,\"character\":3}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"# YYC³餐饮行业智能化平台 - 客户生命周期管理API接口文档\\\\n\\\\n## 文档信息\\\\n\\\\n| 项目 | 内容 |\\\\n|------|------|\\\\n| 文档名称 | YYC³餐饮行业智能化平台客户生命周期管理API接口文档 |\\\\n| 文档版本 | v1.0.0 |\\\\n| 创建日期 | 2026-01-20 |\\\\n| 最后更新 | 2026-01-20 |\\\\n| 文档状态 | 正式版 |\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 目录\\\\n\\\\n1. [接口概述](#1-接口概述)\\\\n2. [通用说明](#2-通用说明)\\\\n3. [客户生命周期接口](#3-客户生命周期接口)\\\\n4. [RFM分析接口](#4-rfm分析接口)\\\\n5. [流失预测接口](#5-流失预测接口)\\\\n6. [关怀提醒接口](#6-关怀提醒接口)\\\\n7. [客户分群接口](#7-客户分群接口)\\\\n8. [客户标签接口](#8-客户标签接口)\\\\n9. [错误码说明](#9-错误码说明)\\\\n10. [附录](#10-附录)\\\\n\\\\n---\",\"originAcceptText\":\"# YYC³餐饮行业智能化平台 - 客户生命周期管理API接口文档\\n\\n## 文档信息\\n\\n| 项目 | 内容 |\\n|------|------|\\n| 文档名称 | YYC³餐饮行业智能化平台客户生命周期管理API接口文档 |\\n| 文档版本 | v1.0.0 |\\n| 创建日期 | 2026-01-20 |\\n| 最后更新 | 2026-01-20 |\\n| 文档状态 | 正式版 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 目录\\n\\n1. [接口概述](#1-接口概述)\\n2. [通用说明](#2-通用说明)\\n3. [客户生命周期接口](#3-客户生命周期接口)\\n4. [RFM分析接口](#4-rfm分析接口)\\n5. [流失预测接口](#5-流失预测接口)\\n6. [关怀提醒接口](#6-关怀提醒接口)\\n7. [客户分群接口](#7-客户分群接口)\\n8. [客户标签接口](#8-客户标签接口)\\n9. [错误码说明](#9-错误码说明)\\n10. [附录](#10-附录)\\n\\n---\",\"originTextLength\":426,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042398},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":4,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"character\":75}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":4,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"character\":75}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 1.1 接口说明\\\\n\\\\n本文档描述YYC³餐饮行业智能化平台客户生命周期管理相关的API接口，包括客户生命周期管理、RFM分析、流失预测、关怀提醒、客户分群、客户标签等功能。\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 1.1 接口说明\\n\\n本文档描述YYC³餐饮行业智能化平台客户生命周期管理相关的API接口，包括客户生命周期管理、RFM分析、流失预测、关怀提醒、客户分群、客户标签等功能。\",\"originTextLength\":89,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042457},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":6,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":9,\"character\":12}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":6,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":9,\"character\":12}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"### 1.2 接口地址\\\\n\\\\n- **测试环境**：`http://test-api.yyc3.com/api/v1`\\\\n- **生产环境**：`https://api.yyc3.com/api/v1`\\\\n\\\\n### 1.3 认证方式\",\"originAcceptText\":\"### 1.2 接口地址\\n\\n- **测试环境**：`http://test-api.yyc3.com/api/v1`\\n- **生产环境**：`https://api.yyc3.com/api/v1`\\n\\n### 1.3 认证方式\",\"originTextLength\":113,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042497},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":8,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":8,\"character\":21}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":8,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":8,\"character\":21}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"所有接口需要在请求头中携带认证Token：\",\"originAcceptText\":\"所有接口需要在请求头中携带认证Token：\",\"originTextLength\":21,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042537},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":10,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":10,\"character\":7}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":10,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":10,\"character\":7}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"```http\",\"originAcceptText\":\"```http\",\"originTextLength\":7,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042566},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":14,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":73,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":14,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":73,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"---\\\\n\\\\n## 2. 通用说明\\\\n\\\\n### 2.1 请求格式\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.1 GET请求\\\\n\\\\n```http\\\\nGET /api/v1/customers?page=1&size=20\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.2 POST请求\\\\n\\\\n```http\\\\nPOST /api/v1/customers\\\\nContent-Type: application/json\\\\n\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"张三\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"phone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"13800138000\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.3 PUT请求\\\\n\\\\n```http\\\\nPUT /api/v1/customers/{id}\\\\nContent-Type: application/json\\\\n\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"张三\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"email\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"zhangsan@example.com\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.1.4 DELETE请求\\\\n\\\\n```http\\\\nDELETE /api/v1/customers/{id}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 2.2 响应格式\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.2.1 成功响应\\\\n\\\\n```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"code\\\\\\\": 200,\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"success\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    // 响应数据\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n#### 2.2.2 失败响应\\\\n\\\\n```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"code\\\\\\\": 400,\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"参数错误\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"errors\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"field\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"客户名称不能为空\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 2.3 分页参数\\\\n\\\\n| 参数名 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |\\\\n|--------|------|------|------|\\\\n| page | number | 否 | 页码，默认1 |\\\\n| size | number | 否 | 每页数量，默认20 |\\\\n\\\\n### 2.4 分页响应\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"---\\n\\n## 2. 通用说明\\n\\n### 2.1 请求格式\\n\\n#### 2.1.1 GET请求\\n\\n```http\\nGET /api/v1/customers?page=1&size=20\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.1.2 POST请求\\n\\n```http\\nPOST /api/v1/customers\\nContent-Type: application/json\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"张三\\\",\\n  \\\"phone\\\": \\\"13800138000\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.1.3 PUT请求\\n\\n```http\\nPUT /api/v1/customers/{id}\\nContent-Type: application/json\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"张三\\\",\\n  \\\"email\\\": \\\"zhangsan@example.com\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.1.4 DELETE请求\\n\\n```http\\nDELETE /api/v1/customers/{id}\\n```\\n\\n### 2.2 响应格式\\n\\n#### 2.2.1 成功响应\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"code\\\": 200,\\n  \\\"message\\\": \\\"success\\\",\\n  \\\"data\\\": {\\n    // 响应数据\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n#### 2.2.2 失败响应\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"code\\\": 400,\\n  \\\"message\\\": \\\"参数错误\\\",\\n  \\\"errors\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"field\\\": \\\"name\\\",\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"客户名称不能为空\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### 2.3 分页参数\\n\\n| 参数名 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |\\n|--------|------|------|------|\\n| page | number | 否 | 页码，默认1 |\\n| size | number | 否 | 每页数量，默认20 |\\n\\n### 2.4 分页响应\\n\",\"originTextLength\":853,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042597},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":84,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":110,\"character\":0}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":84,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":110,\"character\":0}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"  \\\\\\\"code\\\\\\\": 200,\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"success\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\": [\\\\n      // 数据列表\\\\n    ],\\\\n    \\\\\\\"total\\\\\\\": 100,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"page\\\\\\\": 1,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"size\\\\\\\": 20\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 3. 客户生命周期接口\\\\n\\\\n### 3.1 获取客户生命周期信息\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.1 接口说明\\\\n\\\\n获取指定客户的生命周期信息。\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.2 请求方式\\\\n\\\\n```http\\\\nGET /api/v1/customers/{customerId}/lifecycle\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.3 请求参数\\\\n\\\\n| 参数名 | 类型 | 位置 | 必填 | 说明 |\\\\n|--------|------|------|------|------|\\\\n| customerId | string | path | 是 | 客户ID |\\\\n\\\\n#### 3.1.4 响应示例\\\\n\",\"originAcceptText\":\"  \\\"code\\\": 200,\\n  \\\"message\\\": \\\"success\\\",\\n  \\\"data\\\": {\\n    \\\"data\\\": [\\n      // 数据列表\\n    ],\\n    \\\"total\\\": 100,\\n    \\\"page\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"size\\\": 20\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. 客户生命周期接口\\n\\n### 3.1 获取客户生命周期信息\\n\\n#### 3.1.1 接口说明\\n\\n获取指定客户的生命周期信息。\\n\\n#### 3.1.2 请求方式\\n\\n```http\\nGET /api/v1/customers/{customerId}/lifecycle\\n```\\n\\n#### 3.1.3 请求参数\\n\\n| 参数名 | 类型 | 位置 | 必填 | 说明 |\\n|--------|------|------|------|------|\\n| customerId | string | path | 是 | 客户ID |\\n\\n#### 3.1.4 响应示例\\n\",\"originTextLength\":437,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042629},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":97,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":98,\"character\":23}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":97,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":98,\"character\":23}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"  \\\\\\\"code\\\\\\\": 200,\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"success\\\\\\\",\",\"originAcceptText\":\"  \\\"code\\\": 200,\\n  \\\"message\\\": \\\"success\\\",\",\"originTextLength\":38,\"aiScene\":\"builder\",\"behaviorType\":\"accept\",\"updateTime\":1768914042654},{\"originRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":100,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":112,\"character\":39}},\"modifyRange\":{\"start\":{\"line\":100,\"character\":0},\"end\":{\"line\":112,\"character\":39}},\"action\":\"None\",\"isLine\":false,\"originText\":\"    \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"lifecycle-001\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"customerId\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"customer-001\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"currentStage\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"active\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"previousStage\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"new\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"stageChangedAt\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-01-15T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"daysInCurrentStage\\\\\\\": 5,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"totalDaysInLifecycle\\\\\\\": 30,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\": {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"rfmScore\\\\\\\": 12,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"customerLevel\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"VIP\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    \\\\\\\"createdAt\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"updatedAt\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2026-01-20T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\"\",\"originAcceptText\":\"    \\\"id\\\": \\\"lifecycle-001\\\",\\n    \\\"customerId\\\": \\\"customer-001\\\",\\n    \\\"currentStage\\\": \\\"active\\\",\\n    \\\"previousStage\\\": \\\"new\\\",\\